window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4201,"title":"Chapter 4201 Lust","paragraphs":["Chapter 4201: Lust","Chapter 4201: Lust Editor: Henyee Translations","If his surname was Li, did that mean he was not Ye Jian’s biological cousin?","Why did they look like biological cousins?","No, no.","Little Jian had mentioned in the past that she was the only daughter in the family.","Her parents had passed away, and she had a wicked female cousin who came to school.","However, she had never mentioned that she had a male cousin.","A god-cousin?","Xu Wen was the first to reach out her hand and introduce herself.","“Hello, Brother Li.","I’m Xu Wen, Jian’s roommate and comrade.","We’re in the same class.”","He Jing also reached out her hand to introduce herself.","She was much more restrained than Xu Wen.","The smile on her face was a little stiff.","“Brother Li, hello.","I’m He Jing.","I’m in the same class as Jian as well.","We live in the same dormitory.”","“Hello.”","Li Jinnian reached out his hand and shook their hands gentlemanly.","Although he was cold and didn’t look easy to get close to, he would never make things difficult for others.","The chivalry amidst all that coldness made the women’s tense hearts relax a little.","The thoughts in their hearts were written all over their faces.","Li Jinnian and Xia Jinyuan saw through them at a glance.","Ye Jian smiled and said, “He’s my cousin.","The situation is a little complicated.","I’ll tell you about it in the future.","“Have you completed all the procedures?","If not, we’ll go and settle them now.","We’ll have lunch outside before going back together.”","Xu Wen felt that if she were to eat with Ye Jian’s boyfriend and cousin! She was worried that she would have indigestion, but she had to put up with it.","He Jing said, “All the procedures have been completed.","We’re just waiting for the medicine to be delivered.","I’ll go and ask about it.”","She didn’t dare to stay in the ward anymore.","Ye Jian’s boyfriend already had a powerful aura.","In the end, another man with a powerful aura had appeared.","He Jing felt so pressured that she couldn’t breathe properly.","Xu Wen was the same.","She immediately said, “I’ll accompany you to take a look.” After she finished speaking, she pulled Ye Jian along and smiled at the two people who made her frightened.","Then, the three of them left the ward.","After coming out of the ward, Xu Wen patted her chest and said with lingering fear, “Oh my god, I was so nervous.","Why did it feel like I was being reviewed when I was standing in front of your boyfriend and your cousin?","I didn’t even dare to breathe loudly.”","“Me too.","I was so nervous that I almost fainted.” He Jing didn’t pat her chest, but from her expression, it could be seen that she was as nervous as Xu Wen.","“One look and I can tell that your cousin is a powerful figure.","Jian, if your boyfriend dares to bully you in the future, you don’t have to look for anyone else.","Finding your cousin will definitely work.”","He Jing was right.","If Xia Jinyuan dared to bully Ye Jian, the first person who wouldn’t forgive him was Li Jinnian.","In the ward, Xia Jinyuan laughed and said, “Look, the moment you came, you scared the two young ladies away.","At least smile a little.","Don’t be so cold.","You might not be able to find a girlfriend this way.","“Ye Jian and I are still waiting for you to introduce your girlfriend to us.”","“You know that these ladies are young, but you still laid a hand on my cousin?” Li Jinnian hit the nail on the head.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but cover his mouth and cough softly.","“That’s different.","Their mindset is still immature.","When they saw you, they were like mice that saw a cat.","They won’t be able to withstand anything.” He meant to say that Ye Jian was mature.","Li Jinnian glanced at him coldly and said, “Shameless, lecherous!”","Last night, he wanted to scold him, but he endured it because Ye Jian was present.","Now that Ye Jian had left, Li Jinnian felt better."]},{"number":4202,"title":"Chapter 4202 Simple Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 4202: Simple Family","Chapter 4202: Simple Family Editor: Henyee Translations","Shameless and lecherous!","Li Jinnian definitely had to talk to his cousin alone.","She had to be wary of this fellow!","Xia Jinyuan’s mouth twitched a few times when he heard these words.","He was just being intimate with his girlfriend.","Why did it become shameless and lecherous behavior in his cousin-in-law’s eyes?","‘Fine, fine, fine.","You’re my cousin-in-law.","Everything you say makes sense.","I won’t say anything else.’","After his cousin-in-law found a girlfriend, he would have a lot of chances to counter-attack.","It was already noon when they came out of the hospital.","The five of them didn’t eat near the hospital.","Instead, they chose a place closer to the school.","The biggest problem with eating near the school was that! they could meet students who were returning to school at any time.","After three waves of students came to greet Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan stood up and closed the door to their private room.","They didn’t meet students from the same class as Ye Jian but other classes.","One of them was a fourth-year student.","His lover was indeed a famous figure in the National Science University.","Everyone probably knew her.","Xia Jinyuan, who had been to the military school many times, knew that Ye Jian was very popular among the students.","However, Li Jinnian didn’t know that.","Today, he saw it for himself.","There was one batch of fourth-year students and two batches of third-year students from different classes and faculties.","From this, it could be seen how popular his cousin was.","He Jing and Xu Wen were very calm.","They were already used to it.","Whenever they walked into the campus, they had to stop and chat with the students who recognized Ye Jian.","In the end, the two of them discussed that if they were coming back from the laboratory, they would definitely walk separately from Ye Jian.","The laboratory was far away to begin with.","If they delayed a little more, they would have to walk for an hour before they could return to the dormitory.","The two of them didn’t have indigestion during the meal.","Instead, they could see the etiquette of Li Jinnian and Xia Jinyuan at the dining table.","They could tell that they came from good families through this meal together.","They were elegant when they ate.","Xu Wen, who always thought that she had interacted with the upper-class society, felt deeply ashamed.","She had only gotten into contact with the surface level.","The people and things Ye Jian interacted with were not something she could touch.","After returning to school, Xu Wen said to He Jing, “I feel that Jian’s family background is not simple.","If Brother Li is Jian’s biological cousin, why isn’t Jian’s surname Li but Ye?”","“One takes their father’s surname while the other takes their mother’s.","It’s easy to understand.” He Jing didn’t think too much about it.","So what if Ye Jian’s family background was not simple?","Ye Jian was Ye Jian.","What did it matter if her family background was not simple?","Xu Wen took out a small stool and sat down.","She thought about it carefully.","After thinking for a while, she shook her head and said, “No, that’s definitely not the case.","Jian’s mother’s surname is Sun.”","“Why are you thinking so much about it?","Will Ye Jian’s background affect the Ye Jian we know?","Hurry up and unpack your things.” He Jing didn’t think about these things.","There was nothing to think about.","Ye Jian was Ye Jian.","As for the identities of Ye Jian’s cousin’s and her, it had nothing to do with her.","Xu Wen, who always liked to think about these things, continued to think about it.","That made sense.","Ye Jian’s background was good.","She was still the Ye Jian they knew.","In that case, what was there to think about?","She didn’t think about it anymore.","She should unpack her things.","Ye Jian, who didn’t return to the dormitory, was sitting in the dean’s office.","Ever since she and Xia Jinyuan entered the dean’s office, the office was filled with the laughter of the dean."]},{"number":4203,"title":"Chapter 4203 Comrade Xia’s Sadness","paragraphs":["Chapter 4203: Comrade Xia’s Sadness","Chapter 4203: Comrade Xia’s Sadness Editor: Henyee Translations","When Xia Jinyuan was in his first year, the dean was still his instructor.","Even though Xia Jinyuan had graduated for so many years, he had always been in contact with the dean.","The dean was very happy about the arrival of his favorite student.","At this moment, he saw that Xia Jinyuan was familiar with Ye Jian, who had always been an influential figure in the school.","He praised her repeatedly, “Birds of a feather flock together!","The two of you are the best examples.","I didn’t expect you to know each other even though you’re so many years older than Ye Jian, Jinyuan.","You’re fated!”","Xia Jinyuan smiled as he looked at his girlfriend who was sitting respectfully with her back straight.","Her hands were naturally placed on her knees, and she was sitting in a standard meeting posture.","The smile in his eyes was like ripples.","He agreed with the dean and said, “That’s right.","I’m indeed fated with her.","Previously, when she introduced herself as a student of the National Science University, I was quite shocked.","I didn’t expect a junior to be so powerful.”","“Hahaha, your junior is extraordinary.","She’s quite impressive.","She stunned the instructor during the first-year military training and made the third-year students panic.","The student has surpassed the master.","She’s as impressive as you were in the past!","Our school leader has high hopes for her.","He hopes that she can maintain her current results and become a lieutenant when she graduates.”","A lieutenant?","The smile on Xia Jinyuan’s face became meaningful.","A lieutenant.","No, no, no.","With the little fox’s current military merits, she should fight for the rank of major.","As for a lieutenant colonel, she was still lacking.","She needed to train for another three years or so.","Their military ranks were all military merits.","They weren’t things that ordinary military school students would bring up.","First lieutenant, lieutenant, major, lieutenant colonel! They were all military merits that were exchanged with their lives.","The value of the military medal was real!","The dean knew that the two of them knew each other.","In order to motivate Ye Jian to work harder, he told Ye Jian many things about Xia Jinyuan, things that Xia Jinyuan had never mentioned.","Every sentence, he would scold this young brat with a smile.","His disdainful tone couldn’t hide his admiration, though.","Ye Jian enjoyed it.","Li Jinnian came for work and went straight to the dean’s office.","After he was done, he went to his room to rest for a while before receiving a call from Xia Jinyuan.","It was already five in the evening.","It was time for the students to have dinner.","Ye Jian didn’t eat with the two of them.","She had dinner with her classmates.","She didn’t rush over to meet Li Jinnian until the night was over.","Ye Jian didn’t have much time now that she was back in school.","She didn’t even have the time to date Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was also staying in the school.","His room was right next door to Li Jinnian.","She met him in a hurry at night, and they chatted for less than half an hour before she left.","There were too many things to do, so she didn’t have time to date.","Fortunately, Xia Jinyuan wasn’t resting all day either.","The next morning, the dean of the department took him to teach the fourth-year students.","In the end, he was even busier than Ye Jian.","He had to squeeze out time for lunch.","Xia Jinyuan thought that when Ye Jian was resting, the two of them could stroll around the campus and enjoy their time together.","Who knew that he would be so busy that Ye Jian was the one who had to come and look for him?","It was completely against his original intention of staying in the school!","He didn’t have much time, but Li Jinnian had much more time.","He could even have lunch with his cousin in the afternoon and go to the training ground after that to see Ye Jian’s glory.","At night, they would have dinner together.","Xia Jinyuan gritted his teeth when he found out.","At the end of the third day, he immediately went to look for the dean and said that he only had ten days of vacation.","He asked the magnanimous dean to let him off so that he could have a good rest and recuperate for the next three days."]},{"number":4204,"title":"Chapter 4204 A Miracle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4204: A Miracle","Chapter 4204: A Miracle Editor: Henyee Translations","The dean felt that it wasn’t kind to take up all his holidays.","He smiled and let Xia Jinyuan off.","“Hahaha, it’s been hard on you.","The students’ response was very good.","I can’t bear to let you leave.","Jinyuan, you should return to your alma mater more often in the future.","Take some time to guide your juniors.”","In order to see Ye Jian as soon as possible, everything was settled.","The dean nodded and let Xia Jinyuan leave with a smile.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia walked out of the dean’s office.","His bitter expression instantly changed.","He took a step with his long legs.","His target was Ye Jian!","He had to have dinner with his woman tonight!","Thinking that he would be able to eat with the woman he loved so much soon, Lieutenant Colonel Xia almost whistled.","He went down the stairs happily.","Suddenly, Lieutenant Colonel Xia stopped in his tracks.","He slowly retreated.","He wanted to change his way of going downstairs.","He planned to go up to the second floor and leave the office through the water pipe outside the window.","He wondered if it was too late to do that.","“What’s up?","Are you still busy?”","Li Jinnian looked coldly at Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had taken two steps back.","His thin lips moved slightly, and his words were as clear as an announcer’s.","“If you’re not done with your things, I’ll wait a little longer.”","Obviously, Lieutenant Colonel Xia didn’t have time to take a different route.","His cousin-in-law, who was specially guarding here, had already caught him.","“I just remembered that there’s one more thing I want to talk to the dean about.","Are you looking for me because of something urgent?” Xia Jinyuan didn’t move.","He stood in the stairway that was only two steps away from the first floor.","He had no intention of going down.","His cousin-in-law was the most difficult to deal with in the little fox’s family.","Li Jinnian was even harder to deal with than his future father-in-law.","Li Jinnian had a bad temper and wouldn’t listen to coaxing or give in to force.","Xia Jinyuan, who was in a hurry to have dinner with Ye Jian, smiled at his cousin-in-law and waited for him to make a move.","“My cousin was called by the instructor to do something just now.","She doesn’t have time for dinner.”","“Since you’re waiting for me, there must be something important,” Xia Jinyuan replied readily.","He walked down the stairs and walked toward his cousin-in-law.","“Don’t you have something to talk to the dean about?”","“It’s not a big deal.","I can just talk to him tomorrow.”","“Really?” Li Jinnian almost sneered.","Xia Jinyuan, who had always been shameless, nodded elegantly and replied, “Yes.”","Since Xia Jinyuan was left with no choice, he would accompany his cousin-in-law first.","They would be family in the future.","It was not bad to interact with him more.","The corners of Li Jinnian’s mouth moved slightly.","He couldn’t understand why someone could lie without any fear.","Commander Xia was a righteous person.","He didn’t like people who were cunning with their words.","Giving birth to a son like Xia Jinyuan was like going against nature.","With Commander Xia’s personality, Li Jinnian felt that it was a miracle that Xia Jinyuan was still alive.","Then, he looked at Xia Jinyuan, who was standing in front of him.","Xia Jinyuan had a scoundrel’s personality, a roguish smile, and a face that he wanted to kick a few times.","Li Jinnian frowned slightly and asked a question that had been lingering in his heart for a long time, “Do you always butt heads with Commander Xia whenever you meet?”","His question made Xia Jinyuan squint slightly.","He needed to think about how to answer.","In an instant, Xia Jinyuan had an answer in his heart.","He smiled and said, “Back then we were just short of shooting at each other with guns.","I always thought that it was a miracle that I could grow up under my father’s watch.”"]},{"number":4205,"title":"Chapter 4205 The Fight Between The Two","paragraphs":["Chapter 4205: The Fight Between The Two","Chapter 4205: The Fight Between The Two Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Jinnian’s expression froze for a second.","He nodded and said calmly, “I think so too.","It’s indeed a miracle that you’re still alive.","“You’re not the only one who thinks so.","Even Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia think so too.","Hence, Commander Xia said that if I don’t marry Ye Jian and let her join the Xia family, I won’t be able to enter the Xia family anymore.","He’ll directly acknowledge Ye Jian as his goddaughter.","“My dad is probably waiting for that day.","Every time he meets Ye Jian, he’ll remind Ye Jian not to give me a good attitude and that she shouldn’t treat me too well.","He tells her not to give in to me! I already suspect that I’m not a descendant of the Xia family.","I must be a descendant of Commander Xia’s enemy.”","Li Jinnian wanted to laugh, but he didn’t want to do it in front of the fellow who was going to spar with him later.","He didn’t want to lose before he even started.","However, Li Jinnian’s facial expression softened.","From Xia Jinyuan’s words, he could tell that Commander Xia liked his cousin very much.","“I planned to accompany Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia for one night before rushing over to look for Ye Jian the next day.","Unexpectedly, when the two elders heard that, they couldn’t tolerate me wasting time at home and immediately arranged for a car and booked a plane ticket.","In less than ten minutes, they chased me out of the house and into the car.","“I have a feeling that when Ye Jian marries me one day, I’ll no longer have a status in the Xia family.","The entire family will only dote on Ye Jian.","As for me, I’m not very likable to begin with.","I can only stay there.”","Xia Jinyuan let out a long sigh.","Li Jinnian raised his eyebrows and said two words to express his opinion.","“Not bad.”","Not bad.","In the future, when his cousin married into the Xia family, he would feel at ease.","Grandpa was the one who understood everything.","He knew that the Xia family would be the best home for his cousin.","Hence, from the start, Grandpa was very happy for his cousin to be with Xia Jinyuan.","Besides not wanting Ye Jian to get married early, Grandpa was very satisfied with everything else.","Li Jinnian brought Xia Jinyuan to the training hall in the school.","Xia Jinyuan was very familiar with everything about the National Science University.","As soon as he turned the corner, he knew what was in front of him.","Now, he understood why Li Jinnian had caught him.","“Let’s do it for real today.","Let’s see how strong we are,” Li Jinnian said calmly and entered the training hall first.","Xia Jinyuan followed.","There was no need to say anything else.","When they reached the training hall, they took off their clothes and applied some talcum powder on their hands.","After loosening their muscles and stretching a little, the two of them knew what they were going to do next.","They shook hands with each other and punched almost at the same time.","The most recent spar between the two of them was a few years ago.","After that, they never sparred during the training.","Now, neither of them would give in.","When they punched, it would be like the wind.","When hit, both the person who hit and the person who got hit would be in so much pain that their pupils would constrict.","Xia Jinyuan knew why Li Jinnian wanted to spar with him.","Li Jinnian knew that in the future, he wouldn’t be the one standing beside Ye Jian.","It would be Xia Jinyuan, Ye Jian’s boyfriend and future husband.","He needed to know if Xia Jinyuan had the ability to make him feel at ease.","Even though Xia Jinyuan already knew that he had the ability to stand beside Ye Jian, his cousin-in-law still wanted to test him.","After testing him once, Li Jinnian wouldn’t object anymore.","After testing once, Xia Jinyuan’s path to marrying would be extended again if he lost to Li Jinnian.","Hence, Xia Jinyuan had to win today.","He had to win beautifully!"]},{"number":4206,"title":"Chapter 4206 Intense Fight","paragraphs":["Chapter 4206: Intense Fight","Chapter 4206: Intense Fight Editor: Henyee Translations","One was fighting for his cousin’s happiness, while the other was fighting for his own happiness.","When the two of them became ruthless, they were like fierce wolves.","Every punch and kick was ruthless.","The sparring made some students who were training in the training hall avoid them.","Were these the new instructors?","Why were they so ruthless when they went on stage?","Killing intent and viciousness coexisted.","Although the students couldn’t see the two men’s bodies directly, they could feel the air of violence.","An instructor immediately separated the students to prevent them from being accidentally injured.","This was not an ordinary fight.","Once an accidental injury occurred, even their bones would be broken.","The serious-looking instructor separated the students.","Another one of the instructors called the duty room just in case.","This attracted the attention of the people in the duty room.","Then, they immediately contacted the General Affairs Department.","In less than five minutes, the serious-looking instructor knew who the two people fighting were.","He definitely didn’t know their exact identities and positions.","He only needed to know that one of them, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, was once an influential figure in the military school.","The other was said to be a special forces soldier sent by the navy.","He knew that the two of them were old acquaintances, so there was no crisis.","The instructor hurriedly ordered the students to sit down.","“This man is the most famous person in the military school in the past nine years.","He’s equivalent to the current influential person, Ye Jian.","His comprehensive physical fitness is especially impressive.","He was also one of the five outstanding students in that batch.","Moreover, he was ranked first overall.","“The other man is a special forces soldier from the navy who came to our school for a business trip.","From his skills, he’s also very powerful.","This is a battle between experts.","Everyone, open your eyes and watch!","Don’t blink!","Do you hear me?”","“Yes!”","The instructor’s explanation made the students present sit down cross-legged and straighten their chests.","They responded in unison and watched the battle between the real combat experts seriously.","“Do you see that?","Every move they make is fatal.","When they raise their legs, they ensure that their lower bodies are stable.","Once they lose balance in their lower bodies, the enemy will immediately have an opportunity to lock their throats!","“The attacking party and the defending party are quite powerful.","They can easily avoid each other’s fatal moves or minimize the danger.","You guys just need to learn how to minimize the danger!","“Look, this move is called the Golden Hook Hangs Upside Down.","Once the enemy’s head is struck, their cervical vertebrae might be dislocated and they’ll die.","Look, the navy representative quickly retreated and blocked with one arm, resolving the crisis.”","The instructor had never seen such an exciting battle before.","The more he spoke, the more excited he became.","He was so excited that he clenched his fists tightly.","He wished that he could participate too.","The instructor was excited to watch the fight, and it was the same with the students.","They were freshmen.","Although they had been in contact with combat since they entered the school and had seen the fights between instructors in the military school, it was not as exciting as what they were seeing now.","One look and they could tell that these men were not on the same level.","The two people in the fight only had eyes for each other.","The other party was an enemy they had to defeat.","They focused all their attention on winning.","Xia Jinyuan shook his right arm that was hurting from Li Jinnian’s side kick.","His gaze was cold as he clenched his fists again.","His long legs moved slightly as he took the initiative to attack again.","The wind from his fist rustled.","Even from a distance, the students could feel the strength in his fist.","The direction of his punch looked like it was aimed at Li Jinnian’s head.","It was so fast and fierce that the students sitting and watching broke out in a cold sweat for the navy representative."]},{"number":4207,"title":"Chapter 4207 Fight","paragraphs":["Chapter 4207: Fight","Chapter 4207: Fight Editor: Henyee Translations","In the eyes of the students, Xia Jinyuan was the representative of the army and their senior.","Li Jinnian was the navy representative.","Li Jinnian didn’t retreat because of Xia Jinyuan’s direct attack.","He just dodged with his upper body.","In the combat, he seemed to be deliberating, but in fact, he wasn’t.","The two of them had trained together.","They had a certain understanding of each other’s moves and routines.","When Xia Jinyuan threw his punch, Li Jinnian’s reaction was like a conditional reflex.","He knew that the other party’s move was a feint.","As expected, when he dodged, Xia Jinyuan’s fist didn’t land.","Instead, Xia Jinyuan raised his long leg and swept it across.","The surrounding students widened their eyes.","“It was a feint!","His fist turned into a kick, and his coordination between his upper and lower body is so strong!","He actually stopped his fist immediately and changed to a kick!”","“That’s why they’re called experts!","This is real combat.","They’re using killing moves!”","“Compared to them, what we learned is nothing.”","“Both of you, watch carefully!”","The instructor, who was watching excitedly in front, suddenly heard the students talking behind him.","He turned his head and said seriously, “Discuss everything else after class.”","This was a professional combat class, yet they were still in the mood to discuss.","The two students who were discovered by the instructor straightened their faces and didn’t dare to be distracted anymore.","They looked forward and watched seriously.","The two people in the combat didn’t notice that they had become textbook material.","They didn’t notice that the students sitting around them were watching.","Xia Jinyuan saw that his cousin-in-law had avoided his feint and even counter-attacked.","He, who always liked to attack, clamped Li Jinnian’s wrist and smiled softly.","“It seems that knowing too much is not a good thing.","Our spar will probably take some time.”","“In that case, let’s see who can last until the end,” Li Jinnian said coldly.","He broke free and punched Xia Jinyuan’s throat.","The students who were watching broke out in a cold sweat for Xia Jinyuan.","If he was punched, his Adam’s apple would be shattered.","After ten minutes of combat, the two of them had a short conversation.","The students below the stage broke out in a cold sweat for them and secretly gasped.","They were trembling in fear when they saw this.","However, the two people fighting didn’t feel that they were risking their lives.","They knew their limits and knew their opponent’s skills.","They weren’t worried that they would really injure the other party.","At most, it would hurt for a few days.","Now, their bodies were already hurting!","Not only did their heads hurt, but their fists hurt too.","After Ye Jian was done with the instructor’s task, she walked out of the admin building and saw Song Zhiqiu striding toward the admin building.","She saw him, and he saw her too.","He started jogging.","“Ye Jian, the instructor just informed me to rush to the training hall.","He said that two combat experts are competing.","The freshmen in the training hall are all watching and learning!","It’s quite exciting when experts fight!”","!","For some reason, when Song Zhiqiu mentioned that two combat experts were competing, two familiar figures appeared in Ye Jian’s mind.","“Let’s hurry up and take a look.","I’m afraid it’ll end if we’re any later!” Song Zhiqiu wanted to take a look too.","If the instructor hadn’t insisted that he brought Ye Jian over, he would have run over alone.","For some reason, Ye Jian felt that the two combat experts were the people she knew.","She didn’t need Song Zhiqiu to urge her.","After he finished speaking, she had already started jogging.","The two of them were wearing training clothes.","They wouldn’t be stopped for jogging.","The admin building was a distance away from the training hall, so they had to jog."]},{"number":4208,"title":"Chapter 4208 Two Actors","paragraphs":["Chapter 4208: Two Actors","Chapter 4208: Two Actors Editor: Henyee Translations","As he ran, Song Zhiqiu said, “The instructor said that those two are true combat experts.","It would be a pity if you didn’t see them.","He was afraid that I wouldn’t go find you, so he repeatedly told me to bring you over.","“It looks like they’re really experts.","If not, the instructor wouldn’t have asked you to go over and take a look.","A few people from our class have already gone over.","They’re probably watching now.”","Hearing that, Ye Jian ran even faster.","Her cousin and Captain Xia were both very strong.","She had only seen them spar once during the training year.","When they fought, it was really terrifying.","Their killing intent was so strong that it seemed like they would really kill each other.","The surrounding students would probably be shocked.","The instructors would probably be stunned too.","Ye Jian was a little worried.","If it was really her cousin and Captain Xia, a large part of their sudden sparring session was probably because of her.","Ye Jian, who was worried, sped up again.","Song Zhiqiu had no choice but to speed up and chase after her.","When they arrived at the training hall, Ye Jian saw more than 70 students sitting around the periphery.","This included the students in her class.","Everyone was sitting down.","No one was standing up.","Ye Jian went in and saw the two people fighting.","Just like what she thought, they were the two people she was most familiar with.","Ye Jian could feel the viciousness between the two of them.","It had been 20 minutes since the two of them started fighting freely.","When the instructor who asked Ye Jian to come over saw her, he raised his hand and quietly asked her to come over to take a look.","The instructor was sitting in a good seat at the front.","When Ye Jian went over, she could see the fight between the two combat experts clearly.","Ye Jian’s face tensed up.","Letting out a wry smile, she walked over.","“It’s been 20 minutes.","Their stamina is still very good.","It won’t be a problem for them to last another 20 minutes.","Watch carefully.","This is a rare opportunity.”","The instructor spoke seriously because he wasn’t able to teach Ye Jian anything more.","Ye Jian had learned all about lethal combat.","Even when she sat down, she didn’t hear what the instructor said.","Her entire mind was on the two people fighting.","The two men had been fighting for 20 minutes.","How much longer did they need to fight?","The two fists collided head-on.","The sound of the collision made the students’ hearts tighten.","Damn it! The two men’s fingers weren’t broken, right?","The students could all hear the collision.","Even if their fingers weren’t broken, it would still be painful.","Ye Jian frowned.","This couldn’t go on.","Before the outcome was decided, the two of them would probably be in pain for a few days.","She needed to think of a way to end things!","Xia Jinyuan noticed Ye Jian among the students who were all wearing training clothes.","His expression changed because of Ye Jian’s arrival.","“Demon King, four o’clock.”","In the crowd, Xia Jinyuan was able to find Ye Jian immediately because of her gaze.","Li Jinnian froze when he heard that.","Then, he said in a cold voice, “We’re just carrying out a lesson.”","This was a good idea!","Lieutenant Colonel Xia immediately understood the main point!","It was just a lesson, not a fight.","The alarm was lifted.","Then, Ye Jian saw Xia Jinyuan waving his hand.","Demon King Li stopped.","The two of them leaned against each other’s backs and faced the students in front.","One of them asked, “Do you want to come up and give it a try?”","Another one said, “I’ll teach you.”","The talkative one was Lieutenant Colonel Xia, and the concise one was Demon King Li.","The students who were being stared at by the two of them were excited.","They stood up, but before they could take a step, they became a little cowardly.","At this moment, the two people didn’t think that they had dug a deep pit for themselves."]},{"number":4209,"title":"Chapter 4209 Trouble","paragraphs":["Chapter 4209: Trouble","Chapter 4209: Trouble Editor: Henyee Translations","The two students stood there hesitantly.","Give it a try?","Well, they didn’t dare to.","They were afraid that they would be knocked down by the combat experts.","That would be awkward!","Hence, the instructor sitting beside Ye Jian assisted and shouted, “Can you let the student beside me go up and spar with the two of you?”","Hearing this, Lieutenant Colonel Xia and Li Jinnian glanced at the instructor from the corner of their eyes.","The two of them froze.","Whether it was a blessing or a curse, it couldn’t be avoided!","They wanted to pretend that they hadn’t noticed Ye Jian.","Who knew that the unreliable instructor would ask the little fox to spar with them?","At this moment, the two people who had dug a hole for themselves were especially flustered.","In the end, Li Jinnian took a step back and said calmly, “Okay.”","He pushed Xia Jinyuan deeper into the pit.","“Demon King, you’re being a little unkind.","We should at least advance and retreat together,” Lieutenant Colonel Xia said in a low voice.","“It’s not very brotherly of you to do this.”","Lieutenant Colonel Li replied calmly, “I’m not your brother.","I’m your future cousin-in-law.”","!","Li Jinnian admitted that Xia Jinyuan was his future cousin-in-law?","Lieutenant Colonel Xia Jinyuan, who couldn’t climb out of the deep pit, pursed his lips.","“Cousin-in-law, don’t you feel guilty?”","“No, I’m fine.","Thank you for your on-the-spot teaching,” replied Li Jinnian, who didn’t feel guilty at all.","He added, “Take care.”","Lieutenant Colonel Xia could only watch as his cousin-in-law, Demon King Li, left.","Then, he turned around! He was so frightened that he took a small step back.","He didn’t know when Ye Jian was standing behind him.","When he turned around, they were face-to-face.","Li Jinnian sat behind the students and started watching coldly.","“Hello, please guide me.” Ye Jian saluted Xia Jinyuan.","The slight smile on her face made Xia Jinyuan’s knees weak.","This smile made him panic.","Xia Jinyuan returned the soldier’s salute and smiled.","“I wouldn’t dare to teach you.","I’d be showing off in front of an expert.”","“Shall we start?” Ye Jian asked politely.","Hence, Lieutenant Colonel Xia felt even more frightened.","However, Ye Jian’s instructor reminded her, “Ye Jian, be careful.","Don’t let down your guard.”","As expected of an instructor.","He could always educate his students.","Lieutenant Colonel Li had already given this instructor a hundred points in his heart.","Applause was heard.","Li Jinnian applauded too and shouted with the students, “All the best!","All the best, Senior Ye Jian.”","The freshmen shouted, “Senior Ye Jian, all the best.” The students from Song Zhiqiu’s class shouted, “Ye Jian, all the best.” Li Jinnian also shouted, “Ye Jian, all the best.”","Xia Jinyuan, who had been forced into this spot, loosened his muscles again.","The smile on his face disappeared slightly.","At the same time, his fist was already out.","His voice was accompanied by the wind from his fist.","“Let’s see if your skills have improved in the past year.”","When he said this, it meant that he was serious.","He wasn’t just playing with Ye Jian casually.","He wanted to test if Ye Jian’s skills had improved.","If he was serious, Ye Jian would naturally accompany him.","The students were even more nervous when they saw that the army representative was as fierce as when he fought with the navy representative just now.","Song Zhiqiu and the rest were so nervous that they were clenching their fists.","Ye Jian’s combat skills were very good, but how many moves could she exchange with that army representative?","Would she get hurt?","They became nervous, and the instructor’s expression turned even colder.","Everyone held their breaths as Xia Jinyuan punched.","Then, as Ye Jian agilely dodged, they slowly relaxed.","The atmosphere in the entire training hall was even more tense than during the fight just now."]},{"number":4210,"title":"Chapter 4210 Professional Level","paragraphs":["Chapter 4210: Professional Level","Chapter 4210: Professional Level Editor: Henyee Translations","Although the army representative was their senior, he was from an earlier batch and they weren’t familiar with him at all.","As for Ye Jian, they all knew her and were familiar with her.","Hence, they naturally sided with Ye Jian.","They were more willing to see Ye Jian win.","As for the instructor, he hoped so too.","However, this wasn’t something that could happen just because they wanted to.","Ye Jian needed to have the ability to defeat the army representative.","They could only hope that Ye Jian would win.","When Ye Jian evaded Xia Jinyuan’s attack and retaliated, the instructor sitting down felt that his effort had been worth it.","At this moment, Ye Jian! was using the military Maga technique!","The biggest feature of Maga was that it had many anti-joint moves that attacked fatal points.","Kicking the crotch was one of the most common moves.","This was a compulsory combat technique for Israel’s defense, military, and law enforcement departments.","The American FBI also used the Maga technique.","Even a few alchemists knew it.","Ye Jian used anti-joint moves and kicked in the crotch, which was not an easy move at all!","The instructor’s gaze changed.","It became complicated.","As an instructor, he didn’t know how to employ the Maga technique, but his student, Ye Jian, did.","Had Ye Jian been hiding her talents?","It was a military martial art.","Its moves were simple and focused on killing enemies.","The first-year students had never come into contact with Maga so they didn’t know what Ye Jian was using now.","The male students only knew that Ye Jian’s kicks made their crotches tense up.","This! Why did it look like a woman’s anti-predator technique?","There were many kicks to the crotch!","The male students in Ye Jian’s class were extremely tense.","Fortunately, they didn’t encounter such a move when they fought with Ye Jian.","Otherwise, if she kicked their crotches, they would be crippled!","At this moment, the male students who were watching were very agitated.","The male students who were in the same class as Ye Jian felt that they were fortunate.","Fortunately, Ye Jian showed mercy.","Fortunately, they were not crippled.","“Yesterday, I was still sparring with her during training.","It seems I’ve survived a calamity.","Our male senior seems to be having a hard time avoiding her.","If it were us, I would’ve fallen for Ye Jian’s first kick to the crotch.”","This was what a male student in the class said to Song Zhiqiu.","Song Zhiqiu, who had a more serious facial expression than the other male students in the class, pursed his lips slightly.","After a while, he said, “She’s using the Maga technique.","It means ‘close combat’ in Hebrew.","Ye Jian is using the military Maga technique.","The moves look simple, but they’re directly effective.","They mainly kill enemies.","“Watch carefully.","The instructor definitely didn’t expect us to see a side of Ye Jian that we didn’t know about.”","“Are you talking about military Maga?” The student looked at Song Zhiqiu.","“Are you seeing things?","We’ve never learned military Maga.”","Although the male student had never seen military martial arts before, during the combat training, the instructor had mentioned what combat techniques the military used and what close combat techniques the special forces soldiers employed.","This was also what Song Zhiqiu was puzzled about.","Ye Jian studied the same classes as them.","How did she come into contact with military Maga techniques after class?","It was obvious that she had undergone professional training.","Could it be that she learned it during the holidays?","“I’ve learned the civilian Maga technique, so I know a little.” After Song Zhiqiu finished speaking, his facial expression became even more focused.","Even though he had been Ye Jian’s classmate for three years, Ye Jian was still a mystery."]},{"number":4211,"title":"Chapter 4211 Disadvantage","paragraphs":["Chapter 4211: Disadvantage","Chapter 4211: Disadvantage Editor: Henyee Translations","The students who didn’t know what was going on were shocked by Ye Jian’s sudden move.","Her left hand, which was grabbed by the army representative, turned into a strange angle.","She had already turned from her side to facing the army representative.","In an instant, she reversed her disadvantage and raised her leg again.","She kicked the crotch of the army representative ruthlessly without any hesitation.","“Oof!”","An extremely clear gasp came from the venue.","A few male students seemed to feel the same way.","They subconsciously placed their hands over their crotches.","Li Jinnian smiled.","Li Jinnian, who was smiling, even raised his eyebrows slightly.","Not bad, his cousin wasn’t treating Xia Jinyuan as her boyfriend in the combat arena.","She treated him as her opponent.","From the looks of it, her cousin could recognize her identity.","Xia Jinyuan smiled too.","He had no choice but to release his grip on Ye Jian’s right hand.","He hurriedly blocked another kick and approached her.","He said helplessly, “If you use Maga again, aren’t you afraid that I won’t be able to dodge and will be kicked in the crotch by you?","“Give me a way out.","I don’t want it to be scrapped before it can be used once.","How about another close combat technique?","For example!”","A second ago, he was still smiling and talking to Ye Jian.","The next second, his gaze was sharp and vicious as he attacked Ye Jian.","The surrounding students, including the instructor, were silent.","The army representative had used the same move as when he fought with the navy representative!","Xia Jinyuan used Sangbo.","In Russian, it meant ‘self-defense without weapons’.","Sangbo was divided into sports and actual combat.","The Sanbo technique Xia Jinyuan used was naturally the Sangbo technique used in actual combat.","The special forces soldier from Signal Flag, Luke, had taught his partner, Xia Jinyuan, seriously.","As for Xia Jinyuan, he studied very seriously.","He only studied it for less than eight months, but Luke had already lost to Xia Jinyuan several times.","Although it had only been a short time, Xia Jinyuan’s Sangbo was very powerful.","Just now, Li Jinnian had suffered at his hands several times.","His arm and thigh were still hurting.","Ye Jian knew that Xia Jinyuan’s close combat skills were quite powerful.","In the face of his instantaneous ruthlessness, Ye Jian didn’t feel timid.","She blocked Xia Jinyuan’s two kicks with her arms.","The moment Xia Jinyuan retracted his leg, Ye Jian suddenly rushed forward and punched Xia Jinyuan’s right armpit.","Not only did she dodge Xia Jinyuan’s fist, but she also used her elbow to hit Xia Jinyuan’s chest again.","Xia Jinyuan’s moves became ruthless.","Similarly, Ye Jian’s moves were not bad either.","Her left elbow was fast and ruthless.","Xia Jinyuan let out a low groan when he was hit in the throat.","His expression changed.","She really didn’t show any mercy.","She was just short of breaking his ribs.","“Not bad, you’ve improved a lot.” Xia Jinyuan’s expression changed slightly from the pain, but the smile in his eyes was deep.","During the year he left, his little fox never stopped improving.","She had improved in all aspects.","Sweat had already appeared on Ye Jian’s forehead.","She smiled coldly and raised her leg continuously to kick Xia Jinyuan’s abdomen, thighs, and knees.","She had no choice.","She was much shorter than him.","She couldn’t kick his chest directly.","The eyes of the first-year students widened.","Their female senior was so powerful!","The representative of the army was actually parried by Senior Ye Jian!","He couldn’t retaliate for a while."]},{"number":4212,"title":"Chapter 4212 Mystery","paragraphs":["Chapter 4212: Mystery","Chapter 4212: Mystery Editor: Henyee Translations","At first, Ye Jian didn’t think of fighting with Xia Jinyuan for real.","Even if she did, she just wanted to exchange a few moves.","Unexpectedly, Xia Jinyuan’s sudden attack instantly evoked Ye Jian’s desire to win.","She threw the thought of exchanging a few moves to the back of her mind.","The more she fought, the more excited she became.","As for the close combat techniques she used, she didn’t pay much attention to them.","It wasn’t until Xia Jinyuan reminded her not to use the Maga technique anymore that Ye Jian reacted.","The biggest feature of Maga was the crotch kick.","Just now, she used a crotch kick in front of many freshmen and several male students from her class.","Although it was a kind of close combat, she should use it less in front of the students.","Ye Jian immediately changed to mixed combat.","Mixed combat didn’t have a high requirement for endurance.","It was mainly about the essence of skills.","When Xia Jinyuan’s low leg swept over, Ye Jian quickly blocked it with her leg.","Her knee was on Xia Jinyuan’s abdomen, preventing him from attacking a second time.","Ye Jian, who was using mixed combat techniques, used more techniques to resist Xia Jinyuan’s Sangbo.","The two of them exchanged blows.","The surrounding students couldn’t take their eyes off them.","They widened their eyes and didn’t dare to blink.","Xia Jinyuan let out a soft exclamation.","Ye Jian had improved a little.","“If this continues, I’m afraid more and more students will surround us.","We have to end it.” Xia Jinyuan felt that it was not suitable for the two of them to continue.","He glanced around with the corners of his eyes and said in a low voice, “Next time, we’ll find a chance to spar.”","Ye Jian, who had already fought to her heart’s content, was in the midst of her momentum.","When she heard Xia Jinyuan’s reminder, she didn’t retract her strength immediately.","Instead, she smiled softly and said, “That will depend on how you clean up the mess.","My instructor asked me to go on stage and ask you for guidance.","You should consider how to clean up the mess.”","She even spoke formally on purpose.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and said with a faint smile, “I’ll clean up the mess, so you have to cooperate with me.","There is no way to end this game by ending it unilaterally.”","The two of them fought with their fists.","The surrounding students only saw Ye Jian getting braver as she fought.","They clenched their fists tighter and tighter.","They initially thought that Ye Jian couldn’t win against the army representative, but now, they felt that it wasn’t impossible.","Ye Jian’s skills were stronger than they thought!","The first-year students knew about Ye Jian’s skills, but the rest didn’t.","They only knew that the third-year senior, Ye Jian, was very powerful.","The male students admitted defeat.","What they knew couldn’t even hold a flame to Ye Jian’s knowledge and skills.","The students who understood Ye Jian the most were the ones in the same class as her.","However, when Song Zhiqiu and the rest saw that Ye Jian hadn’t lost to the army representative even after 15 minutes, they felt that they didn’t know Ye Jian very well.","If they really understood her, they would have known that Ye Jian was good at close combat.","However, they didn’t.","They were the same as the freshmen.","Today, they realized that Ye Jian’s close combat was so powerful.","The back of the male student who completed the combat training with Ye Jian on the first day of school after the May holidays was already drenched in a cold sweat.","He wasn’t glad that he survived.","He just felt that he was lucky!","Whether Ye Jian used Maga or mixed combat, he wouldn’t be able to fight with Ye Jian at all.","If he were to go on stage, Ye Jian only needed one move to knock him down."]},{"number":4213,"title":"Chapter 4213 Complain","paragraphs":["Chapter 4213: Complain","Chapter 4213: Complain Editor: Henyee Translations","The army representative locked Ye Jian’s neck with his elbow from the back.","As Ye Jian was trapped, the atmosphere reached a new height.","The students didn’t even dare to breathe loudly.","Was Ye Jian about to lose?","Could she still escape from the trap?","Could they continue fighting?","Even if she lost, they would feel that Ye Jian had won.","She lost to the army representative but won over all the students who were watching.","Because no one could defeat Ye Jian!","Li Jinnian narrowed his eyes.","Xia Jinyuan was stricter with his cousin than he thought.","The current Xia Jinyuan didn’t think that he was his cousin’s boyfriend, nor did he think that he needed to give in to his girlfriend.","He was very clear about the boundaries.","Li Jinnian narrowed his eyes with a complicated gaze.","Xia Jinyuan was undoubtedly a qualified soldier.","Even though he was in love, he didn’t lose his rationality.","Li Jinnian, who had a complicated gaze, suddenly didn’t know how to face Xia Jinyuan.","As a soldier, he admired Xia Jinyuan’s rationality.","However, as his cousin’s family, his heart ached for his cousin.","Suddenly, Li Jinnian didn’t want to watch anymore.","He thought that he needed to think about it carefully.","Now, it wasn’t just Xia Jinyuan and his cousin’s relationship anymore.","It was his personal relationship.","He needed to reevaluate their relationship.","He wasn’t trying to stop them.","He just felt that he needed to accept and get to know them again.","Li Jinnian stood up.","The student sitting beside him noticed it and immediately turned his head.","He asked softly, “Aren’t you going to watch?”","“I have something to deal with,” Li Jinnian replied.","He no longer looked at the two people fighting.","Whether Ye Jian could escape from Xia Jinyuan’s grip or not was something the students thought was very difficult.","However, Li Jinnian didn’t think it was difficult.","His cousin was a special forces soldier.","She had to master her escape techniques.","Even if there was a combat dagger on her neck, as a special forces soldier, his cousin had to know how to escape danger.","His cousin would definitely be able to resolve the current predicament.","Before Li Jinnian could walk out of the training hall, Ye Jian had already escaped.","She kicked Xia Jinyuan’s knee with her hind leg.","Then, she used her head to hit Xia Jinyuan’s chin.","Ye Jian successfully escaped.","The instructor who taught Ye Jian close combat was the first to clap.","Another instructor said in a low voice, “It looks like Ye Jian has some tricks up her sleeve.","She hasn’t shown her true skills.”","“Even if she wants to show her true skills during training, how many of us are her opponents?","What about us?","Do you think we are her opponents?","Do you have the confidence to knock her down?","I don’t,” Ye Jian’s instructor replied in a low voice while clapping.","The other instructor sighed softly.","That was true.","With Ye Jian’s current close combat skills, even the instructors wouldn’t be able to beat her.","No wonder she needed to hide her talents.","Thunderous applause sounded.","Li Jinnian, who was walking toward the door, turned his head and looked at the two of them.","His gaze inadvertently met Ye Jian’s.","Li Jinnian picked up his pace!","It was better to leave the rest to Xia Jinyuan.","He had something to do.","Ye Jian felt amused and angry when she saw this.","Why didn’t he think that it would be hard to face her when he was fighting?","Wasn’t it too late to feel guilty after fighting?","“Cousin-in-law abandoned me just now, and he’s abandoning me now once more, ” Xia Jinyuan complained.","If he didn’t complain now, when would he?"]},{"number":4214,"title":"Chapter 4214 Big Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Chapter 4214: Big Misunderstanding","Chapter 4214: Big Misunderstanding Editor: Henyee Translations","Amidst the thunderous applause, Xia Jinyuan, who was close to Ye Jian, felt aggrieved.","Seeing that Ye Jian was unmoved, he said aggrievedly, “It was also Cousin-in-law’s idea to spar at the training hall.","I was caught by him halfway.","I couldn’t escape even if I wanted to, so Cousin-in-law dragged me to the training hall.”","The students had already stood up.","Ye Jian, who was saluting the students and instructors, put down her arm and said calmly, “I’ll talk to you later.”","Xia Jinyuan looked at his girlfriend who was walking toward the instructor silently.","What should he do?","He didn’t want to talk to her later.","They still had to talk, because Xia Jinyuan couldn’t go against Ye Jian’s wishes.","After exchanging a few words with a few students who came to ask him for advice, he took the opportunity to leave.","Before he left, he specially looked at Ye Jian, who was talking to the instructor.","Seeing that Ye Jian had her back facing him, Xia Jinyuan left uneasily.","After walking out of the training hall, Xia Jinyuan saw his cousin-in-law, who had abandoned him, standing under the street lamp.","His hands were in his pockets.","There was no coldness to his aura.","He was alone.","Even the lights that enveloped him became lonely.","This was a very lonely person.","Inexplicably, Xia Jinyuan thought that it was ridiculous.","Although it was ridiculous, Xia Jinyuan felt that he was right.","Li Jinnian, who was incompatible with the Li family, was indeed very lonely.","If not, he wouldn’t be so close to the Fu family and be so estranged from his main family.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the lonely Li Jinnian and slowed down his footsteps.","His cousin-in-law! was hard to guess.","Li Jinnian, who was standing under the street lamp, also saw Xia Jinyuan walking out of the training hall.","The coldness in his eyes deepened.","After walking out of the training hall, he thought about many things.","He thought of the smile on Ye Jian’s face when she was with Xia Jinyuan.","That smile was too sweet.","The happiness made him, her cousin, realize that Ye Jian loved Xia Jinyuan very much.","She fell in love with Xia Jinyuan, who was once known as the demon incarnate when he was young.","His name was spread throughout the military circle in the capital city.","She fell in love with someone who had changed a lot.","Li Jinnian almost thought that Xia Jinyuan had a twin brother or a younger brother.","His grandpa said that his cousin was very happy with Little Six of the Xia family.","He said that she had found the right person.","He said that Little Six of the Xia family was worthy of Ye Jian’s life.","Even Li Jinnian’s uncle said that there was no one more suitable for Ye Jian than Little Six of the Xia family.","That was what his uncle and grandpa said.","He was the only one who did not express any opinion.","He had seen how vicious Xia Jinyuan was when dealing with certain matters.","Why was Du Jiayi still afraid of Xia Jinyuan?","It was because Xia Jinyuan had once dragged her from one end of the street to the other end.","He had dragged her to the entrance of a red light district.","The words he said were still fresh in his memory.","“Do you like to scheme so much?","You always like to deceive people into coming to such a place to bully them.","It seems that you like to sleep with thousands of people.","Why don’t you live here in the future?","I’m sure you’ll be happy.”","At that time, Xia Jinyuan was only 16 years old.","How old was Du Jiayi at that time?","She was probably only in the ninth grade.","That was the first time Du Jiayi hugged his thigh and shouted for help.","Of course, he wouldn’t save her.","He only glanced at her once before leaving on his bicycle without looking back.","However, he still remembered Xia Jinyuan’s words and the ruthlessness on his face."]},{"number":4215,"title":"Chapter 4215 Unclear Relationship","paragraphs":["Chapter 4215: Unclear Relationship","Chapter 4215: Unclear Relationship Editor: Henyee Translations","He was someone who would do anything.","At that time, Li Jinnian, who was only 17 years old, thought so too.","When he met Xia Jinyuan and started training with him, he still thought so.","He later found out that Xia Jinyuan had changed, that Xia Jinyuan had become his cousin’s boyfriend, and that before his cousin returned to the Fu family, Xia Jinyuan had helped his cousin a lot.","There was even a period of time when he felt that Xia Jinyuan was indeed a man worthy of his cousin’s life.","However, every time he thought of Du Jiayi’s scream that day when she was young, he would inadvertently recall Xia Jinyuan’s ruthlessness when he was young.","Then, he would recall Xia Jinyuan’s relationship with his cousin.","It felt as though something was blocking his heart.","Xia Jinyuan’s temper was so bad that even Li Jinnian, who wasn’t in the same circle, knew about it.","At the same time, he knew that no matter how bad Xia Jinyuan’s temper was, he had a strong principle.","He wasn’t someone who would flare up easily and make things difficult for others.","In that case, why was he so ruthless to Du Jiayi?","In the past, Li Jinnian didn’t think that he needed to think about this matter.","He even thought that a ruthless person like Du Jiayi deserved to be taught a lesson!","Now, it was different.","That ruthless fellow was dating his cousin.","Li Jinnian had to ask him clearly.","If Xia Jinyuan had such an unclear relationship with Du Jiayi when he was young, he would warn Xia Jinyuan not to think that Du Jiayi had become a good person!","He needed to ask him properly!","Xia Jinyuan had already walked over.","Before he could speak, Li Jinnian said calmly, “My cousin looked a little angry.","How did it go?","Did she flare up at you?”","She was so angry that she kicked Xia Jinyuan’s crotch repeatedly.","Xia Jinyuan turned his body vigilantly and said calmly, “You were the one who started it, but you escaped in the end.","Isn’t it too late to ask if she’s angry?”","“Isn’t it normal for you to coax her when she’s angry?” Li Jinnian’s expression darkened without warning.","Even his gaze became exceptionally sharp.","“Don’t you want to coax her anymore?”","Xia Jinyuan suddenly realized that the famous Demon King Li was quite irritating when he was shameless.","“You started the trouble yourself.","When you felt that something was wrong, you threw the burden to me.","Ye Jian is my girlfriend.","I’ll definitely coax her.","However, your actions are too much.","After all, we climbed through the trenches together.”","They climbed through the trenches together!","“Then you have to thank the trenches we climbed through together in the past.” Li Jinnian pursed his lips and glanced at Xia Jinyuan’s face coldly.","“Xia Jinyuan, did you have an unclear relationship with Du Jiayi in the past?”","This question was not abrupt at all.","No, no, no, it was not abrupt.","It was appalling!","Xia Jinyuan was so shocked that he choked on his breath.","He coughed violently.","He was a little shocked, so he coughed a little harder.","Xia Jinyuan even cried.","Although he was coughing until tears flowed out of his eyes, Xia Jinyuan’s gaze was exceptionally sharp.","Xia Jinyuan suppressed the choking in his throat and said in a low voice, “Where did this question come from?!”","His deep voice was extremely cold and sharp, making Li Jinnian’s heart sink.","Did he really guess correctly?","“It’s true?” Li Jinnian’s expression had already turned dark.","“Did you really have an unclear relationship with Du Jiayi?”"]},{"number":4216,"title":"Chapter 4216 So Angry","paragraphs":["Chapter 4216: So Angry","Chapter 4216: So Angry Editor: Henyee Translations","“You had an unclear! relationship with Du Jiayi?” Ye Jian’s cold voice came from behind them.","She only repeated what Li Jinnian said, but the coldness in her voice was several times more than Li Jinnian’s.","Xia Jinyuan knew that things had blown up.","He glanced at Li Jinnian coldly.","Then, he turned around and strode toward Ye Jian.","“Cousin, why are you asking such a question for no reason?","Is Aunt making things difficult for you again?”","Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief when Ye Jian asked this.","She didn’t misunderstand him.","“When you suddenly said that, I wondered if Madam Xiao had said something outside again.” Xia Jinyuan used the word ‘again’.","It could be seen that Madam Xiao had done similar stupid things in the past.","Li Jinnian was puzzled by their conversation.","Madam Xiao?","Where did this Madam Xiao come from?","Who was Madam Xiao?","“I’ll ask my cousin.” Ye Jian held Xia Jinyuan’s hand and protected the man as if she was protecting him.","She walked in front of Li Jinnian and asked sternly, “Cousin, did you hear some rumors?”","Li Jinnian looked at the man behind his cousin.","Then, he looked at Ye Jian and pursed his thin lips.","He wanted to question Ye Jian for protecting her man, but he swallowed his words.","“Let him answer the question first.”","“That’s impossible.” Without needing Xia Jinyuan to answer, Ye Jian had already answered.","“It’s impossible for Captain Xia to have had an unclear relationship with Du Jiayi.”","How protective!","Li Jinnian felt a headache coming on.","“He was a trouble-maker when he was 16 or 17 years old.","He only turned over a new leaf later on.”","Ye Jian pursed her lips and couldn’t help but smile.","“I know that he was quite a gangster in the past.","Grandpa Xia, Grandma Xia, and Commander Xia have told me everything.","Cousin, quickly tell me where you heard the news that Captain Xia and Du!”","“Don’t put my name together with hers.","I don’t like her.” Xia Jinyuan was in a bad mood.","His handsome face was frighteningly cold.","When he opened his mouth, his aura was cold.","“I didn’t know that there were such rumors in the capital city.","Are they bullying me because I haven’t been in the capital city for a long time?”","“I once saw you dragging Du Jiayi away with my own eyes.","I even heard you say that since Du Jiayi likes to scheme so much!”","Ye Jian looked at Xia Jinyuan.","“My cousin saw it with his own eyes.","Do you want to explain?”","Her man had an unclear relationship with Du Jiayi?","Ye Jian didn’t believe it.","In that case, she would ask her man to explain to her cousin.","As for her, she didn’t need his explanation because she trusted him.","Xia Jinyuan frowned.","“When did I ever!”","Halfway through his sentence, Xia Jinyuan thought of an old matter that happened almost ten years ago.","He frowned even more.","“Don’t tell me it’s the incident that happened more than ten years ago?”","Li Jinnian nodded lightly.","What else could Xia Jinyuan say?","He was angry and amused!","He told Ye Jian what happened more than ten years ago.","“I told you before that I had a conflict with that woman.","It was this conflict.","She schemed against the younger sister of a friend of mine.","I dealt with her by dragging her to the entrance of a red light district at the end of the street.”","Xia Jinyuan glanced at his cousin-in-law calmly and smiled.","“I said something ruthless.","I didn’t expect you to hear it.","I remember that she hugged your leg and asked for help.","However, you ignored her and left elegantly on your bicycle.”"]},{"number":4217,"title":"Chapter 4217 Happiness For The Rest Of Her Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 4217: Happiness For The Rest Of Her Life","Chapter 4217: Happiness For The Rest Of Her Life Editor: Henyee Translations","It was more than ten years ago.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect this to become the main reason why Li Jinnian didn’t accept him being with Ye Jian.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia was so angry that he really wanted to spar with his cousin-in-law again.","His explanation lifted the stone in Li Jinnian’s heart.","As it turned out, he had misunderstood.","“I’m sorry.","I misunderstood you,” Li Jinnian apologized for his misunderstanding.","Although his tone was calm, he was sincerely apologizing.","Now that he knew that he had misunderstood, Li Jinnian’s facial expression softened.","He looked at the two of them holding hands tightly and smiled.","As it turned out, he had misunderstood everything.","Fortunately, he had asked Xia Jinyuan about it tonight.","If not, things would’ve continued to be the way they were.","He looked at the man who was protected by his cousin just now and thought about the interaction between the two of them.","As there was no misunderstanding, the interaction between the two of them now seemed different in his eyes.","It could be seen that the relationship between the two of them was not one-sided but two-sided.","Xia Jinyuan protected Ye Jian.","Similarly, Ye Jian protected Xia Jinyuan.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan’s love was a love that was evenly matched.","It wasn’t about relying on and protecting one more than the other.","The two of them were evenly matched and wouldn’t drag each other down.","Thinking of this, the smile in Li Jinnian’s cold eyes deepened.","This time, he looked at Xia Jinyuan with a smile.","Xia Jinyuan, who was shocked by Li Jinnian’s words just now, was shocked by his cousin-in-law’s ‘kind’ smile and took half a step back.","“Xia Jinyuan, I’ll hand my cousin to you.","In the future, you’ll be the one to accompany her for the rest of her life.","If she’s bullied or wronged, I hope you’ll always be the first to know and that you’ll be the one to coax her.”","Li Jinnian looked at Xia Jinyuan.","His cold tone softened because of Ye Jian.","“I hope that when she suffers, she will always think of you and not me or Uncle or Grandpa.","“She chose you.","Her heart is always with you.","When she’s unhappy and angry, make sure to coax her and make her happy.","That’s what you have to do.","“If you can’t even make my cousin happy, I don’t think there’ll be a reason for you to continue to be with her.","I know that you’ve helped her a lot, and I know that without you, my cousin might not be where she is today, but!”","Under the street lamp, Li Jinnian looked at Xia Jinyuan sharply.","“But this is not important to my family.","We just want Ye Jian to be happy.","Now that she’s chosen you, we hope that she’ll be happy no matter what.","“Xia Jinyuan, my cousin has suffered and endured blood and tears.","This is the pain of our family.","Now that she’s back home, the family has to shelter her from the wind and rain.","We have to make sure that all the pain, sins, blood, and tears will never appear again.","“What we want is for my cousin to be happy for the rest of her life.","I hope you can give her happiness for the rest of her life!","“My cousin! I’ll leave her to you.","As her cousin, I beg you to take good care of my cousin.","Please take good care of my cousin in life.","Thank you!”","At this moment, the proud Li Jinnian had let go of everything for Ye Jian.","As her cousin, he begged Xia Jinyuan to take good care of Ye Jian.","Ye Jian’s eyes were already glistening with tears.","“Having Ye Jian be happy is my greatest wish for the rest of my life.”","Xia Jinyuan replied Li Jinnian firmly.","He only had two things goals in life.","The first was to be worthy of the military uniform he was wearing.","The second was to let his lover be happy for the rest of her life!"]},{"number":4218,"title":"Chapter 4218 Jealousy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4218: Jealousy","Chapter 4218: Jealousy Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian was someone who lacked love.","However, after meeting Grandpa Gen and Uncle Chen, she returned to the Fu family and got together with the person she loved.","The love she lacked and lost was replenished bit by bit.","She managed to fill up the hole in her previous life.","She didn’t know when her time would end in this life, but all her regrets had been made up.","She didn’t think that she was someone who liked to cry.","However, every time she saw the people around her loving her and caring for her, so worried that she would suffer any grievances, Ye Jian couldn’t help but cry.","Every time she cried, she wondered if she was a crybaby.","Otherwise, why would she cry so much?","Hence, most of the time, Ye Jian would regret it after crying.","After regretting it, however, she would still cry when she wanted to.","Just like this moment, tears kept flowing out of her eyes, making Li Jinnian laugh.","“Why are you crying like this?","You’re acting like Little Six and I bullied you.” Li Jinnian didn’t think that Ye Jian was crying because of him, so he dragged Xia Jinyuan along.","“Alright, alright, don’t cry.","We’re not far from the entrance of the training hall.","If the students come out and see you crying, they’ll really think that we bullied you.”","What else could Xia Jinyuan say?","He was being dragged into everything.","Fine, his cousin-in-law was the big shot here.","Xia Jinyuan would give in.","Xia Jinyuan watched as his cousin-in-law wiped his girlfriend’s tears gently.","Then, he saw his girlfriend pressing her forehead against his cousin-in-law’s shoulder and crying silently while her shoulders trembled.","Xia Jinyuan pursed his lips and slowly reached out his hand.","Under his cousin-in-law’s cold gaze, he pulled his girlfriend into his arms.","He gently stroked Ye Jian’s back with one hand and said gently, “How long do you want to cry?","You can’t cry for too long.","Even if the freshmen don’t come out, I’m afraid the students in your class will.","“If you continue crying, Cousin-in-law and I will be surrounded by them.","No one will be able to leave then.”","Li Jinnian glared at Xia Jinyuan.","This brat was indeed cunning!","He wanted to occupy his cousin in such a short time.","Why was he so petty?","Li Jinnian heaved a sigh of relief.","Xia Jinyuan was so jealous that even Li Jinnian, the cousin, couldn’t hug Ye Jian.","This showed that although the devil of the Xia family was very cunning, he really valued Ye Jian.","The smile in Li Jinnian’s cold eyes was gentle, exuberant, and soft.","Knowing that Xia Jinyuan treated his cousin sincerely, he felt at ease.","He should be at ease.","Demon King Li, who had never used his identity as Ye Jian’s cousin to get close to Xia Jinyuan, raised his hand and patted his future cousin-in-law’s shoulder.","“Take good care of her.","I still have something on.","I’ll leave first.”","He mouthed the words so that Ye Jian, who was adjusting her emotions, wouldn’t notice him leaving.","When Ye Jian raised her head from Xia Jinyuan’s arms and turned around, she saw a slender figure walking slowly in the middle of the wide campus road!","The faint yellow lights were scattered all over the ground.","The figure walking slowly stepped on the flickering lights.","Even his elongated shadow was lonely and cold.","He walked aloneâ€”unaccompanied and unloved.","It was as if he would be alone for the rest of his life.","Whether he was sad or happy, he didn’t need other people to know about it.","Whether he cried or smiled, he was still alone."]},{"number":4219,"title":"Chapter 4219 Don’t Run","paragraphs":["Chapter 4219: Don’t Run","Chapter 4219: Don’t Run Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian’s vision blurred again.","Her lips moved slightly as she said softly, “Cousin, you’ll be happy one day.","You’ll definitely be very happy.”","Her grandpa was right.","Her cousin had been alone for too long and needed another person to accompany him.","He still had a long life ahead of him.","Ye Jian would be very happy with Captain Xia for the rest of her life, and her cousin would be very happy with her future cousin-in-law for the rest of his life.","“Brother, do you still remember Zhou Niannian?","I’ve seen her!”","Ye Jian raised her voice.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t have the time to cover her mouth when she suddenly said this.","Li Jinnian heard the voice.","He stopped in his tracks and turned to look at Ye Jian.","He didn’t answer and nodded lightly.","He remembered that Zhou Niannian was a policewoman who dared to search his body.","Why could he remember her in an instant?","That was because that was the first time an adult woman had touched his shoulders and legs.","When she touched him again, he reminded this policewoman who clearly lacked practical experience, “If I were a criminal, I would’ve pulled out a murder weapon and stabbed it into your neck from the side when you were searching me.","You even squatted down to continue searching.","I would’ve been able to slice your artery and blood vessels.","The blade would’ve pierced into your windpipe, letting the blood flow into your lungs.”","He was just reminding her out of kindness.","Then, he questioned her identity and finally arrived at Dan Gui Garden.","The impression she left him was so deep that he immediately remembered who Zhou Niannian was when Ye Jian mentioned her.","Ye Jian wanted to say something, but Xia Jinyuan had already covered her mouth and rushed toward the path.","Had Ye Jian cried so much that she didn’t even remember where she was now?","How dare she make a scene in such a quiet place?","Did she forget about the inspection in the military school?","She forgot about it when she was speaking.","Now that she was escaping, she remembered where she was.","“That student in front, stop!","Don’t run!”","The voice of an inspector was heard.","No one knew where the group of them was hiding just now.","Li Jinnian looked at the three figures that suddenly rushed out of the shadows of the trees by the roadside.","He turned around silently.","He wouldn’t get involved in such matters.","All the students who went to the military school knew that the inspectors in the military school were not to be trifled with.","Even if he was not a student now, he would not go against the inspectors.","Especially the inspectors from the National Science University.","It was said that they were so honest that they once even criticized a chief for not being strict with his military uniform.","Ye Jian’s cousin, Li Jinnian, abandoned her again.","This time, he could add Ye Jian’s name to the list of people he had abandoned.","Xia Jinyuan pulled Ye Jian and ran around familiarly.","There were many cameras in the military school, especially now.","The cameras were everywhere.","He hadn’t been to the National Science University for a long time, so he couldn’t tell where they were.","Hence, Xia Jinyuan stopped running when he reached the dark corner.","He held Ye Jian’s hand tightly and walked around a green belt, leading Ye Jian back.","Actually, Xia Jinyuan’s and Ye Jian’s identities were enough to eliminate the suspicion of the inspectors.","The inspectors who were chasing after them had already seen two figures walking toward them.","One was tall and the other was short.","They looked a little like the two people who ran away just now.","But it was possible that they weren’t.","It was always difficult to catch students who violated the rules in the middle of the night.","Looking at the two people walking toward them, the running inspectors slowed down their footsteps and stood in front of them.","They said sternly, “Hello, comrades.","Please show your identification documents.”","The inspectors had the right to check their identification documents.","If they were caught for violating military discipline, the inspectors would criticize them at the weekly meeting."]},{"number":4220,"title":"Chapter 4220 Assign A Boyfriend","paragraphs":["Chapter 4220: Assign A Boyfriend","Chapter 4220: Assign A Boyfriend Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan took out their identification documents at the same time.","Three minutes later, the two of them continued walking forward.","At this moment, Ye Jian didn’t want to cry anymore.","She wanted to laugh when she saw how skilled the man beside her was in handling the inspectors.","“I wasn’t as honest as you in the past.","It was harder than ascending to heaven for the inspectors to catch me.","Even if they caught me, I wouldn’t let the inspectors find any mistakes.”","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and said proudly, “When you see an inspector, you can’t panic first.","If you panic, you’ll be in trouble.","Learn from me.","You still have a year left.”","“When you were in school, you were the biggest troublemaker for the instructors and leaders.","That’s why the inspectors often caught you.","I’m different.","The inspectors will smile when they see me.","They wouldn’t even come over to check my identification.”","Ye Jian smiled as she looked at the handsome and gentle man under the light.","“It was because of you that I was inspected.”","“Yes, yes, yes.","You’re right.","But if you hadn’t shouted so loudly just now, the inspectors wouldn’t have come.” Xia Jinyuan rubbed Ye Jian’s nose bridge affectionately with his fingers.","He smiled and sighed.","“You’re really bold.","No matter how much trouble I gave the school back then, I wouldn’t have dared to shout at the top of my lungs in the middle of the night.”","Ye Jian blushed and whispered, “I forgot about it for a moment.”","“That’s why I said that you’re bold.","Oh right, who’s Zhou Niannian?","What’s her relationship with Cousin-in-law?”","This was the first time he heard this unfamiliar name.","“A policewoman.","A misunderstanding led to my cousin bringing her back to Dan Gui Garden to verify his identity.","Grandpa even misunderstood her as my cousin’s girlfriend.","Ye Jian only relayed the main points.","Xia Jinyuan pondered for a while before saying slowly, “Cousin-in-law nodded just now.","It looks like he has a deep impression of Zhou Niannian.”","“Grandpa can’t be wrong when it comes to judging people.","Since the old man said that Zhou Niannian and Cousin-in-law are very suitable, they must be very suitable.","Since he has a deep impression of Zhou Niannian, we can indeed try to matchmake them.”","“I want to too, but not now.","She’s not in the country now.","She can only come back next year.” Ye Jian sighed softly.","Thinking of the lonely figure walking under the dim light just now, Ye Jian’s eyes darkened slightly.","“After Aunt left, Cousin’s life in the Li family was very bad.","Grandpa said that Second Old Madam Li even planned to kidnap Cousin.","If Cousin wasn’t vigilant, he would’ve been kidnapped and killed.","“Although Cousin is a member of the Li family, Old Master Li doesn’t accept him.","That’s why Cousin’s life was difficult when he was young.","Captain Xia, Cousin wants me to be happy for the rest of my life.","I also want Cousin to be happy for the rest of his life.","“Do you think I should try to get them together?","I have Niannian’s phone number.”","“You can give it a try.","The bachelors in our military unit don’t have any other way of interacting with women apart from introducing themselves to their relatives and friends.”","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled.","“Let the country assign them girlfriends.”","“Country?","How would that work?”","“I believe that there’ll definitely be many women waiting for the country to assign them to those soldiers.” Ye Jian smiled until her eyes seemed to be filled with stars.","Her eyes were bright like the stars.","The country assigning boyfriends and girlfriends! Xia Jinyuan couldn’t stop laughing.","“Then I’ll go back to the team and tell the bachelors not to be anxious.","The country will assign them girlfriends.","It’s just a matter of time.”","Ye Jian was laughing too.","Fortunately, she didn’t need the country to assign her a boyfriend.","She already had one."]},{"number":4221,"title":"Chapter 4221 Seriously","paragraphs":["Chapter 4221: Seriously","Chapter 4221: Seriously Editor: Henyee Translations","This was the first time Xia Jinyuan heard that the country should allocate boyfriends and girlfriends to the people.","While walking to the library with Ye Jian, he kept thinking back to it as he thought it was funny.","He was handsome and elegant to begin with.","When he wasn’t smiling, he looked cold.","When he wasn’t angry, he looked dignified.","Now that he was in a good mood, he looked even more handsome and elegant.","He exuded the elegance of a noble young master.","No matter how bad his expression was, Ye Jian would still be dazzled by his good looks.","Even her heart was thumping a few times.","Her man was good at literature and martial arts.","He was quite good-looking too.","He treated her very well in every aspect and had a rare deep love for her.","As she thought about it, Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh.","No matter what, she felt that she had profited.","Although Xia Jinyuan was laughing, he was still focused on Ye Jian’s words.","The country allocating the soldiers girlfriends! It wasn’t that this wasn’t possible.","It was very feasible.","He planned to go back and discuss it with the major general.","He wanted to see if the country could let his comrades, who were single, find love.","For instance, the country could arrange blind dates for them.","There was no need to worry about Han Zheng, White Crane, and K7.","They were all from wealthy families.","After they retired from the military, they wouldn’t have to worry about finding a girlfriend.","It just depended on whether they liked the candidates or not.","However, if comrades like V8 and Sparrowhawk didn’t find a girlfriend in time, the matter of marriage would indeed become a huge problem.","As the captain, he couldn’t just watch as his comrades grew old without a companion.","Young couples would come to accompany each other when they got old, just like Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia.","A young couple would be deeply in love with each other.","When they got old, they would support each other and hold each other’s hands.","The constant chatter would minimize the pain of not having their children and grandchildren by their side.","This was the way!","He had to ask his comrades for their opinions first.","If his comrades felt that it was feasible and could accept going on blind dates, the country would make the arrangements for them!","Xia Jinyuan felt that his girlfriend had solved a problem for him.","He rubbed Ye Jian’s head and smiled.","“You’ve solved a huge problem for me.","I plan to discuss it with my comrades when I go back and see if they’re willing to accept the girlfriends allocated to them by the country.","If they’re willing, I plan to propose the plan to Major General Yang and arrange blind dates for my comrades.”","Hearing this, Ye Jian widened her eyes and said in surprise, “I was just joking.","You’re taking it seriously!”","Having the country allocate the soldiers girlfriends?","She was just saying it casually!","Why did Captain Xia take it seriously?","“Yes, I’m taking it seriously.","It’s a feasible idea.","There are many bachelors in our team.","I’ve been in the team for a few years.","So far, only two couples have gotten married.","One is G3, and the other is Pigeon.","“There are only so many old team members.","More than half of them are bachelors.","As the captain, I’m quite worried about their marriage.","I have to think of a way to solve this problem.”","The military unit wasn’t as open as it was in the future, where ordinary people could understand life in the military unit.","Right now, everything was under closed management.","Unauthorized people couldn’t gain any insight at all.","The security was so tight that ordinary people didn’t know what the military unit looked like.","Soldiers couldn’t go out casually either.","Hence, if they wanted to find a girlfriend, they had to rely on their families to introduce them.","Especially special forces soldiers with high-risk occupations like Xia Jinyuan.","They didn’t even have a holiday at the end of the year.","Their families couldn’t introduce them to prospective dates even if they wanted to.","These soldiers could only rely on the military unit to solve this problem."]},{"number":4222,"title":"Chapter 4222 Envious","paragraphs":["Chapter 4222: Envious","Chapter 4222: Envious Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan talked about the current situation in the Xueyu unit.","Ye Jian felt the same way.","When he mentioned that their comrades sometimes rejected women due to their profession, Ye Jian felt sad.","Compared to her comrades’ single lives, she and Captain Xia were very lucky.","“Cousin-in-law’s love life has to be handled as soon as possible.","He’s a year older than me.","Soon, he’ll be 30 years old.","He needs to get married and have children.”","As he spoke, Xia Jinyuan went back to the matter of his cousin-in-law.","If his cousin-in-law’s love life was fixed, he probably wouldn’t keep an eye on him and the little fox anymore.","Xia JInyuan e was under a lot of pressure to have a cousin-in-law who was so protective of Ye Jian.","Ye Jian nodded in agreement and said softly, “Grandpa said the same thing.","Cousin is almost 30 years old.","He’s been alone for so many years.","He should have someone by his side.","Last time, Grandpa mentioned it to my father.","My father said that the female soldiers in the navy are rare treasures.","Even the admin officer at sea is a male soldier.","It’ll be difficult for Cousin to find a girlfriend at sea.","“Now that you’ve mentioned it, I have to urge my cousin too.","He needs to hurry up and find a girlfriend.","The only person I can think of is Zhou Niannian.”","There was a hint of heaviness in her soft voice.","Her cousin was actually the same as her.","No one had doted on him since he was young.","He had to rely on himself to survive.","Her cousin would definitely become the pillar of the country just like he was in her past life.","As for herself, fortunately, she didn’t live in vain.","She finally lived a good life.","She had already found Captain Xia.","She hoped that her cousin would find a woman as soon as possible so that he wouldn’t feel lonely anymore.","She hoped that he would have someone to be concerned about every time he came back.","Xia Jinyuan felt that it wasn’t that Li Jinnian couldn’t find a girlfriend.","Even if he didn’t have a strong family background, he would be able find a girlfriend.","Even if he just walked on the streets, he would definitely be able to win countless hearts.","It depended on whether Li Jinnian was willing to date or not.","The two of them chatted carefully and arrived at the library.","Normal couples would have endless things to say when they were together.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian didn’t have much time to talk like this.","Xia Jinyuan would have to return to the military tomorrow afternoon.","Then, he would immediately return to the military unit and leave for more than a year.","As the captain of the Xueyu unit, he couldn’t even get a month of rest.","After a few days of rest, he would be busy again.","Both of them knew that tomorrow was the day they would be separated.","Neither of them mentioned it.","They just spoke gently along the way.","The sorrow of parting didn’t make them furrow their brows, nor did it affect their moods at this moment.","They accepted it calmly because they were used to it.","Li Jinnian, who was walking away silently, walked to the huge sports ground.","The sports ground had already fallen silent without the intense training during the day.","Li Jinnian walked slowly along the sports ground.","His facial expression was indifferent, and one couldn’t tell what he was thinking.","Perhaps he wasn’t thinking about anything, or perhaps he was thinking about all kinds of problems.","He had always been so lonely.","He was used to being alone and indifferent.","Even if he walked alone with no one by his side, he wouldn’t feel anything.","But tonight, for the first time, Li Jinnian felt a little lonely.","He had personally handed his younger cousin to another man.","He looked at the other man who was meticulously caring and considerate.","He looked at the couple standing in front of him.","Even if there were hardships, their love could not be broken.","At that moment, he felt gratified but also a little envious."]},{"number":4223,"title":"Chapter 4223 A Little Impulse","paragraphs":["Chapter 4223: A Little Impulse","Chapter 4223: A Little Impulse Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Six of the Xia family was lucky to find Ye Jian.","From then on, he would have Ye Jian by his side.","From then on, he had someone he would always be concerned about.","With the lover he loved the most in his life, they could hold hands, fight, and spend the rest of their time together in the future.","Li Jinnian suddenly felt envious of this kind of love.","He was so envious that he even felt a little tempted.","He wondered if he should find a woman who could hold hands with him.","A woman who could hold hands with him until they grew old and would only love him for the rest of their lives.","In an instant, his heart was moved.","He walked from the training hall to the sports ground.","After walking for almost 15 minutes, he still couldn’t suppress the emotions in his heart.","Not only could he not suppress them, but he also felt so lonely when he looked up at the sky that was filled with stars.","Loneliness!","Li Jinnian stopped in his tracks and pursed his thin lips.","Why did he suddenly feel lonely?","Wasn’t this how it had been for so many years?","How could he be lonely?","How could he be envious of his cousin’s love so much that he wanted to find a woman to hold hands with?","He couldn’t just find a woman to hold hands with just because he wanted to.","Forget it.","With his profession, he shouldn’t delay a woman’s youth.","He didn’t return home often and prioritized the military unit for everything.","His food, clothes, and transportation were all in the military unit.","He rarely came back! After thinking about it, Li Jinnian felt that it was better not to find a girlfriend.","Not everyone was as lucky as Little Six of the Xia family to find a girlfriend like Ye Jian.","He put the cell phone back into his pocket.","Something blue flashed past, and a string of numbers could be vaguely seen on the screen.","It was Zhou Niannian’s number, which she had left for Li Jinnian.","This was a woman who had left a deep impression on him.","He wasn’t moved by her.","He just felt that she was very interesting.","When she made his grandpa laugh and every time he looked at her, he felt like he was looking at an animal! She reminded him of a little monkey.","She was like an agile and interesting monkey, easily making Grandpa laugh.","Her personality was completely different from Ye Jian’s.","She looked carefree, but she was actually very meticulous.","Her words were quite interesting and elegant.","Grandpa liked her very much.","A little fox and a little monkey.","As luck would have it, they met each other and worked together to catch criminals.","It was fate.","Zhou Niannian was the only woman Li Jinnian had interacted with for so many years.","That was why she left a deep impression on him.","That was why when he was tempted and wondered if he should find a girlfriend too, she was the only person he thought of.","“I have to calm down,” Li Jinnian said in a low voice.","He seemed to have made a decision and took out his phone from his pocket again.","He pressed the screen and deleted Zhou Niannian’s phone number.","It was better to be alone.","If he was lonely, so be it.","Why did he have to harm an innocent woman?","He just suddenly wanted to find a woman to hold hands with.","Besides his cousin, there was only one other woman on his phone.","He only had a first impression of her.","There was no need to think too much about it.","After deleting Zhou Niannian’s number, Li Jinnian didn’t continue to walk around the sports ground alone.","He left the sports ground.","The night engulfed his figure.","The sports ground was very quiet, and the starry sky was very bright.","The trace of temptation disappeared.","The next afternoon, Ye Jian sent Xia Jinyuan off.","Before she could feel sad, Li Jinnian, who was supposed to stay for two more days, left in a hurry as well.","He didn’t even have the time to say anything to Ye Jian.","When Ye Jian knew about it, it was already nighttime."]},{"number":4224,"title":"Chapter 4224 Something Happened","paragraphs":["Chapter 4224: Something Happened","Chapter 4224: Something Happened Editor: Henyee Translations","She only came back half an hour late from the combat training room.","Her cousin, who was supposed to leave two days later, had left too.","He was so anxious that he didn’t even have time to say goodbye.","Could it be that something urgent happened in the military unit and they called him back?","Yes, that was right.","Besides an emergency in the military unit, there was nothing else that could make Li Jinnian leave so anxiously.","As she didn’t send Li Jinnian off and Xia Jinyuan had left today, Ye Jian, who had always been laidback, was in a bad mood.","Captain Xia should have reached the military by now.","It was already 10:00 pm.","He might have returned to the military unit.","Time passed quickly.","Similarly, Captain Xia, who was chasing after time, was exceptionally busy.","They had only been apart for a few hours.","Ye Jian, who had yet to get used to it, lay on the bed with her eyes open.","She didn’t fall asleep until past midnight.","She was the only one in the dormitory.","He Jing and Xu Wen followed an instructor to a conference in the provincial military district.","Ye Jian was in charge of simulating combat exercises, so she didn’t go with them.","The simulation of combat was a computer-based combat exercise for sand tables, computers, and maps.","This was the first time the National Science University had completed a combat confrontation with the Army Point Academy on the internet.","It was also the first time the military schools had started a computer-based simulation.","Hence, the two schools attached great importance to it.","This was a monumental process.","Starting such a simulation battle could first facilitate communication between the military schools and the students.","The confrontation between the two armies would start in the four cities in the south.","The students of the National Science University would be on the defense until the soldiers were defeated.","The conference for the competition was today.","The competition on the official computer would only start tomorrow.","After sending off her lover and cousin, Ye Jian only experienced one night of discomfort.","The next day, she threw herself into the nervous mock competition.","The meeting for the competition was today.","The official competition on the computer would only start tomorrow.","After sending off her lover and family, Ye Jian only had one night of discomfort.","The next day, she threw herself into the nervous mock competition.","Big Shark, who came to fetch Li Jinnian, reported the latest situation as he walked, “One of the Lyabi peacekeeping forces has already died.","One electromagnetic commissioner and three students sent by our country, as well as one interpreter, are still missing.","The location of their disappearance is the Garoway Coast!”","It was inconvenient for Big Shark to talk on the phone.","Now that Li Jinnian was at the base, he had to hurry up and report the information they had received to Demon King Li.","Li Jinnian, who was codenamed the ‘Demon King’ of the Storm Commando Brigade, knew the entire situation before he reached the combat command building.","The electromagnetic expert and three students were all from the National Science University.","The interpreter was an Australian student who joined the army last winter.","He was outstanding and had some skills.","Two days ago, they boarded a ship and disappeared.","The Chinese peacekeeping force that entered Lyabi immediately supported the investigation.","In the end, a peacekeeping soldier was sacrificed.","The Chinese soldiers who went to do peacekeeping were armed with light weapons.","Their main focus was on medical and engineering construction.","In addition, the 14-year-long civil war destroyed the entire country’s security system.","The Chinese peacekeeping soldiers were in danger as they didn’t have enough manpower.","After two days of fruitless searches and the sacrifice of a peacekeeping soldier, the Chinese military immediately stopped their search and arranged for the special forces to go over as quickly as possible.","The location of the disappearance was the seaside.","After much consideration, the military decided to send an amphibious combat team that had not even been formed for five years to the Libya Garoway Coast."]},{"number":4225,"title":"Chapter 4225 Combat","paragraphs":["Chapter 4225: Combat","Chapter 4225: Combat Editor: Henyee Translations","This was the first time the Storm Commando Brigade needed to go overseas for a mission.","Moreover, it was a country that had 14 years of internal war and was filled with danger.","As the captain, Li Jinnian said to the 12 water ghosts with a cold expression, “Do you want to achieve something big?”","“Yes!”","The 12 soldiers replied to Li Jinnian with loud voices and morale.","“I want to too.” Li Jinnian’s cold gaze surged.","It was like an undercurrent in the depths of the calm sea.","Although it was turbulent, it wouldn’t be easily discovered.","“I want to too, but I hope you can always remember that we only live once We have to find the missing people, but we also need to come back alive.","Their lives, as well as ours, must be kept intact!","“Did you hear that?!”","Li Jinnian, who had always been calm, kept his composure even when he yelled out the last part.","His voice didn’t rise much.","However, there was an unstoppable sharpness in his tone.","It was cold and shot straight into everyone’s hearts like an arrow, leaving a deep impression on all the water ghosts.","Li Jinnian had to bring all of the missing people back.","As for his comrades, he had to make sure they returned alive as well.","It hadn’t been easy for the Storm Commando Brigade to achieve what they had today.","Every water ghost was a drop of the country’s blood.","The expert and students had to be fine.","The interpreter had to be fine as well.","Similarly, Li Jinnian’s comrades had to be fine as well.","After bringing them out to complete the mission, he would bring them back to the country.","Li Jinnian arrived at the combat command building less than two hours later.","At 2:17 am, he and the 12 water ghosts went to Garoway Coast of Libya.","This time, they took a private plane.","They went overseas overnight.","Ye Jian, who was at the National Science University, was sleeping.","When Li Jinnian arrived at Garoway Coast, Ye Jian was fighting with the students from the Army Point Academy.","In the first simulation battle, and they recovered the mountain.","The AC point was the first line of defense for the invading party.","There were continuous trenches, many cover bodies, machine guns, and wire defense areas.","There were still independent machine guns and strongholds between the first and second defense lines.","It was obvious that the invaders had strengthened the first and second defense lines.","As the reclamation party, if Ye Jian wanted to bring her troops to take down the mountain, the first and second defense lines had to be taken down.","The other party’s cover and machine guns had to be destroyed.","“If it’s normal combat, we just need to send the artillery.","Our field of vision is good.","It provides an advantageous offensive condition for our soldiers’ artillery.”","On the screen, Ye Jian’s figure appeared in the eyes of the leaders of the National Science University, the military, and the instructors of the two schools.","The young female student analyzed the layout of the entire battlefield calmly and achieved control.","“The invading party deployed a large number of machine guns between the defense lines and stopped our soldiers’ attack.","Without the support of artillery firepower, we will have to pay a painful price.","Hence, I sent three battalions and a battle artillery team to enter!”","The laser pointer pointed at the three-dimensional mountain that appeared on the screen.","It then moved to a mountain pass.","“This is the weak spot of the invading party.","I’ll kill my way in from the back wing and coordinate with the front wing.","We’ll kill from both wings and take down the defense of the second defense line first.”","Ye Jian’s voice was clear and melodious.","Even though she only appeared on the screen and wasn’t standing in front of them, the leaders who were sitting and watching the entire combat simulation could feel a murderous aura from the battlefield."]},{"number":4226,"title":"Chapter 4226 Careless","paragraphs":["Chapter 4226: Careless","Chapter 4226: Careless Editor: Henyee Translations","By the time Ye Jian finished giving instructions, the leaders of the National Science University were already smiling.","The National Science University was very confident that they would win this round!","The expression of the Army Point Academy’s leader was a little serious.","The combat commander sent by the National Science University looked young, but she was quite experienced in combat.","After the Army Point Academy’s side was set up, the National Science University had 15 minutes to consider before accepting the battle.","This way, there were 15 minutes of additional combat adjustments on the Army Point Academy’s side.","In the end!","Less than three minutes after the team from the Army Point Academy finished setting up, the National Science University immediately accepted the challenge and started their corresponding combat deployment.","Unknowingly, the students felt pressured.","Even if they realized the problem now, the National Science University had already been deployed.","They couldn’t change it.","If the National Science University hadn’t started their combat deployment immediately, with the ability of the academy students, they would definitely find a weak spot within 15 minutes and make adjustments.","Unfortunately, it was already too late.","From the start to the end, the National Science University didn’t give the commander of the Army Point Academy another chance to observe the entire combat deployment.","They found the weak spot and started the simulation battle.","The expression of the leader of the Army Point Academy was extremely serious.","This time, the National Science University had a high chance of winning.","After Ye Jian finished setting up, the simulation battle started immediately.","She was no longer on the screen.","There was only the sound of gunpowder and bullets.","Ye Jian disappeared from the screen and stood beside the sand table.","She and the other two combat staff officers started planning their next attack.","“After we take down the first and second defense lines, we’ll occupy this place!” She picked up the small plastic red flag with the number ‘511’ on it and placed it on a small hill.","“We’ll occupy this position on the 511 high ground.","Then, we’ll place the battle artillery team here and carry out an all-round harvest on the invading party!","We will force them back here!”","A small red flag with the number ‘513’ written on it was placed on a small hill.","At that time, the entire sand table layout would become the battle artillery team of the 511 high ground against the invading party of the 513 high ground.","This game would be a win for them.","Even though the entire battle situation was simulated, the sound of artillery shells and bullets was so real that it seemed like they were really in a war.","The leaders who were watching the entire process had serious expressions, as if they were at an event location.","The sound of the computer keyboard was heard.","The entire simulation battle had reached its climax.","Cold sweat was already dripping down the forehead of the student from the Army Point Academy.","Especially as the combat commander, he frowned as he stared at the entire battle situation.","He stood motionless in front of the screen and observed the entire battle.","The first simulation ended.","They recovering side won, occupied the 511 high ground, and forced the invading party to retreat to the 513 high ground.","Then, they launched a reaping combat.","The invading party was defeated.","A student beside saw that the battle had ended.","He said to the combat commander, “The commander of the other party is Ye Jian.","I participated in a competition with her the last time and saw her ability.","She’s very powerful and meticulous.","She blocked the provocations of the students from South Korea and Japan and taught them a lesson.","At that time, we had nothing but admiration for her.”","This was a student who had participated in the martial arts competition organized by the various military schools with Ye Jian and 16 other students.","He had seen how powerful Ye Jian was and reminded them not to be too careless.","If they were a little careless, they would lose everything.","While Ye Jian was simulating combat with the students of the National Science University, things in Shuikou Village were a little chaotic.","Two strangers entered the village and asked if there was a middle-aged woman called Red Plum in the village."]},{"number":4227,"title":"Chapter 4227 Ill Intentions","paragraphs":["Chapter 4227: Ill Intentions","Chapter 4227: Ill Intentions Editor: Henyee Translations","Shuikou Village was remote and didn’t have many tourist resources.","After entering the 21st century, the young people in the village started to go out to work.","Right on the heels of that, their fathers also went out of the mountains to work in the big cities to earn money.","Now, life in the village was getting better and better.","The villagers’ knowledge was getting better and better too.","Even their vigilance had changed drastically.","Especially since Shuikou Village was a village near the garrison.","Every year, the villagers would hold many information security meetings.","In this aspect, the villagers of Shuikou Village were even more cautious than the residents of the town.","Uncle Hai looked at the two strangers who suddenly came to the village to ask questions.","He stared at the two strangers vigilantly and replied, “I don’t know her.”","Red Plum, Snow Plum, Autumn Plum! There were so many of them in the village.","The older generation chose names based on what sounded nice.","Hence, there were many similar names.","Besides, they knew that it was not a good thing that strangers were entering the village to ask around.","They had to be vigilant at all times and not speak nonsense.","If they did, they would harm others.","If they were careless, they would become traitors.","Most of the villagers who stayed behind were old.","They had been doing farm work for their entire lives.","They didn’t like outsiders, nor did they like strangers coming into their lives.","Before the strangers could finish speaking, Uncle Hai said in a stiff tone, “Hurry up and get out.","There’s no one called Red Plum in our village.","Go to the neighboring village and ask.”","“Mister, we’re here to look for our former comrade.","Think about it again.","Is there a woman in the village who used to be a soldier like us?","I’m 43 this year.","This is my wife.”","The stranger who asked the question was dressed appropriately in a suit and leather shoes.","He was holding a briefcase in his hand and looked like an intellectual.","His wife was wearing a dark red and gold velvet shirt and pants.","She was also wearing a thin and long milky white knitted sweater.","Her aura was gentle, like a teacher.","Uncle Hai ignored them.","He didn’t even think about it.","He carried his hoe and came out of the paddy field.","He casually pulled off the two leeches on his calf and used the hoe in his hand to cut them into two.","Blood flowed from the side of the paddy field into the green stalks.","The leeches that were cut into two were still twisting and struggling.","The middle-aged woman was frightened.","She took a step back with a look of disdain in her eyes.","Uncle Hai snorted when he saw this.","He picked up his hoe again and walked barefooted through the mud.","He stopped talking to the two of them.","Comrade?","Did they think that he had never seen a soldier before?","A few days ago, a group of soldiers was having a long training.","They even ran past the village.","The villagers’ lack of cooperation made the two of them anxious.","The old master had instructed the couple to find out Red Plum’s residence and personal information.","They couldn’t return empty-handed.","Since this person wouldn’t cooperate with them, they would look for someone else.","“Find a woman and give her some money to get her to talk.” The middle-aged woman came up with an idea.","Money talked.","She didn’t believe that the peasant women in this poor village wouldn’t want money.","There were definitely people who were greedy for money.","However, they had been alerted by the various security meetings held by the military unit.","As long as it was related to the military unit, there were no such thing as small matters.","If they were not careful, they would be sentenced for leaking any kind of news.","Even if they were greedy for money, they knew that the money they got would be useless if they had to go behind bars."]},{"number":4228,"title":"Chapter 4228 It Would Be A Sacrifice","paragraphs":["Chapter 4228: It Would Be A Sacrifice","Chapter 4228: It Would Be A Sacrifice Editor: Henyee Translations","Aunt Qiu took the 100 yuan.","Then, she pointed out a bunch of ‘Red Plums’.","She even mentioned the ‘Red Plums’ from the neighboring village.","She spoke in the local dialect and even brought the two strangers to the houses of the two ‘Red Plums’ in Shuikou Village.","After sending off the two strangers, Aunt Qiu even smiled and said, “Come often when you’re free.”","They spent almost half a day in the village but didn’t gain anything.","Instead, they spent 100 yuan.","The facial expressions of the two people weren’t as good as when they came.","They had spent money and seen Red Plums, but they weren’t the Red Plum they were looking for.","The middle-aged woman didn’t have any hope anymore.","“We’ve already walked through three villages.","Since we haven’t found anything, we can only return to the capital city.”","“The old master has high hopes.","If we can’t get any news, it won’t be easy for us to report to him when we go back.” The middle-aged man held the blurry photo in his hand.","It was a black and white photo taken in 1979.","It had been 24 or 25 years.","The photo itself was unclear, and it had been a long time.","Even if the person in the photo appeared, they wouldn’t be able to recognize her.","After leaving Shuikou Village, the two of them continued to ask around in the surrounding villages.","Aunt Qiu, who had taken the money but didn’t actually help them, ran to Zhang Defu’s house.","He was still the village leader.","She quickly told the village leader that two strangers had entered the village and asked about a female soldier called Red Plum.","“There aren’t many female soldiers in the village.","Ye Jian is one of them, and Ye Jian’s mother is another.","However, the names don’t match.","I thought that it would be a waste not to take 100 yuan, so I just brought the two of them to the two families in the village and let them meet ‘Red Plum’.”","Zhang Defu’s expression changed when he heard that Aunt Qiu took the strangers’ 100 yuan.","However, at least Aunt Qiu had emphasized the main point, so he didn’t flare up.","Although Aunt Qiu had never walked out of the village, she was a shrewd person.","She knew what she could say and what she could not.","Otherwise, how could she have angered Sun Dongqing back then?","This person was smart.","“If anyone spreads the news about the girl and her mother, there’ll be a problem.","I won’t talk about you taking advantage of the situation since you’re just a woman.","But if you ruin things, the people from the village will no longer acknowledge you.”","If Aunt Qiu was accused for treason, the entire village would not be able to raise their heads for generations.","No matter where they went, they would be criticized.","“I have to call the military unit.","I have to let the higher-ups know that strangers have dropped by the village.”","Due to the military unit’s teachings, the villagers of Shuikou Village, who were closest to the military unit, knew that something was wrong with the situation.","They immediately informed the military unit.","With the villagers’ cooperation, they caught several people who wanted to go into the mountains to take photos.","Before the two strangers who asked about Red Plum left Fujun Town, Commander Xia already knew about them.","As for the information about the martyr, Red Plum, it had been erased.","The village she was in when she was alive only knew her as Sun Xueqing and not Red Plum.","The strangers carried around a group photo and asked the villagers if they knew Red Plum.","However, no one knew that Red Plum was Sun Xueqing.","As for the martyr memorial park, Sun Xueqing’s photo had been taken down.","The name carved on the tombstone was ‘Tomb of the Martyr, Red Plum’.","Even if they went to the martyr park, they wouldn’t gain anything.","Although everything had been arranged, they couldn’t let down their guard.","Since th eother party had already investigated Shuikou Village, they might find more information."]},{"number":4229,"title":"Chapter 4229 Hasty Footsteps","paragraphs":["Chapter 4229: Hasty Footsteps","Chapter 4229: Hasty Footsteps Editor: Henyee Translations","For instance, the other party could receive new information through Red Plum’s former comrades.","It was possble.","The military was trying their best to find Red Plum’s comrades in the military unit when she was alive, especially the people who passed on false news to Commissioner Cai and the others who wanted to help Red Plum.","Back then, after this person passed the news of Ye Jian’s drowning to Commissioner Cai and the rest, he lost contact with all his comrades.","His whereabouts were still unknown.","The military couldn’t find this person through his household registration.","From this, they suspected that this person had already changed his name and identity.","They were either still in the country or! had gone overseas.","The country was huge, and the world was even bigger.","Even an entity as powerful as the military would have a hard time finding someone who last appeared in public more than ten years ago.","The two strangers were no longer watched by the villagers.","Instead, the scout stationed deep in the mountains of Shuikou Village kept an eye on them.","He kept an eye on them for three days and only returned to the military unit after seeing them leave Fujun Town empty-handed.","At this moment, Ye Jian had ended her two-day simulation actual combat exercise with the Army Point Academy.","She was the combat commander.","After the outcome was decided, she would definitely have to start writing reports.","She wouldn’t just write detailed analysis of the outcome of the battle.","She would also point out the shortcomings, advantages, and improvements of the simulation system.","Busy and fulfilling was Ye Jian’s life in the military school.","The lights in the dormitory and the classroom were turned off on time.","Ye Jian and a few staff officers went to the library to write their reports.","They couldn’t drag it out.","The longer they dragged it out, the more trouble they would have.","“The vanguard unit of the Army Point Academy met the reconnaissance team we sent out.","If we wanted to get the upper hand in the encounter, we had to see who would react first and shoot first.","“Our reconnaissance team had always kept our weapons on standby.","As for the ground-based advance military unit, they were in a forward state and hadn’t entered a standby state.","Gaining the upper hand in an encounter depends on who opens fire first and suppresses the firepower in the most violent method in an instant.","That party then stands a high chance of becoming the winner.","“And if we win, the frontline military unit will lose.","However, we still made a huge mistake.","The frontline military unit led the vanguard and didn’t lock onto the support unit’s position in time.","Hence, we lost in the second half.”","In a corner of the library, Ye Jian printed out the map.","The tip of the pencil slid slowly, pointing out the shortcomings of the two sides.","The three staff officers nodded from time to time and took relevant notes.","Another document recorded their discussion into a computer.","The report couldn’t be written casually, especially the combat report.","They had to analyze the entire battle situation again before they could release the report.","By the time Ye Jian and the rest finished their analysis and looked up at the time, it was already 1:00 am.","At 1:00 am, the library was rather quiet.","There were two lights on in the corner.","Actually, the surroundings were pitch-black.","It was so quiet that someone yawned.","Suddenly, they heard rapid footsteps that were louder than the noises during the day.","Ye Jian and the rest looked up at the library door.","It was very dark there.","It was so dark that only rows of shelves with books could be seen.","The door was pushed open.","Ye Jian stood up and smiled at the student who was breathing heavily.","“It’s a student from my dormitory.","Continue tidying up.","I’ll go take a look.”","It was He Jing.","She only returned to school this afternoon."]},{"number":4230,"title":"Chapter 4230 Urgent","paragraphs":["Chapter 4230: Urgent","Chapter 4230: Urgent Editor: Henyee Translations","He Jing and Xu Wen had followed an instructor to the provincial military district for a meeting.","They didn’t participate in the combat exercise.","It was already 1:00 am, but He Jing still rushed to the library.","It was obvious that something urgent had happened.","In the corner of the library, a few students joked, “We’ve been classmates for three years.","Ye Jian knows who it is just by listening to the footsteps.","Do you think she can recognize the footsteps of all the students?”","This was a joke.","It was 1:00 am, and everyone was sleepy.","They needed to find ways to freshen themselves up.","“Ye Jian is extraordinary.","She might really be able to do that.","Hey, have you heard?","A few days ago, a senior came back.","It’s said that he was a famous person in our military school like Ye Jian.","I heard from the freshmen that Ye Jian sparred with the senior, and she didn’t lose.","She even forced that senior to be unable to resist for a few rounds.”","This student started a topic.","The other two immediately became interested and nodded.","“I heard about it.","Our class has been spreading the news for the past few days too.","I even heard them saying that the combat skills Ye Jian used aren’t taught by the instructors.","They were all lethal combat skills.”","“Yes, yes, I heard about that too.","The instructor said that Ye Jian’s close combat skills are Maga.","Combined with the mixed combat skills, even the instructor might not be Ye Jian’s match in a real fight.”","After this student finished speaking, the other two students fell silent.","After a while, the students who started the conversation placed their hands on the table and said in a low voice, “Do you still remember when Ye Jian came to report for school?","“At that time, Ye Jian only came over when the military training was about to end.","In the end, she passed all the regular military training.”","They were all third-year students.","Even though three years had passed, they still remembered the time they entered the school as freshmen.","Thinking back, it seemed like it only happened yesterday.”","“Why don’t I remember this?","I only met Ye Jian during the march.","At that time, I thought that she looked more like a soldier than the fourth-year senior who was training us.”","“We’re not in the same class, so I didn’t see Ye Jian’s performance when she joined.","I saw Ye Jian during the flag-raising ceremony.","At that time, I thought that the flag bearer was an instructor.","Her posture was as straight as a gun.","She looked like a soldier.”","The person organizing the documents didn’t add to the conversation.","He heard what they were discussing and wanted to say that what left the deepest impression on him was Ye Jian’s shooting posture that was even more precise than what was shown in textbooks.","Unfortunately, he didn’t have the time to join this topic.","He had to enter all the information into the computer.","Tomorrow, Ye Jian would hand the report over to the leader.","Ye Jian had already seen He Jing.","She didn’t turn on the lights and simply walked over.","She ended up giving He Jing a scare when she hurriedly pushed the door open.","He Jing calmed herself down and panted.","She said in a low voice, “Quick, the leader is looking for you.","He said that there’s something very urgent for you to do.","Put down all your work.","Don’t waste any time.”","The leader of the department personally went to the dormitory to look for Ye Jian, but he couldn’t find her.","Hence, she, Xu Wen, and the leader split up to look for Ye Jian.","There were many places for students to train at night in the school.","Sometimes, the company training hall would be open.","Ye Jian would usually go to one of three places at nightâ€”the sports ground, the library, and the training hall."]},{"number":4231,"title":"Chapter 4231 Another March","paragraphs":["Chapter 4231: Another March","Chapter 4231: Another March Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing this, Ye Jian’s eyes darkened.","She nodded and said in a low voice, “Okay, I’ll go over and inform the rest first.","I’ll be quick!”","They were just a little short of their report.","She had already mentioned the important points.","They just needed to polish them.","She had to first inform the few students who were burning the midnight oil.","When Ye Jian said that she had something urgent to do and needed to leave, the few students immediately nodded, indicating that they would complete the task.","Ye Jian gave a few more instructions and even highlighted three points before leaving hurriedly with He Jing.","“Why are they in such a hurry?","What happened?","Did something happen to their class?”","“Something must have happened.","They got Ye Jian to rush over at this time.","I’m afraid it’s a big matter.”","“Let’s not talk about Ye Jian first.","Even if something happens, they won’t let us know.","Come, come, let’s hurry up and go through the information again.","Let’s discuss the main points Ye Jian pointed out and see if there’s anything to add.”","“Alright, let’s hurry up and see if we can finish things up at 3:00 am.","Fortunately, Ye Jian has analyzed all the important points, so things progressed very quickly.","If not, this report would definitely have many shortcomings.”","The lights in a corner of the library were on.","Four students leaned on the table and immersed themselves in their work.","Ye Jian jogged all the way to the office of the department leader.","When the department leader, who had already returned to the office, heard her from the door, he immediately said, “Come in quickly.”","Ye Jian pushed the door open and saw the leader holding the phone.","His expression was solemn as he said, “Ye Jian is here.","I’ll pass the phone to her now.”","It wasn’t the leader looking for Ye Jian.","It was! the military.","At 1:30 am, Ye Jian didn’t have time to pack her luggage.","She put on her camouflage pants and short-sleeved shirt before rushing into the car that would bring her to the military airport.","The entire journey took three hours on the highway.","Ye Jian boarded a military plane at six in the morning and flew straight to the capital city.","In the capital city, a plane to Libya was supposed to take off at 7:45 am.","However, due to special reasons, it was delayed for an entire hour and took off at 8:45 am.","The plane didn’t take off on time.","The airport had already made preparations, so it didn’t affect the subsequent flights.","At 8:40 am, Ye Jian boarded the plane to Libya.","She was alone with a phone and the 500 USD that the military gave her when they picked her up.","A cell phone, 500 USD, and a student ID were all that was in Ye Jian’s luggage.","She was also the only passenger who boarded the plane empty-handed.","She was sitting in the first-class cabin.","The crew knew that the plane was delayed because they were waiting for the woman in camouflage to board the plane.","After breakfast, the flight attendant said carefully, “Tell us if there’s anything you need.” Then, she left softly.","Ye Jian needed to sleep.","After breakfast, she asked for a thin blanket and an eye mask.","She needed to get enough sleep during the ten-hour flight to Libya.","That was because after getting off the plane, she would enter combat mode directly.","There was no time buffer.","Yang Heng, the interpreter, had gone missing.","A few students from the National Science University’s electromagnetic laboratory had gone missing too.","There was also an expert who went missing.","They went out to sea and disappeared along with their ship.","The radar showed a small island.","Li Jinnian led the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade to find the island.","A missing ship had appeared, but they couldn’t find the missing people."]},{"number":4232,"title":"Chapter 4232 A Coward Is Not A Son","paragraphs":["Chapter 4232: A Coward Is Not A Son","Chapter 4232: A Coward Is Not A Son Editor: Henyee Translations","When Yang Heng came back to the National Science University, he left after a few days.","When he left, Ye Jian didn’t send him off.","Who knew that he would go missing?","The last time he came to the school, he didn’t say where he would go.","It was just that when they were chatting alone, he said that he had to practice his shooting later because he knew where he was going to do business.","There was no harm in practicing his shooting.","She wondered if he had practiced.","As an interpreter who entered a country with internal strife, he should be equipped with light weapons for basic self-defense.","The three students were all knowledgeable in the electromagnetic field.","Although they hadn’t become ‘big shots’, it was only a matter of time.","Sooner or later, they would become electromagnetic experts and the backbone of the country.","There was no need to mention the electromagnetic expert.","A huge project had already started.","The main direction was the electromagnetic catapult technology.","They were the ‘big shots’ in the field of electromagnetic launch technology.","The three students were the disciples of this electromagnetic expert.","The teacher and the students disappeared together.","Ye Jian was a little worried that the students would put themselves in danger to protect the teacher.","Ye Jian didn’t fall asleep immediately.","She kept thinking about it.","She seemed to be asleep, but she was actually very awake.","After thinking for about two hours, Ye Jian slowly relaxed her mind and fell asleep.","Xia Jinyuan, who had already arrived at the military unit and started training all the special forces soldiers, didn’t know that his girlfriend was going overseas for a mission.","The special forces soldiers he recruited before he left had already become veterans who had been in the Xueyu unit for two years.","As for him, he had been away for more than a year for a mission.","He hadn’t ‘communicated’ with the veterans who had been there for two years.","Now that he was back, he naturally had to make use of the time to ‘communicate’.","Once he noticed any problems, he would fix their bad habits immediately.","His ‘communication’ was very simple.","It only took one day for the 30 veterans to be beaten up by Xia Jinyuan.","They couldn’t even raise their heads.","On the second day after he came back, Xia Jinyuan waved his hand and increased the intensity of his training!","Not only did he increase the intensity of the training, but he also wrote a few big words with a brush that made the 30 veterans choke in their hearts.","He pasted transparent tape on the slogan on the training ground.","‘Cowards are not welcome.’","These words were written on white paper and black.","They were very big.","Every time they ran a circle, the 30 veterans would pass by these words.","They were so embarrassed that their faces turned red.","G3, Yin Rong, was helpless too.","He had never understood what the captain was thinking.","One moment, Xia Jinyuan looked like he was smiling.","The next, dark clouds seemed to loom above his head.","Even the veterans who had been on the battlefield with him were so frightened that their hearts were pounding.","The captain, who was almost 30 years old, was even more terrifying than he was a few years ago.","It was even more so when he smiled one second, only to turn gloomy the next.","His killing intent seemed to be able to shoot them in the heart.","Xia Jinyuan was busy training the veterans.","He didn’t have much rest after coming back for two days, let alone have the time to call his girlfriend.","Even if he and Ye Jian were in the country, they couldn’t call each other even once a month.","Ye Jian was going overseas to cooperate with Li Jinnian on a mission while Xia Jinyuan was dealing with the special forces soldiers who didn’t meet his expectations.","Li Jinnian was already waiting for his cousin to come over.","The male soldiers had a huge goal here.","Sometimes, their hostile gazes when asking questions gave Li Jinnian a headache."]},{"number":4233,"title":"Chapter 4233 Ruins","paragraphs":["Chapter 4233: Ruins","Chapter 4233: Ruins Editor: Henyee Translations","The scariest thing about their investigation was that they kept coming across hurdles.","Li Jinnian and the rest found the missing ship, but the search didn’t go smoothly.","In the end, they realized that the female military surgeon from the peacekeeping force could enter the village and communicate with the locals.","Big Shark suggested to Li Jinnian that they should get a skilled female soldier to come over.","Getting a skilled female soldier to come over?","Who should they get?","Li Jinnian, who also realized that female soldiers could lower the vigilance of the locals, fell silent.","The only female soldier he thought of was his cousin! Ye Jian.","“Azure Bird, right?","Azure Bird has undergone training with us before, so we have a high chemistry with each other.","It’s very suitable to send her to be the vanguard.”","Big Shark was also thinking about Azure Bird, who had trained with them.","Li Jinnian only thought about it for less than a minute before contacting the country.","Hence, Ye Jian made her way over.","Libya was a country filled with all kinds of dangers.","The civil war had severely destroyed the country’s economy and system.","It was in ruins.","Ye Jian walked out of the airport.","Traces of war could be seen in the airport.","There were bullet holes on the electric poles outside.","Even a billboard was riddled with holes.","It was a shocking sight.","Two peacekeeping soldiers came to pick her up.","In this place, even peacekeeping soldiers couldn’t walk around alone.","There had to be more than two people in a group.","That was because they never knew what danger they would face next.","The two peacekeeping soldiers only arrived in Libya last year.","One year of peacekeeping had allowed them to slowly adapt to the environment in Libya.","When they saw Ye Jian, the smiles on their faces were brighter than the sun.","The first thing Ye Jian did when she got into the car was to take her weapons.","She didn’t have any weapons when she came from the country.","She didn’t even have the time to take her self-defense weapons and silver wire.","She took the bus to the military airport overnight empty-handed.","Then, she transferred to the capital airport of Libya.","Now, she really needed weapons to protect herself.","“Type 95 rifle.","It’s a rifle that all the soldiers in peacekeeping are equipped with.","There’s also a Type 95 soldier bayonet.","The bayonets are not uniform.","The squadron leader specially equipped it separately.","There’s a bulletproof vest, a localizer, a compass, night-vision goggles, and a helmet!”","Ye Jian opened a camouflage bag at the back of the car.","The soldiers sitting in the passenger seat told Ye Jian what individual combat weapons she needed.","The peacekeeping forces tried their best to equip Ye Jian with individual combat weapons.","This was the first time they heard that a female soldier came to support the special forces.","However, since she was specially sent by the country, she was probably an impressive fellow.","If the soldiers didn’t have individual combat weapons, their power would be halved.","Since Ye Jian came empty-handed, the military asked the peacekeeping forces to prepare individual combat weapons for her.","Ye Jian, who was wearing a short-sleeved camouflage uniform, first wore the desert camouflage uniform of the special forces.","Due to the environment, it was easier to hide in the desert camouflage uniform.","She changed her pants in the car.","When Ye Jian took off her pants, the soldiers carefully moved the rearview mirror.","They only adjusted the rearview mirror when Ye Jian had put on her helmet and started checking her guns and ammunition.","“They’ve already found the small town of Covil near the tropical rainforest.","It’s a seven-hour drive from the capital airport.","We’ll send you to the small town of Covil now.","There’s a map inside.","You can take a look at it.”"]},{"number":4234,"title":"Chapter 4234 Gunshots","paragraphs":["Chapter 4234: Gunshots","Chapter 4234: Gunshots Editor: Henyee Translations","Map?","Ye Jian thanked the soldier and immediately unzipped the side of the camouflage bag.","She took out the map and laid it on her lap.","“The location marked with a red pen is near the island where the five of them disappeared.","Our special forces soldiers found the missing ship, but they didn’t find any signs of fighting.","The ship wasn’t destroyed either.","The freshwater resources and food in the ship were all taken away.","Even the fuel in the ship was taken away.","“With the missing ship as the center, the special forces soldiers expanded their search by five kilometers and found footprints.","They weren’t messy, and there was no blood along the way.","From the current situation, it can be judged that the safety of the five missing people is not a problem.","The initial suspicion is that a crew member was bought off and hijacked the ship.”","If the person who hijacked the ship wanted to kill the hostages, he could’ve killed them directly when he hijacked the ship.","Ye Jian asked, “Have they found the family of the crew member?”","“No, he doesn’t have any family,” the peacekeeping soldier said in a low voice.","“He’s a crew member of a nautical company.","He has always been doing assignments for the local nautical company.","Sometimes, our peacekeeping forces would invite him out to sea.","There has never been a problem.”","At the mention of the crew member, the eyes of the peacekeeping soldiers turned cold.","“There are civilians protesting in front.” The peacekeeping soldier driving suddenly whispered.","Before Ye Jian could react, the peacekeeping soldier turned his head and spoke to Ye Jian.","His expression changed drastically.","The car that was originally driving in a straight line quickly turned a corner and rushed into a secondary road where the houses on both sides were in ruins.","The speed of the car was very fast.","The fallen bricks in front were crushed by the tires.","There were gunshots from behind them.","They had to leave the effective shooting range as soon as possible.","“Most of the protests in Libya are carried out by illegal militants.","They gather these poor and suffering people.","They give each of them five to ten dollars.","In less than a day, they can organize hundreds of protests and use the people to pressure the parties.","Sometimes, they even cause casualties.”","The peacekeeping soldier from the passenger seat said with a serious expression, “Our first choice when we encounter a protest is to avoid it.","We can’t have a direct confrontation with these people.","“At the end of last year, the engineers were building a road to the train station that was blown up.","They were interfered with by illegal militants.","Finally, they chose to abandon their car and leave.”","Speaking of the current situation in Libya, the two peacekeeping soldiers’ expressions were especially serious.","As soldiers, they naturally knew the cruelty of war.","However, before they became peacekeeping soldiers, they had always lived in a peaceful country.","When they were in a war-torn country, they had a deeper understanding of the word ‘peace’.","Peace! was not easy to come by!","Gunshots sounded from beside them.","Ye Jian turned around and looked behind her.","She saw the government forces in Libyan military uniforms holding shields and firing at the sky as a warning.","This was the capital airport of Libya and the most important transportation hub in the entire country.","If even the airport was controlled by illegal militants, the country was not far from destruction.","The two peacekeeping soldiers heard the gunshots too.","They sighed softly and smiled bitterly.","The presence of the peacekeeping forces was to reduce tension, control conflicts between armed groups, and stop armed conflicts.","If it was a conflict between the government forces and the citizens of Libya, it would be difficult for the peacekeeping forces to mediate.","Just like now, they could only avoid it.","This wasn’t the first time Ye Jian stood on the territory of a war-torn country.","It wasn’t the first time she saw internal strife in a country either.","Even though she had experienced it before, she still felt depressed when she faced it again."]},{"number":4235,"title":"Chapter 4235 Heartache","paragraphs":["Chapter 4235: Heartache","Chapter 4235: Heartache Editor: Henyee Translations","The atmosphere in the car became a little heavy.","Due to the bad road conditions, the peacekeeping soldiers didn’t say anything else and focused on driving.","The atmosphere in the car only improved a little when there were no more gunshots.","The situation in Libya was very complicated.","The political turmoil was an important reason.","At the end of the 1980s, a civil war broke out in Libya.","The flames of war continued until the 21st century.","The country couldn’t become a country or a home.","All the infrastructure was destroyed, and all the economies continued to grow negatively.","There wasn’t even a decent road in Libya.","The peacekeeping soldiers sent by the country stepped into this piece of land.","Their lives were closely related to this piece of land.","In the face of illegal militants snatching supplies, the peacekeeping soldiers had to stand up and communicate with them.","Snatching supplies was a small matter, but threatening them with guns was not a small matter.","On the journey from the airport to the small town of Covil, Ye Jian encountered four chaoses in less than two hours.","The people marched together in protest and caused a small-scale explosion.","A Western media vehicle was hijacked by illegal militants.","In the end, they used money to solve the disaster.","The other thing was! it was their turn to be ‘forced to stop’ by a few children with guns.","The guns were real, but there weren’t many bullets in them.","Ye Jian used 10 USD to ‘buy’ the guns in the hands of the two children.","The children said in English, “It can help you get more USD.","It’s a lot more than what you gave me.”","All basic facilities were almost destroyed, including schools.","In a big city like the capital city of Libya, the situation was slightly better.","Although schools were destroyed, at least the students could still attend classes.","For instance, in a small town or a village in a remote area, the children there wouldn’t have any chance to go to school.","Without a school or teachers, they didn’t have the right to go to school.","The oldest of the ten children who stopped Ye Jian’s car was 16 years old.","He once studied in a classroom for a year.","He knew how to write his name, his younger brother’s name, and the 26 English alphabets.","With that, he became the most educated child among the ten children and the leader of the children.","He was a smart child, but he was hindered by his country.","If there was a country, there would be a home.","If there was a home, there would be a country.","If a country couldn’t become a country one day, a home wouldn’t be a home either.","Ye Jian used ten USD to pay for two SKS semiautomatic rifles.","She unloaded the magazines and folded them into parts.","As the car drove, she threw a few parts out.","After driving for a while more, she threw a few more parts out the window.","After two hours, she had thrown all the parts of the two guns out the window.","The SKS rifles with a capacity of ten rounds had already been eliminated.","They were equivalent to antique guns.","Ye Jian didn’t expect to see them here.","“Many of these guns have long gone out of service, and their origins are unknown.","It’s the illegal militants who give them to the civilians and coax them to do something for them.","Here, the civilians feel safe with guns in their hands.”","Speaking of the internal strife here, the peacekeeping soldiers were helpless.","All they could do was the things within their responsibility.","If they crossed the line, they would be targeted by the United Nations.","The heavy tone of the soldiers made Ye Jian purse her lips.","She looked out of the car window with a cold facial expression.","Internal strife had always been the beginning of the division of a country.","It was also the beginning of the suffering of a country and its people.","After a long time, Ye Jian said softly, “One day, it will end.","When the day comes, you guys can return to the country.”"]},{"number":4236,"title":"Chapter 4236 Dangerous Country","paragraphs":["Chapter 4236: Dangerous Country","Chapter 4236: Dangerous Country Editor: Henyee Translations","The atmosphere in the car became more relaxed because of Ye Jian’s words.","Yes, they could go back to the country when everything was on the right track.","The soldiers who were part of the first batch to go to Libya smiled hopefully.","“That’s right.","We all hope that everything here will end as soon as possible and the country will get back on track again.","We’ll have a home to return to, books to read, things to do, and money to earn!”","“There’s no hurry.","The hard times will pass.","Hope is just ahead.” The peacekeeping soldier who was driving smiled too.","“My daughter said that I shouldn’t be like those tanned old men on television.","Before I return to the country, I have to work hard not to get tanned.”","Libya was a small country in West Africa.","It had a tropical monsoon climate.","The average annual temperature was about 25 degrees Celsius.","The temperature was high.","After the short rainy season, it was basically all sun.","It was very hot and sunny.","The soldiers who came for peacekeeping were already tanned enough back in the country, but here, they were even more tanned.","As the topic was brought to the country, the smiles on the three of them increased.","As for Ye Jian, even though she wasn’t good with words in the past, she was now able to chat happily with the two peacekeeping soldiers who she had only known for less than two hours.","However, as more and more situations occurred on the road and they had to take a detour at times, the smiles on the three of them disappeared.","They rushed to the small city.","Before the car could drive inside, they were blocked by the government forces stationed here.","The soldier in the passenger seat signaled Ye Jian to sit still.","He got out of the car and communicated with the government forces.","The government forces could tell at a glance that these were peacekeeping soldiers sent by China.","Some government forces were still very hostile to other countries’ soldiers entering their country, especially the indigenous Libyans.","They were very hostile to the arrival of other countries’ soldiers.","The man who stopped the car was a native.","The peacekeeping soldier came down and tried to communicate with him.","However, the soldier had a gun pointed to his head and was shouted at fiercely.","“Stay away from me, you bunch of malicious fellows.","You’re not allowed to go in here!","Stay away from us!”","After he finished shouting, he placed two fingers in his mouth and blew a sharp whistle.","Soon, Ye Jian saw four more men running over with guns.","Their military boots kicked up dust and heat waves.","Ye Jian had already reached into her camouflage bag and was ready to take out her gun at any time.","The peacekeeping soldier in the car said calmly, “Don’t be anxious.","The government forces don’t dare to attack the peacekeeping soldiers.","It’s just a small conflict.","We’ll be able to get over it soon.”","Indeed, the situation passed very quickly.","About five minutes later, the peacekeeping soldier who had a gun pointed at him came back.","He was only 23 years old.","In less than a year after his arrival, he was already able to handle the conflict on his own.","Sitting in the car, he said with a serious expression, “There’s a conflict between the two sides.","The situation in the city is bad.","We need to take a detour.” The young soldier picked up the map and drew a line across it.","“We need to take at least two more hours.","If we take this detour, we won’t be able to reach the town as planned.”","The two soldiers’ expressions were a little serious.","According to the original plan, they would arrive at Covil at around 6:30 pm.","Then, they would escort Ye Jian to meet up with the special forces soldiers.","If they took a detour now, not only would they be delayed, but the danger on the road would also increase.","Libya wasn’t safe during the day, let alone at night.","At night, the peacekeeping soldiers would only move around in the camp.","Even the guards would enter the camp.","From this, one could see how dangerous Libya was at night."]},{"number":4237,"title":"Chapter 4237 Difficult","paragraphs":["Chapter 4237: Difficult","Chapter 4237: Difficult Editor: Henyee Translations","Most importantly, they had already taken a detour for half an hour just now.","If they took another detour! Ye Jian pursed her lips with a serious expression.","“If we can’t reach before dark, let’s just walk.","Do you think that’s okay?”","It was safer to walk at night.","They could use the cover of the night to speed up their march.","However, it was a long drive.","With the traffic in Libya, besides the obstacles on the road, the speed of the car couldn’t be fast.","On the better sections of the road, they could go about 80 miles per hour, while on the bumpy sections, they could only go about 30 to 40 miles per hour.","Even so, they could still drive about 50 kilometers per hour.","It would take a long time to walk 50 kilometers.","Even so, it was the best choice so far.","But there were bolder choices.","The older peacekeeping soldier said in a low voice, “If we really encounter anything, we can abandon the car then.","It’ll take too long to walk.","The special forces soldiers can wait, but the five missing people might not be able to.”","That was the crux of the problem.","Ye Jian didn’t even think before nodding in agreement.","Ye Jian added, “I’ve undergone driving training at night.","I can drive at night.","Or I can start driving now.","It’s just that I might be a little fast.”","After all, the two peacekeeping soldiers had picked up a female soldier from the special forces.","“Let’s go around this area and go out of the sight of the government forces.","Then, you’ll drive.” The older peacekeeping soldier didn’t think too much about it and agreed with Ye Jian’s suggestion.","The young soldier nodded and replied softly, “Alright.”","The car started moving again.","During the detour, Ye Jian and the two peacekeeping soldiers would chat from time to time.","They didn’t panic because of this.","Transportation in Libya was inconvenient to begin with.","The civil war caused traffic explosions and destruction.","There were only a few roads that could be used by cars.","There were not many choices.","After driving around for about three kilometers, they parked the car.","The peacekeeping soldier who was driving got down and sat in the back.","Ye Jian got into the car and thought for a few seconds.","She said to the young peacekeeping soldier who was still sitting in the front passenger seat, “Sit in the back.","It’s safer in the back.”","The car would go fast, and Ye Jian was unfamiliar with the road conditions.","The front passenger seat was the most dangerous position.","The young soldier didn’t ask for the reason.","He immediately unbuckled the safety belt and got out of the car.","Ye Jian started the car and said, “To be safe, put on your seat belts.”","The younger peacekeeping soldier had already sat at the back.","He exchanged glances with the older peacekeeping soldier.","At the same time, they buckled their seat belts.","Ye Jian had already stepped on the accelerator.","Just like what she said, she was a little fast.","After driving the car for about ten minutes, the speed of the car could no longer be said to just be a little fast.","Instead, it was quite fast.","At this moment, the two peacekeeping soldiers finally understood why they were asked to sit in the back and why they had to fasten their seat belts.","This speed! If they could drive at 40 miles per hour, the female soldier could drive at 80 miles per hour.","If they could drive at 80 miles per hour, the female soldier would be able to drive at 120 miles per hour.","It was like she was driving on a highway back in their country!","Fortunately, they were able to withstand it.","Even though they bumped into the roof of the car from time to time and their stomachs were churning, the two soldiers sitting at the back persevered.","They didn’t let Ye Jian stop the car because of this.","They knew that only by accelerating could they reach the town of Covil according to their original plan.","Ye Jian sped all the way, but the situation on Li Jinnian’s side was not good.","The militants under the NPFL started another war in a small coastal city to the north of the town."]},{"number":4238,"title":"Chapter 4238","paragraphs":["Chapter 4238: Chapter 4238","Chapter 4238: Chapter 4238 Editor: Henyee Translations","The civil war in Libya was started by the government forces established by the indigenous people and the patriotic team led by the leader of NPEL.","From the late 1980s until now, the two sides were still in constant war.","In addition, there were illegal militants involved, causing the situation in Libya to become even more chaotic.","It was so chaotic that the civilians couldn’t even maintain their normal lives.","This time, the NPFL militants tried to take down the train station and port of the small city on the north coast of the town of Covil.","They started a war at 4:00 pm local time, causing the small coastal city, which was originally calm, to instantly fall into a rain of guns.","Countless civilians didn’t have time to react before they were killed by the power of bazookas, mortars, and other heavy weapons.","The entire coastal city was enveloped by the air of death.","The Grim Reaper seemed to pass by with the smoke as he took away lives.","Li Jinnian and the rest, who were still waiting for Ye Jian to come over, received news that the small coastal city, Yeni, was in war.","The news was sent by the engineering team of the Chinese peacekeeping force in Yeni.","When they received the news, the engineering team in the town of Covil immediately entered Class A combat readiness.","“Azure Bird hasn’t arrived yet, and there’s war in Yeni.","Should we enter Yeni to search?” Big Shark rushed into the tent, and before he could stand still, his voice was already deep.","“Yeni and the small town of Covil are all within our search range.","Now that there’s war, I’m afraid the clues will be cut off again.”","Following the abandoned ship, the footsteps and the direction where the tires disappeared pointed to Yeni and Covil.","Covil was a local village, and the nearby villages were the focus of the Storm Commando Brigade.","Now, they were just waiting for Azure Bird to enter the village.","In the end, before they could make any progress, a war broke out in Yeni, which was close to the town of Covil.","If the missing commissioner, students, and interpreter were in either of these two places, would they be transferred because of the war?","Li Jinnian was worried that it would happen.","His handsome face was cold as he stared at the military map on the foldable table.","His gaze was fixed on the place they were focused on searching.","Why did they hijack the Chinese commissioner who was supporting Libya?","What was their goal?","Why did they have to go over land instead of by sea?","After walking over land, they came to Yeni and Covil.","Where would they go in the end?","Li Jinnian, who was staring at the military map, had a cold look in his eyes.","In the end, his gaze slowly swept along a railway line.","A dark glint flashed past his dark eyes.","In the end, his gaze locked onto the train station in Yeni.","It was also the only train station that could still be used normally so far.","It was connected to the capital city of Libya.","If any refugees wanted to escape, most of them would take this train protected by the government forces and escape to the capital city.","Then, they would go south and enter the largest port in Libya.","In that case, since the people who kidnapped the Chinese commissioner abandoned the sea route and took the land route, was it possible that they wanted to take the Chinese commissioner, students, and interpreter on a train?","Leaving Libya by train?","Or did they have other motives?","No!!!","They wouldn’t take a train out of Libya.","If they really wanted to leave Libya, why would they need to take an extra route to Yeni?","A peacekeeping soldier holding a Type 95 automatic rifle walked in.","He had already entered Class A combat readiness.","The moment the other party walked in, Li Jinnian looked up and froze."]},{"number":4239,"title":"Chapter 4239","paragraphs":["Chapter 4239: Chapter 4239","Chapter 4239: Chapter 4239 Editor: Henyee Translations","He turned his head and asked Big Shark, “How many soldiers does our country have in Yeni?”","Big Shark was stumped.","“I really don’t know.","I’ll ask about it now.”","“Report, there’s a platoon of soldiers stationed in Yeni.","There’s also a team of engineers who are maintaining the road, which is also a platoon of soldiers.”","The peacekeeping soldier who came in accurately reported the strength of the peacekeeping forces in Yeni.","Li Jinnian’s gaze flickered as he asked in a low voice, “How many peacekeepers are there in Covil?”","“It’s the same as Yeni.","There are two platoons of soldiers.”","There were a total of four platoons of soldiers, which was about 120 to 160 peacekeeping soldiers.","There weren’t many soldiers, but they were enough to intimidate the other party.","Li Jinnian didn’t ask what the peacekeeping soldier came here to report.","He had some clues now, so he needed to hurry up.","His gaze turned colder as he asked again, “Have the NPFL militants ever negotiated with you?”","“It happened twice, but the government forces stopped them.”","“Do you know what they wanted to negotiate?”","Li Jinnian asked one question after another.","The peacekeeping soldier quickly replied, “The content wasn’t clear.","Our soldiers don’t participate in the confrontation between other countries.”","Could it be that the NPFL militants who were exchanging fire with the government forces had kidnapped the Chinese expert to complete their negotiations with the Chinese peacekeeping forces?","This could barely explain why they wanted to hijack the Chinese.","However, the root cause was still untenable.","Li Jinnian felt that he had missed something.","While he was still deep in thought, the soldier had already told him why he was here.","Two boys ran outside the camp to ask the Chinese peacekeeping forces for help.","They said that they saw a few Chinese people sitting in a military truck in Yeni.","They received the latest news.","The missing Chinese expert, students, and interpreter appeared in Yeni at around 6:00 pm yesterday.","They were sitting in a military truck, and the driver was an NPFL militant.","The clues were provided by two 16 or 17-year-old boys.","They had escaped from Yeni to the town of Covil.","They planned to walk to the capital city.","To be safe, Li Jinnian took out a few photos of unfamiliar faces and asked them to be shown to the boys.","One of them recognized the interpreter, Yang Heng, and the other recognized the expert.","The two boys stayed in the Chinese engineering camp in the town of Covil.","Firstly, it was to protect them.","Secondly, it was to watch over them.","This was because the two of them were the ones who spread the news.","The soldiers would only know if the news was true after they went to check.","So far, the chaotic environment made the Storm Commando Brigade’s search very difficult.","Whether the intel from the two boys was true or not, they had to go over because the boys had recognized the interpreter, Yang Heng, and Commissioner Miao.","Before setting off, Li Jinnian told the captain of the engineering soldiers in the construction camp that once the female soldier who came to support them arrived, she would have to go to Yeni immediately and equip herself with the wireless communication equipment.","As long as she entered Yeni, they would be able to find each other’s location and contact one another.","Li Jinnian and the rest already knew that there was war in Yeni when they set off.","It was a huge commotion, but they didn’t expect it to be a large-scale war when they were still 17 kilometers away from Yeni and hadn’t passed through the tropical rainforest.","The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade didn’t expect the chaos in Yeni to be a large-scale war.","The scout, Big Eel, used his binoculars to climb up the tree to see more clearly.","He looked around before climbing down from the tree."]},{"number":4240,"title":"Chapter 4240","paragraphs":["Chapter 4240: Chapter 4240","Chapter 4240: Chapter 4240 Editor: Henyee Translations","Big Eel was about two meters away when he jumped up.","He was wearing a desert combat uniform and had a face full of paint.","He said to Li Jinnian, “The situation ahead is not good.","There are six locations with thick smoke.","Yeni is in chaos!”","Everyone’s expressions darkened.","The three of them were on guard.","Li Jinnian quickly spread out the map.","Big Eel understood and squatted on one knee.","He pointed at the approximate location of the black smoke.","“It’s probably this area.","It’s been chaotic since the moment we entered the city.","The road into the city is blocked.","If we go over now, we might not find anything.”","The missing people didn’t have any tracking device on them.","Even if they were really in Yeni, the soldiers wouldn’t be able to find them immediately.","Yeni was so big.","The only clue was to find the military truck that the five of them took yesterday.","According to the two boys, they saw the military truck not far from the train station! Li Jinnian took off his combat gloves and clenched them a few times with his slender fingers.","Finally, he pointed at the train station and said, “Directly approach the train station.”","“Are you saying that Commissioner Miao and the rest might be hidden near the train station?” Big Shark asked.","He lowered his head and stared at the military map.","He frowned slightly and pointed at another area.","“This is the port.","If they want to go to the train station, they have to cross the road outside this port.","Is it possible that they went to the port first?”","“No.”","Li Jinnian’s cold voice was firm.","“Don’t forget the location of their disappearance.”","Yes!","The location of the disappearance was at sea.","If they were hiding at the port, they could have directly sailed through the coastline and entered the port.","There was no need to abandon the ship.","“Okay, let’s go straight to the vicinity of the train station!” Big Shark nodded.","It had been four days since Commissioner Miao and the rest disappeared.","They didn’t have any clues until they were spotted last night.","This was enough to motivate them.","At least they were still alive!","However, it had been a day and a night.","No one could guarantee that nothing had happened.","The soldiers could only chase after the only clue and make use of the time to search.","Fortunately, the Demon King’s judgment was correct.","From the moment they discovered the missing ship to the moment they locked onto Covil and Yeni, they didn’t waste too much time searching.","“They’re still alive.","Don’t worry, the other party still wants to negotiate with the Chinese.” Li Jinnian could tell that Big Eel was anxious.","He said calmly, “Since they asked to negotiate with the Chinese twice, it shows that they won’t give up easily.","The don’t dare to kidnap the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers casually.","They’re afraid that the peacekeeping soldiers will resist and the situation will go out of control.","That’s why they chose Commissioner Miao, who wasn’t wearing a military uniform.”","Commissioner Miao and the three students were going to Libya as construction engineers.","Hence, they were all wearing casual clothes.","With that, they became NPFL’s targets.","Li Jinnian pieced the entire puzzle together from the only clues he had.","He had more or less sorted out the cause and effect of the entire matter.","So far, Yang Heng and the rest were indeed fine.","They were arranged to be under an underground bomb shelter.","Dust kept falling from the explosions in the bomb shelter.","The five of them were locked in the bomb shelter.","The iron door in front was locked.","There was no need to look at the situation outside.","Just by listening, they could tell that something big had happened.","However, the five of them couldn’t do anything.","They had already tried to see if they could break the lock.","In the end, they failed.","They could only wait for rescue."]},{"number":4241,"title":"Chapter 4241 Encounter","paragraphs":["Chapter 4241: Encounter","Chapter 4241: Encounter Editor: Henyee Translations","Commissioner Miao, who was waiting for help, didn’t panic.","Similarly, the three students didn’t panic either.","As for Yang Heng, the people he usually interacted with were different.","Their mentality was stable too.","Besides, the person who caught them said that they didn’t have any bad intentions.","As long as they cooperated, nothing would happen.","Hence, Yang Heng didn’t panic too much.","At this moment, this bomb shelter seemed a little unstable.","More and more layers of dust fell, and the frequency of the ground shaking got higher and higher.","The tremors made the bomb shelter look like it was about to collapse.","Why did it feel like this place had become a war zone?","Just as this thought flashed past Yang Heng’s mind, hurried footsteps came from the front.","Yang Heng stood up abruptly and stared ahead vigilantly.","The iron door opened, and Commissioner Miao and the others were evacuated.","Dense gunshots sounded in every corner of the city.","The sky was gradually turning dark.","Bullets fell from the sky, leaving trails of red bullets.","Ye Jian and the group wasn’t far from the town of Covil.","There were less than 40 kilometers left.","Ye Jian drove for two hours and took a detour.","From time to time, because of the road obstacles, Ye Jian relied on her good driving skills to navigate.","It would only take one and a half hours more than her original plan.","If things went smoothly, they would reach the town in about 30 to 40 minutes.","In the end, the three of them became more and more tense.","They didn’t relax just because they could reach the town soon.","The sky had already turned dark.","As dusk approached, the sky was dotted with stars.","Ye Jian, who didn’t have her headlights on, slowed down her car.","The transportation in Libya was quite bad.","The entire country was riddled with holes.","Almost none of the roads that connected the various cities and towns were good.","The flames of war had destroyed this piece of land and destroyed the roads.","Especially the road that led to the villages and towns.","Before the civil war broke out, the roads were dirt roads.","After the civil war broke out, they became even worse.","There were either deep pits left behind by artillery shells or huge broken trees blocking the road.","Even though Ye Jian’s skills were good, there were still a few times when the wheels fell into the pits.","As the sky turned darker and darker, they were about to enter the town of Covil when they were intercepted.","Ye Jian stared at the checkpoint in front of her.","There were only two wooden stools placed on her left and right.","In the middle was a tree that had been cut down.","It was about the size of a child’s arm.","Her eyes were a little gloomy.","Fortunately, the sky wasn’t completely dark yet.","She could see the checkpoint in front of her from afar.","She was sitting in the front and noticed it in advance.","The two soldiers at the back responsible for observing the left and the right hadn’t notice it.","They suddenly felt that the car that was driving normally suddenly slowed down.","Although they didn’t notice anything immediately, they realized something was amiss.","The speed of the car slowly decreased from more than 60 miles per hour to more than 50 miles per hour.","Ye Jian, who was staring at the front, lowered the car window on her left and right.","The wind that carried the heat of the day blew into the car.","Her gaze was cold as she asked the two soldiers, “When you first came over, were there such inspections?”","“Yes, the town of Covil and Yeni are controlled by the government forces.","They’re very cautious,” the older peacekeeping soldier replied.","He was an old squad leader with the surname Feng.","He was among the first batch of soldiers sent to Libya for peacekeeping.","The young soldier’s surname was He Wei.","He was a soldier led by Squad Leader Feng in the country."]},{"number":4242,"title":"Chapter 4242 Accept Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4242: Accept Battle","Chapter 4242: Accept Battle Editor: Henyee Translations","Their answers didn’t make Ye Jian feel at ease.","Before the other party approached, she asked, “What’s the government’s attitude towards our soldiers?”","“It’s alright.","We can get along peacefully,” Squad Leader Feng said without thinking.","The soldiers who came to peacekeeping wouldn’t interfere with the government’s affairs.","The two sides would naturally get along peacefully.","Ye Jian didn’t sense any peace from the four men walking over.","Instead, she smelled blood in the wind that blew into the car.","It was very faint.","As the twilight wind blew, the faint smell of blood dissipated in an instant.","Ye Jian’s eyes turned darker, and her voice became tense.","“I’m afraid there’s something wrong with them.","Be prepared.”","Squad Leader Feng was about to get out of the car and talk to the government forces when he heard this.","He closed the car door again.","Special forces soldiers had better instincts than them.","Just like now, his instincts told him that he should believe what the female soldier said.","“I’ll act according to the situation.","Be ready to charge at any time.” As Ye Jian spoke, she rolled up the left and right car windows again and put down the handbrake that was already pulled up.","She was ready to charge at any time.","“Also, don’t get out of the car.”","These men didn’t come with good intentions.","Whether the men were government forces or not, they shouldn’t get out of the car!","Squad Leader Feng said in a low voice, “Okay, I’ll ask them first.","You prepare to break through.”","It was not safe at night.","Even if it was the government forces, Squad Leader Feng gave up on the idea of getting out of the car and interacting with them.","It was better to be careful.","The four people with guns walked over.","Two of them stood in front of the front of the car.","One of them patted the front of the car and went to stand by the front passenger seat.","Then, he realized that there was no one sitting in the front passenger seat, so he retreated to the back door.","The other person knocked on the car window and asked Ye Jian, who was driving, to come down and talk to him.","Sitting behind Ye Jian, Squad Leader Feng lowered the car window.","Because of his vigilance, he didn’t lower the glass window completely.","He only lowered it halfway and reported their identities.","“Hello, I’m!”","Before Squad Leader Feng could finish speaking, Ye Jian stopped hesitating and released the brake.","She slammed the accelerator, causing the car to rush out.","Bang! Bang!","With two loud bangs, Ye Jian sent the two men who were aiming their guns at the car flying.","The car shook violently, and the left wheel rolled over a man’s body.","It instantly covered a distance of a few meters..","The moment Squad Leader Feng rolled down the glass window and spoke, Ye Jian smelled a thicker smell of blood.","At the same time, she saw the man standing at the back door on the right side of the car making a hand gesture through the rearview mirror.","It was a shooting gesture.","Ye Jian didn’t hesitate anymore.","She didn’t care that there were people standing in front of the car.","Her gaze was vicious as she drove the car over.","These weren’t ordinary people.","They were her enemies.","Ye Jian would never show mercy to her enemies.","She stepped on the accelerator, and the car was sent flying.","Gunshots were heard at the same time.","“Hold on tight!","They’re not government forces.","They want to kill us.” In the car, Ye Jian was speaking calmly, “Just now, they wanted to hijack the car and kill us!”","If Ye Jian, who was driving, hadn’t seen these people’s unfriendly gazes, she wouldn’t have been able to break out with the car.","At this moment, they might have already been killed by the people chasing after them.","There were only two groups of people who dared to shoot soldiers.","One was the illegal militants of Libya, and the other was the natives of Libya who were very hostile to the soldiers of other countries.","Even if it were soldiers from Western countries, these people wouldn’t hesitate to kill them."]},{"number":4243,"title":"Chapter 4243 Fight","paragraphs":["Chapter 4243: Fight","Chapter 4243: Fight Editor: Henyee Translations","Gunshots sounded at the back of their car.","The bullets hit the windshield of the car.","With a whoosh, the back windshield shattered and shards scattered along the back of the car.","Some shards fell on the two peacekeeping soldiers who had already crouched down behind the car seat.","He Wei’s face was a little pale.","Although he had come to Libya for peacekeeping, he hadn’t been in such danger.","He hadn’t experienced being chased by bullets.","“We’re stuck.” Ye Jian ignored the people behind her.","She had to stop the car now that she was about 40 meters away from the checkpoint.","Gunshots sounded from behind, and the people in front were raising their guns as well.","Perhaps they thought that their companions would be able to successfully hijack the car and kill the people inside, so these people were not prepared.","When Ye Jian suddenly attacked, they were stunned for a moment.","Then, they reacted and raised their guns to fire.","The speeding car was inches away.","Bang!","Another heavy collision was heard.","The simple checkpoint was sent flying by Ye Jian, as well as the tree.","Not only was everything sent flying by Ye Jian, but she also knocked down several people holding guns on the left.","This was a serious collision.","Someone was hit in the head by a tree and fell to the ground.","There were a few others who exclaimed in pain when they landed on the ground.","They were lucky enough to still be alive.","The person on the right was much luckier.","The tree trunk that was sent flying didn’t hit him.","He quickly dodged and saw the car flying past him.","Cursing, he raised his gun and shot at the car.","“Don’t let them go over!","Kill them!","Kill them!”","Ye Jian heard the angry roars.","The car had already passed the checkpoint, and the people behind were continuing to give chase.","The two soldiers at the back lowered their bodies and swayed along with the car.","He Wei heaved a sigh of relief.","The female soldier was vigilant just now.","When she stopped the car, she didn’t pull the handbrake.","She just stepped on the brake.","The moment the other party suddenly raised their guns, the car rushed out with a bang.","“It’s not over.","Hold on tight!”","Ye Jian, who was driving, saw the other party raising their guns up ahead again.","This time, the other party had learned their lesson.","They were not standing in the middle of the road.","Instead, they were standing on both sides and shooting.","“Don’t raise your heads.","Hold them tight!” Ye Jian grabbed the steering wheel tightly with both hands.","Her gaze was cold as she stared ahead.","She stepped on the accelerator again.","At the same time, the car was driven in a S-curve.","Bullets shot over from the front.","The car door and the front of the car instantly bore several bullet holes.","Two bullets hit the front windshield, and the entire glass shattered.","This time, the broken glass shards didn’t fall outside but scattered inside instead.","Ye Jian’s chin was scratched by a piece of broken glass.","A wound was left on her chin.","Blood seeped out from the surface of her cut skin.","The people in front didn’t stop the car.","Ye Jian, who didn’t know what was going on, gritted her teeth and stepped on the accelerator.","At the same time, she turned on the headlights.","The strong light from the high beams blinded people for a short period of time.","Ye Jian would flash from time to time.","If they were to fire at the car, they could only do it blindly.","As long as Ye Jian drove the car in a S-curve and lowered her head, she would minimize the danger of being shot.","However, the risk was only reduced to the lowest level.","It couldn’t guarantee safety.","The fuel tank of the car was penetrated, and the fuel gauge bars disappeared one by one.","Ye Jian’s expression became more and more serious.","They had to abandon the car!"]},{"number":4244,"title":"Chapter 4244 Pursuit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4244: Pursuit","Chapter 4244: Pursuit Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian had planned on driving to the mountaintop filled with tropical trees in front of her.","Obviously, the car that was about to run out of fuel couldn’t make it.","They would have to abandon it.","Ye Jian grabbed the 95 rifle and the camouflage bag with two magazines.","As the car slowed down, Ye Jian shouted, “Jump down!” The three of them pushed open the car doors at the same time.","After abandoning the car with the leaking fuel tank, the three of them used the S-curve route to run forward at their fastest speed.","Naturally, they couldn’t simply run along the road.","They would become live targets.","They chose to rush out of the road.","They saw a few trees and thought that they would be able to hide temporarily.","In the end!","After running to a few sparse trees, the three of them suddenly stopped in their tracks.","They were now on a slope.","Below them was a village, a village with smoke billowing from the wind.","The possibility of escaping would increase if they ran into the village.","However, the people chasing them were armed with guns.","If the other party didn’t find the three of them, they might shoot civilians.","Killing innocent people was common in Libya.","There was another possibility to consider.","Who knew if the village was a bandit’s den?","Although there had been some small twists and turns along the way, nothing had happened to them.","However, they were being chased near the vicinity of this village.","It didn’t hurt to be careful.","The three of them didn’t discuss, but they made a decision at the same time.","Ye Jian shouted and ran forward.","The two peacekeeping soldiers said at the same time, “Run forward!”","They didn’t communicate or even look at each other.","The three of them gritted their teeth and ran into the forest in front of them.","If nothing had gone wrong, they would be driving into the forest at this moment.","After passing through this tropical forest, they would reach the town of Covil about ten kilometers away.","The three of them didn’t get close to each other and run together.","Instead, they split up and ran forward about a meter apart.","They couldn’t retaliate, and they didn’t even have a cover.","The best way was to speed up and widen the shooting range of the bullets.","When Ye Jian and the rest abandoned the car, they were about 500 meters away from the unknown people chasing them.","The fuel tank was hit, so they had no other choice but to abandon the car.","Although there were gunshots behind them, the range was too far.","The other party wouldn’t be able to hurt them for a while.","Hence, they could still run.","They had to grit their teeth and use all their stamina.","They had been soldiers for a few years, after all.","They had to run until their feet were like fire wheels.","Now, they couldn’t fight the other party head-on.","They didn’t have enough soldiers or bullets.","They could only think of a way to escape.","Ye Jian had participated in many actual combats.","However, this was the first time she was being chased like this.","She didn’t even have the ability to retaliate.","This made her gaze so cold that it seemed to be frozen.","They were still a distance away from the forest.","Fortunately! the sky had darkened, and the night had become a cover for the three of them.","The fellows who were chasing them lost their target.","However, they didn’t give up.","Instead, they shouted loudly.","An extremely dilapidated truck rushed out from the side of the road.","It was so dilapidated that only the headlights were intact.","The truck carried the guys who were chasing Ye Jian and the other two.","The sound of the truck’s engine was heard.","The men’s fierce and arrogant roars came from afar.","The dilapidated truck chased after the soldiers.","Ye Jian and the other two heard the sound of the truck.","Their expressions were even more serious than before.","The problem this time was extraordinarily troublesome!","“Split up and run!”","At this moment of life and death, Squad Leader Feng shouted at Ye Jian, “Go straight to the town.","There’s a Chinese peacekeeping unit camp there.","You’ll be safe there.","Leave them to me and He Wei!”"]},{"number":4245,"title":"Chapter 4245 Counter-Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4245: Counter-Attack","Chapter 4245: Counter-Attack Editor: Henyee Translations","The three of them continued moving forward.","The other party had a car.","None of them could escape.","The best way was to run in different directions and give the chance to the female soldier who came to support the special forces.","Hearing that, Ye Jian turned her head and said without thinking, “Run in two waves.","I’ll lure them away!”","But it was too late.","Squad Leader Feng rushed to the side of the road alone.","He planned to lure the car away.","Ye Jian’s gaze turned vicious.","This wouldn’t do.","Something would happen to Squad Leader Feng.","Without thinking, Ye Jian ran to the road and rushed toward Squad Leader Feng, who was slow in comparison.","Before the truck arrived, the dim headlights of the truck shot over from the bumpy road.","Ye Jian held Squad Leader Feng’s wrist tightly and said sternly, “Leave it to me.","I’ll handle it!”","“Ambush on both sides.","I’ll shoot their driver and the headlights.","As long as we solve these two things, we’ll gain some time.”","As Ye Jian spoke, she took action.","Her action was! to run back!","This shocked Squad Leader Feng and He Wei.","Why was she running back?","“Squad Leader!” He Wei was so anxious that he was sweating even more.","Squad Leader Feng said in a low voice, “Follow the arrangements.","Follow her!”","Now, it was time for actual combat.","They had only undergone combat exercises in the country and lacked real combat experience.","Since the female soldier had come to support the special forces and carried heavy responsibilities, she must have their lack of real combat experience.","The female soldier in front of them might be a female special forces soldier who had been on a real battlefield and could quickly fight at a disadvantage.","Without giving Squad Leader Feng and He Wei too much time to think, Ye Jian, who was agile, quickly laid on the uneven road.","Her cover was! a slope.","“Cover me!”","Ye Jian laid down and loaded the bullets.","Her finger was already on the trigger.","She didn’t give the two of them a chance to regret things.","She didn’t want Squad Leader Feng to risk his life to lure the enemy away.","In that case, she might as well take a gamble!","“He Wei, cover!”","Squad Leader Feng, who was sweating profusely, didn’t have the time to consider things.","His voice was so heavy, but he had to bring himself to execute orders.","The two of them laid in the grass on both sides of the road.","There was no cover.","They had no cover, but they still had to fight the enemy head-on.","This was the most dangerous combat.","However, the three of them had no choice.","They were at least two kilometers away from the forest in front of them.","There was no way they could run in.","In that case, they could only give it their all!","Ye Jian was betting on her shooting speed and accuracy.","The truck, which looked like it should be scrapped, bounced up and down along with the rise and fall of the road.","The headlights of the truck, which were not bright, swayed over.","When the front of the truck tilted up and lowered, Ye Jian’s slender finger instantly pulled the trigger.","The reason why she came back was to find an advantage among the disadvantages.","Her current shooting position was the advantage she found.","There were two slopes in front of her.","She was on the third small slope.","If the car tilted, the driver’s vision would be affected.","She would have a slight advantage, and that was when she would shoot.","The front windows of the cars were usually 5mm tempered or 3+2 laminated rubber, while the Type 95 automatic rifles, with 5.8mm ammunition, could penetrate 8mm steel plates within 100 meters and still have a small lethality.","It was the lethality of the rifle combined with her current shooting position.","This was what Captain Xia saidâ€”find the advantage from the disadvantage and counter-attack!"]},{"number":4246,"title":"Chapter 4246 Cruel Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 4246: Cruel Times","Chapter 4246: Cruel Times Editor: Henyee Translations","On the battlefield, Ye Jian’s psychological resistance was quite strong.","Some people would shrink back when they were under pressure.","Ye Jian, on the other hand, was more excited when she was under pressure.","Just like in her previous life, she could grit her teeth and survive even if she was harmed by Ye Ying.","Ye Jian, who pulled the trigger, knew that she had no choice but to accept the challenge.","No matter how fast they ran, they wouldn’t be able to outrun the four-wheeled vehicle.","Hence, they could only retaliate.","The bullet tore through the air like a meteor.","Wherever the bullet passed, it seemed to tear the air into upper and lower parts.","The 3+2 tempered glass of the car pierced through, and the guy driving fell with a thud.","The Grim Reaper arrived beside him without any warning.","Blood flowed out of his right eye socket.","At the same time, a ball of white mass fell out of his right eye socket.","The car was 90 meters away.","Ye Jian couldn’t see her target clearly, so she shot the driver inside the car.","The bullet didn’t hit the center of the opponent’s forehead.","Instead, it pierced through the opponent’s right eye, and the bullet pierced through the enemy’s head.","In the end, he was shot and died.","The guy sitting in the car with him was so shocked that his eyes widened.","He had heard the gunshot, and now, he realized that his companion had been shot.","Then, the truck lost control of itself.","The truck was so shabby that the sound of the engine was especially loud.","Even the sound of gunshots was covered up by the sound of the engine.","The guys sitting at the back of truck held the handles tightly with one hand and raised their guns with the other.","They hadn’t realized what had happened.","They only knew that the car was out of control.","“Damn it!","What are you doing?!”","Thinking that it was a joke, someone knocked on the roof of the truck with the butt of a gun.","He was so shocked that he shouted the driver’s name.","He pounced over and tried to control the steering wheel.","The truck had already lost control and was no longer driving in a straight line.","After twisting a few times, the truck rushed to the side of the road.","Another bullet tore through the air.","This time, the bullet hit the headlights of the truck.","The dim headlights were extinguished, and the darkness of the night enveloped them again.","Squad Leader Feng and He Wei heard the rumbling sound in front of them.","Neither of them fired a bullet.","Before they could even react, Ye Jian had already finished shooting.","They heard the female soldier shout, “Retreat!”","Now was the time to retreat into the forest.","They didn’t know how many soldiers the enemy had.","They couldn’t waste their time here.","If they could avoid it, they would.","If they couldn’t, they would accept the challenge.","Now, they had won time to escape.","Squad Leader Feng, who was lying in the grass by the side of the road, jumped up.","“He Wei, retreat!”","The two figures quickly approached Ye Jian.","They needed to enter the forest as soon as possible.","Only by entering the forest would the danger be reduced.","When He Wei ran close to Squad Leader Feng, he swallowed his saliva and said hurriedly, “Squad Leader, I heard two gunshots just now.","She really hit the driver from so far away.”","It was too terrifying!","There was still about 100 meters between them.","The female soldier really hit the driver with the 95 rifle in her hand!","How did she confirm her target?","How could she shoot accurately within the maximum range of the 95 rifle?","Squad Leader Feng was as shocked as He Wei.","Now wasn’t the time for them to ask each other questions.","They needed to escape as soon as possible."]},{"number":4247,"title":"Chapter 4247 Threaten","paragraphs":["Chapter 4247: Threaten","Chapter 4247: Threaten Editor: Henyee Translations","In front, the truck overturned.","There were more than 20 people in the truck.","Besides a few people who reacted quickly and jumped out of the truck, the rest fell with the truck.","Fortunately, the terrain on both sides was flat.","Even if the car overturned, there were not many casualties.","Two of them were quite unlucky and died on the spot under the truck.","A few of them were pressed by the truck and screamed.","Most of them crawled out by saving themselves.","“Chase!","Hurry up and chase after them!”","The illegal militants who climbed out roared angrily.","They didn’t deal with their companions who were screaming under the truck.","Instead, they picked up their guns.","Covil and Yeni would become their territories.","No one was allowed to enter, not even the peacekeeping soldiers.","That would be their kingdom!","These unknown people were illegal militants who had split up from the original indigenous people.","Libya was in chaos.","The criminals who wanted to become the ruler of the country started killing while the country was in chaos.","The government forces and the NPFL militants had to fight these separatists too.","Now, there was a three-way battle in Yeni.","No one would give in, and everyone wanted to win.","In the road construction engineering engineering barracks of the Chinese peacekeeping force in Yeni, a child handed a crumpled envelope to the level-one peacekeeping soldier who was preparing for war.","The letter was written by one of the leaders of the NPFL militants.","He clearly expressed his intention.","He asked the Chinese Department of Peacekeeping Operations to evacuate Yeni and the small town of Covil.","He didn’t want to have any conflict with China.","This was the main reason why NPFL wanted to negotiate with the Chinese.","They didn’t want the Chinese peacekeeping forces to appear in Covil or Yeni.","At the same time, he expressed his hope that the Chinese would step in and ask the government forces to retreat too.","As long as the Chinese did what they told them to do, the Chinese engineers and interpreter would be sent back safely.","This was the latest news of the target.","This meant that the missing Commissioner Miao and the others were not in danger.","Commissioner Miao’s identity as an electromagnetic expert was not completely revealed by China.","He and another electromagnetic expert brought three students to Libya as construction engineers.","Only the president knew their identities.","Even the officials around the president didn’t know.","Now, NPFL told them very clearly that the missing Commissioner Miao and the others were kidnapped by them.","The Chinese peacekeeping forces immediately contacted the country through email.","As for the president! the Chinese peacekeeping forces had no intention of telling him.","The president wouldn’t cooperate with the NPFL’s request.","As for Commissioner Miao and the others who had fallen into the hands of the NPFL militants, something would happen to them.","The latest news arrived in the country with the email.","About ten minutes later, Li Jinnian received the latest news through the satellite communication device he was carrying.","Li Jinnian and the other 12 water ghosts, who had infiltrated Yeni under the bombardment, were hiding in a ruin that had been blown up by a cannonball.","After receiving the latest news from the country, their previous guess was confirmed.","Now, they just needed to find Commissioner Miao and the others.","As for Azure Bird!","Li Jinnian pursed his lips lightly.","If he could find Commissioner Miao and the rest tonight, Azure Bird wouldn’t have to come and support them.","There was no need for her to enter the village to ask about the situation.","As her elder cousin, Li Jinnian didn’t want his only cousin to be in the flames of war.","The flames of war were merciless.","He couldn’t guarantee that his cousin could retreat safely."]},{"number":4248,"title":"Chapter 4248 Solo Combat","paragraphs":["Chapter 4248: Solo Combat","Chapter 4248: Solo Combat Editor: Henyee Translations","In Li Jinnian’s plan, he only wanted his cousin to infiltrate the village as a female soldier to ask for information.","Other than that, Li Jinnian had no other thoughts.","However, things would always happen out of one’s expectations.","At this moment, Ye Jian was already exchanging fire.","After entering the forest, she was already fighting with the illegal militants.","There were at least two platoons of soldiers, but there were only three of them.","“This is the only way to enter Covil and Yeni.","They’re now controlled by illegal militants.","I guess something must have happened to Covil and Yeni.”","Panting heavily, Squad Leader Feng said in a tense and deep voice, “They’re all illegal militants.","I’m afraid it’ll be difficult for us to get there.”","He wasn’t afraid of facing difficulty.","It was just that the current situation was already very difficult.","There weren’t enough soldiers or firepower.","The other party had two platoons of soldiers! Ye Jian was facing the biggest problem in her military career.","“We can’t exchange fire with them anymore.” Ye Jian tightened her grip on the rifle in her hand.","Her gaze was cold as she said, “We don’t have enough ammunition.","If we continue exchanging fire, it’ll be disadvantageous to us.","Now, we can only retreat.”","Squad Leader Feng agreed.","They couldn’t fight head-on.","There were three of them against at least two platoons of soldiers.","They shouldn’t even think about using firepower to win.","“Squad Leader Feng, He Wei, the two of you retreat first.","I’ll cover you.","I don’t have to worry.","I can protect myself.” Ye Jian finished speaking in one breath.","She didn’t give Squad Leader Feng a chance to speak.","“I’m good at night combat and individual combat.","Hence, I’ll cover you.","You guys retreat.”","Feng Yu’s pupils constricted.","He lowered his voice and said, “No, you’re here to save people.","You should go to the town immediately.","I’ll cover you.","You and He Wei retreat!”","He Wei, who was in charge of guarding, turned his head and said firmly, “I’ll cover you.","Squad Leader Feng, retreat with the female soldier!”","Squad Leader Feng had a wife and daughter.","As for him, he was fine!","“Listen to my arrangements, He Wei.","I’m good at night combat.","At the same time, I have actual combat experience.","My biggest actual combat experience almost required me to step on corpses.","Hence, I’ll cover you while you and Squad Leader Feng retreat.","“Stop talking nonsense.","It’s a waste of time!”","Ye Jian’s voice was icy.","He Wei’s mouth was pressed into a straight line.","“I don’t want to waste any more time.","Squad Leader Feng, retreat with your soldier immediately!” After Ye Jian finished speaking, she hunched her back and instantly rushed out.","She didn’t give the two peacekeepers any chance to speak.","The forest was terrifyingly quiet.","It was so quiet that one could hear one’s heart palpitating in panic.","He Wei’s eyes were red as he said in a low voice, “Squad Leader, retreat.","I’ll stay!","We can’t let her cover us alone.”","Squad Leader Feng endured until his fingers were trembling.","His lips trembled.","In the end, he gritted his teeth and said, “He Wei, retreat!” His voice was choked with tears.","Ye Jian, who was good at night combat and individual combat, wasn’t afraid of facing two platoons of soldiers alone.","She never thought that she would fall here.","As long as they didn’t exchange fire, she could clear a path for herself.","She was good at night combat and assassination!","She was confident that she could deal with these people.","After coming out of the hiding spot, Ye Jian was at least five to six meters away from Squad Leader Feng and He Wei.","The leaves rustled.","The illegal militants who entered the forest to search screamed and chased after Ye Jian.","“Let’s go!”","They chased after her.","Squad Leader Feng and He Wei immediately retreated.","They had to rush back to the camp.","They had to bring people to support the female soldier!","There was the smell of blood in the wind.","Ye Jian, who was fighting alone, was like the Grim Reaper in the forest.","She used the combat dagger in her hand to stab the necks of her targets.","Then, she cut sideways and twisted it.","The aorta, trachea, and vocal cord were cut! There was no chance of survival."]},{"number":4249,"title":"Chapter 4249 Bloody","paragraphs":["Chapter 4249: Bloody","Chapter 4249: Bloody Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian didn’t expose herself completely.","She was just trying to buy time for Squad Leader Feng and He Wei to escape.","She didn’t plan to kill two platoons of soldiers alone.","That would be too time-consuming and would expose that she was fighting alone.","Once these people realized that and started shooting blindly into the forest, it would be difficult for her to escape even if she had extraordinary abilities.","20 minutes later, Ye Jian, who had taken care of six people, started to retreat.","She had stalled for enough time.","She believed that Squad Leader Feng and He Wei had escaped safely.","In the forest, the illegal militants had already discovered that their companions were dead.","Strange cries came from everywhere.","The entire forest was filled with the sound of leaves rustling.","The voices were filled with shock and anger.","“Damn it!","Come over quickly!","They killed our compatriots!","They killed our compatriots!”","Someone shouted angrily.","His neck was thick, and his eyes were bulging.","He was so angry that his blood vessels seemed to be about to explode.","“Brewer!","Brewer!","Damn it, the Chinese peacekeepers killed Brewer!”","“I want to kill them!","I want to kill them!”","The entire forest was in chaos.","The two scattered platoons realized that their compatriots had fallen.","They ran over, causing the leaves to rustle.","The sound of branches breaking could be heard.","“They must be nearby.","They must still be nearby.","Find them!","Hurry up and find them!”","“Everyone, be careful!”","Chaotic footsteps sounded.","They were no longer as arrogant as when they rushed into the forest.","Instead, they were nervous.","They would stand with their backs against each other, and there would people at the back as well as the front.","The six silent deaths had cast a shadow on them, making them tense.","They were no longer as bold as before.","Ye Jian, who was hiding on the tree, slowly came down and retreated from their encirclement step by step.","Now, it was her chance to escape.","Ye Jian wasn’t anxious.","She chose the safest route to retreat.","She tiptoed and left the group of illegal militants without making a sound.","The smell of blood in the forest was extremely strong.","Ye Jian’s assassination method was also the most commonly used method by the special forces of the Xueyu unitâ€”throat slitting.","They cut horizontally from the side of the neck.","The aorta was the first to be cut.","The blade would then cut deeply into the throat.","The vocal cord and trachea were cut off one by one.","In this way, the six illegal militants were killed silently.","The silent assassination angered the illegal militants.","After searching for a few minutes, they found another compatriot who was killed.","This time, the anger in their hearts was completely ignited.","They were no longer just searching.","They directly used their guns and raised them in their hands.","They fired blindly into the forest like firecrackers.","“They must still be nearby.","Kill them!","Kill them!”","“Don’t let them escape!","Damn it, we don’t need their help!”","They roared angrily.","Having lost their minds, they started the most familiar slaughter.","The bullets pierced through the trees and cut off the leaves.","The sharp fragments of the trees and the green leaves landed on Ye Jian’s head and body.","Ye Jian couldn’t retreat anymore.","She could only lie down temporarily.","The bullets above her head flew past and countless fragments fell.","Unexpectedly, they covered a thin layer of Ye Jian’s back.","This went on for at least five minutes before the firecracker-like sounds in the forest stopped.","Someone started speaking.","The Libyan language was English.","Although the accent was strong, Ye Jian could understand it."]},{"number":4250,"title":"Chapter 4250 Live Guns","paragraphs":["Chapter 4250: Live Guns","Chapter 4250: Live Guns Editor: Henyee Translations","The angry voices floated into Ye Jian’s ears from time to time, causing her eyes to darken.","These people were having a disagreement about whether to continue chasing her or not.","If they stopped chasing after her, it would naturally be good for her.","The stars in the sky flickered, illuminating the night sky with a hazy smoke.","Her vision could reach up to ten meters.","Ye Jian, who was lying on the ground, couldn’t hear any footsteps.","She heaved a sigh of relief and stood up slowly.","In the end, they gave up on chasing because they still had to guard the outside and not let anyone in.","They wanted to turn Covil and Yeni into a lone town and an isolated city.","They wanted to clear out the government offices and NPFL militants in both places.","As for the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers who entered the two places, it was unknown what would happen to them.","However, from the fact that they were chasing after the Chinese peacekeepers, it could be seen that they were hostile to the Chinese peacekeepers.","The Chinese peacekeepers were probably their targets.","Why were these people so confident that they could turn a small town and a city into their territory?","Where did they get the confidence to go against the government forces and the NPFL militants?","After leaving the forest, Ye Jian kept thinking about it.","She had memorized the map to the town of Covil.","Even if she was thinking about something, she knew which direction to go in.","It had been an hour since she covered Squad Leader Feng and He Wei, letting them escape first.","Ye Jian relied on her strong abilities and her sharpness as a sniper to entangle with two platoons of soldiers in the hot forest for an hour.","One hour was enough for Squad Leader Feng and He Wei to reach the camp of the Chinese peacekeeping forces in the small town of Covil.","A truck drove out of the camp quickly.","The sentinel had already pulled open the iron gate of the camp.","The strong headlights lit up the front and split the night sky like a sword.","There were a total of 15 armed peacekeeping soldiers in the car.","Squad Leader Feng and He Wei, who had returned to the camp five minutes ago, were among them.","They and the other 13 peacekeeping soldiers went to rescue the female special forces soldier who came to reinforce them.","“She’ll be fine.","Don’t worry.","Special Forces soldiers won’t be killed so easily.” In the car, Squad Leader Feng patted He Wei, whose muscles were tense.","“She’ll be fine.","She’ll be safe.”","The young soldier hugged the steel gun and tightened his jaw.","Even now, he regretted not staying.","He should have stayed.","“I should’ve stayed with her.","I shouldn’t have let her face it alone.","Even if she’s a special forces female soldier! she needs support.”","He Wei’s voice was hoarse.","He said heavily, “It’s better to have two people than one, right?”","“No, not to her,” Squad Leader Feng said in a low voice.","“She’s the reinforcement invited by the special forces soldiers who have already arrived in Libya.","This shows that she’s extraordinary.","Otherwise, it would’ve been impossible for them to ask a female soldier to come specially.","“If we had stayed, we’d only be a burden to the special forces soldier who’s good at night combat and individual combat.","Our ability isn’t enough to support her, and we can’t keep up with her combat ability.”","His words made He Wei clench his fists even tighter.","Hence, they were the ones who implicated her.","“Don’t think too much.","She said that she’ll be able to escape.","I believe that she’ll be able to escape!” Squad Leader Feng, who was also worried, patted the soldier’s shoulder heavily.","He didn’t want to say any of his concerns out loud.","He didn’t want to add to the psychological pressure on the young soldier."]},{"number":4251,"title":"Chapter 4251 Self-defense","paragraphs":["Chapter 4251: Self-defense","Chapter 4251: Self-defense Editor: Henyee Translations","One person against two platoons! Squad Leader Feng’s eyes were filled with pain.","It was said that a special forces soldier could fight against a platoon or even a battalion of soldiers.","They were all elite special forces soldiers among elites.","Was that female special forces soldier an elite among elites?","He hoped that she was.","That way! she would definitely be safe.","She would definitely be safe as he thought.","She would definitely be able to gather with the male special forces soldiers who were waiting for her and successfully rescue Commissioner Miao and the others who had fallen into the hands of the NPFL militants.","The atmosphere in the truck was a little solemn.","The 15 peacekeepers had cold expressions on their faces.","They could vaguely hear the sound of artillery fire from Yeni.","They didn’t know how their comrades in Yeni were doing or how the female soldier was doing.","In the driver’s seat, the transport soldier stared ahead intently.","Holding the steering wheel tightly, he stared at the road in front of him.","He kept driving steadily, but he couldn’t drive too fast.","The road conditions were too bad.","The Chinese engineering soldiers in charge of road construction were still busy repairing the road between the small town of Covil and Yeni.","The road from Covil to the outside was still undergoing reconnaissance.","The poor road conditions made it impossible for the truck to drive too fast.","Fortunately, the transport soldier had an outstanding performance in the military unit.","Although the road conditions were bad, he could still maintain a speed of more than 60 miles per hour.","They were ordered to rescue the female soldier who was surrounded by the illegal militants from Libya.","They were racing against time.","After driving for less than 20 minutes, about 18 kilometers, the car suddenly braked.","Looking at the scene in front of the headlights, the two transport soldiers in the truck were vigilant about the situation in front.","The only path to the outside was blocked by the tree.","There was no one on either side.","It seemed the other party was waiting for them to get out of the truck and clear the obstacle.","Behind the dense leaves and intertwined branches, a few pairs of eyes flickered with excitement as they stared at the truck in front of them.","When the truck suddenly stopped, the people hiding in the branches cursed softly, expressing his dissatisfaction with the sudden stop of the truck.","The truck that stopped turned off the headlights and started to move back.","The guys hiding in the branches saw the truck suddenly retreat under the dim starlight.","They were stunned for a moment before they fired.","Their main target was the truck.","They had been watching the truck closely and didn’t notice that before the truck retreated that the people inside had already gotten out and rolled forward, hiding on both sides of the dusty road.","The truck continued to retreat.","The illegal militants hiding in the branches rushed out and raised their guns as they ran.","Gunshots sounded.","People kept rushing out from behind the branches.","The Chinese peacekeepers hiding on both sides of the road fired in self-defense.","“Damn it!","Retreat, retreat!","They’re lying in wait!","Retreat!”","The illegal militants who rushed out didn’t expect there to be an ambush on both sides of the road.","Caught off guard, several of them were instantly killed by the soldiers.","They stopped chasing after the retreating car and immediately crawled on the ground to shoot back.","Yeni was ransacked by artillery fire.","Similarly, there was artillery fire in Covil.","The only road that led to the capital city of Libya had been destroyed by artillery fire and countless bullet holes.","The Chinese soldiers came prepared and had undergone professional training.","Although they were nervous when facing the illegal militants, they accepted the challenge calmly."]},{"number":4252,"title":"Chapter 4252 Combat Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 4252: Combat Together","Chapter 4252: Combat Together Editor: Henyee Translations","This was the first time the Chinese peacekeepers were fighting with illegal militants.","It was time to test the Chinese peacekeepers’ ability to fight on the battlefield.","The gunshots in front made Ye Jian’s footsteps quicken.","She was covered in gunpowder and blood.","It was a reflex.","When she heard the gunshots, she jumped to the side and hid.","The gunshots were right in front of them.","They were very clear.","They were no more than 500 meters away.","It had been almost an hour and a half since Squad Leader Feng and He Wei left.","Could it be that the people in front were the Chinese peacekeepers and illegal militants who were trying to control the small town of Covil and the city of Yeni?","As this thought flashed past her mind, Ye Jian picked up her rifle and moved forward quickly.","It was very likely that the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers were exchanging fire with the illegal militants!","500 meters to 300 meters, 200 meters, 100 meters! 50 meters! 20 meters.","Under the faint green light, Ye Jian saw the exchange of fire at the corner in front.","She bent over and started moving stealthily.","She was like a cat in the night.","Even her footsteps were extremely light.","The firepower between the two sides was not big.","It was a broken-off exchange of fire, not a continuous exchange of fire.","Ye Jian, who was moving stealthily, was already very close to the exchange of fire between the two sides.","It was so close that she could see figures bending over.","However, she couldn’t confirm that these people exchanging fire with the illegal militants were the peacekeeping soldiers from China.","When a loudspeaker sounded in front of her, Ye Jian’s eyes lit up!","The Chinese soldiers didn’t want to exchange fire with the illegal militants.","This was a problem of internal strife in Libya.","The Chinese soldiers who came to do peacekeeping didn’t have the right to interfere.","Now that they had met, the exchange of fire between the two sides was a halting exchange of fire.","It was up to them to test each other.","It could be seen that there was still a possibility of negotiation.","They would negotiate first.","If they could stop the exchange of fire, everyone would be happy.","If the negotiation failed, they would fight directly.","There were two paths in front of them.","Either the negotiation succeeded or the negotiation failed.","Ye Jian heard her identity being revealed in English through the loudspeaker in front of her.","She silently held the Type 95 automatic rifle in her hand and aimed it at the black shadow in front of her.","She had already loaded the bullets and was waiting for the exchange of fire.","There was no need for negotiation.","The illegal militants wanted to occupy the small town of Covil and the city of Yeni.","Everyone who stopped them, including the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers, were their targets.","As expected, the peacekeeping soldiers came to negotiate a peaceful solution.","The illegal militants used the bullets in their guns to show that they didn’t want a peaceful solution at all.","In that case, it would be a firefight.","The Chinese peacekeeping soldiers who came to support Ye Jian had yet to shoot.","Ye Jian, who was waiting for the crossfire, opened fire first and attacked from the back, catching the other party off guard.","This time, Ye Jian didn’t evade and assassinate like she did in the forest.","She locked onto her targets and fired continuously.","The bullets went straight for her targets’ head.","Before her location was exposed, she killed five people in an instant.","At first, Squad Leader Feng and the rest didn’t realize that there was a crossfire.","When they heard the gunshots of the illegal militants, they suddenly split into two waves.","Squad Leader Feng’s eyes were filled with joy.","He fired continuously and said to He Wei excitedly, “He Wei!","Listen to the gunshots!","She’s fine!","She’s just in front!”","The sound of bullets whizzing past could be heard.","Squad Leader Feng’s words reached He Wei’s ears amidst the rain of guns.","Instantly, the unyielding soldiers’ eyes were filled with tears!","Soon, all the soldiers knew that the gunshots in front were from the female soldiers they were reinforcing.","Everyone got excited.","They stopped avoiding the combat and started firing in the most intense way."]},{"number":4253,"title":"Chapter 4253 Counter-Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4253: Counter-Attack","Chapter 4253: Counter-Attack Editor: Henyee Translations","“The three of you, lock onto Shooting Point A.","Suppress firepower!","“The three of you will lock onto Shooting Point B.","The three of you will lock onto Shooting Point C.","The three of you will lock onto Shooting Point D.","We’ll suppress them with firepower.","We won’t allow them to take half a step forward!","Press down until their range of activity is limited to Shooting Points A, B, C, D.","Do you understand?”","There were a total of 15 people.","They were arranged by the platoon leader and placed in the corresponding combat positions.","The other three were for support and assault.","They had to shoot accurately.","Once the enemy went past Shooting Points A and D, they would immediately complete their shooting.","The entire combat formation was a semicircle.","The outer line of the semicircle was filled with peacekeeping soldiers.","In the semicircle, there were locked illegal militants.","In the innermost part of the semicircle, there was Ye Jian, who was behind the illegal militants.","A firepower chain had been pulled up.","The Chinese peacekeeping soldiers started their self-defense counter-attack.","The soldiers who came to do peacekeeping had undergone strict training.","They were selected before they could become a member of the peacekeeping team.","After a strict selection, they could enter the peacekeeping team and be sent overseas.","From soft to hard skills, they were all top-notch in their own class.","Their combat ability could withstand tests.","Similarly, they had strong resistance to pressure.","Even though this was their first time exchanging fire with illegal militants and their first actual combat, they didn’t hesitate to raise their guns and retaliate.","This was a self-defense counter-attack.","They did not want to cause trouble nor get involved, so their actions were completely in self-defense.","Hence, even if the United Nations knew about this, they wouldn’t punish or condemn the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers.","As for Ye Jian, she didn’t feel burdened at all.","She didn’t feel that it was very dangerous for her to accept the challenge alone.","The other party was a group of illegal militants.","From this perspective, she wouldn’t have any psychological burden.","This was a crossfire with an uneven military strength, but China’s strength was far higher than the enemy’s.","The stronger Chinese peacekeeping soldiers fought calmly the entire time.","The illegal militants who were at a disadvantage were already exasperated.","They thought that they only needed to exchange fire with the Chinese soldiers in front of them, so they were not vigilant against their backs at all.","As they were the ones who controlled the route into the town of Covil, they never thought of guarding their backs.","Ye Jian’s shooting caused the illegal militants to panic.","Amidst the gunshots, they were so angry that they had no choice but to split their forces to guard their backs.","“Kill them, kill those damned fellows!”","The angry voices from the illegal militants’ camp were already covered by the gunshots.","Ye Jian couldn’t hear them, and neither could the peacekeeping soldiers.","They could have settled this peacefully, but the enemy chose to start a war.","The entire exchange of fire lasted for about an hour.","From the initial dense gunfire to sporadic gunfire, the Chinese firepower continued.","The enemy’s firepower had already stopped.","In the end, the entire crossfire point fell silent.","The Chinese soldiers stopped shooting.","They quietly waited for any movement in front of them.","He Wei wanted to get closer to watch but was pulled back by Squad Leader Feng.","“It won’t take long.","Let’s wait a little longer.”","They would wait to see if there was still any movement in front and if there would be cold weapons.","The hardest thing to guard against on the battlefield was cold weapons.","A person might think that all the enemies were dead, but in reality, there were still people hiding in the dark and waiting for an opportunity to drag others down with them.","Hence, they didn’t have to rush out immediately.","They had to wait quietly for at least five minutes.","This was the minimum waiting time.","Ye Jian had the same thought."]},{"number":4254,"title":"Chapter 4254 A Rare Female Soldier","paragraphs":["Chapter 4254: A Rare Female Soldier","Chapter 4254: A Rare Female Soldier Editor: Henyee Translations","The people she killed were able to hit their targets with their guns.","However, the peacekeeping soldiers were shooting blindly.","If they did it blindly, there would be a deviation.","If they lost the accuracy of their targets, they would lose 100% of their kills.","They fought blindly at night and were on guard against cold weapons.","It was already past 10:00 pm.","The smoke in the night wind had not dissipated, and the smell of blood mixed with the wind.","It was too strong and smelly, making people feel slightly nauseous.","The stars were clear and the moon was bright.","It was peaceful and quiet.","However, the smell of blood in the wind added to the gloom.","Ye Jian started moving.","The transport soldiers started moving too.","They drove back the truck that had retreated.","The blinding headlights shone into the night sky again.","Everyone saw the battlefield.","He Wei and Squad Leader Feng saw Ye Jian again.","They saw the female soldier who gave them the chance to survive.","They saw the female soldier’s eyes that were brighter than the stars in the sky.","Their eyes were already red.","“We’ll take a good look at her later.","Let’s clean up this place first.” Squad Leader Feng smiled and patted He Wei’s shoulder.","The moment he saw Ye Jian walking to the headlights, Squad Leader Feng’s tense heart finally relaxed.","At this moment, he saw his soldier standing at the same spot like a wooden stake.","There was a hint of hesitation in his eyes.","After thinking for a moment, he knew why his soldier was hesitating.","He wanted to go over and share a word with the female soldier, but because he felt bad, he didn’t dare to go forward.","He continued, “You can talk to her when we’re in the car.”","He Wei retracted his gaze and hummed softly.","Then, he said, “Squad Leader, do you know which military unit she’s from?”","“Why?","Are you getting any ideas?” Squad Leader Feng teased.","“Ah, no!” He Wei reacted.","Her face was a little hot.","“I’m engaged.","I have a fiancÃ©e.","I just want to know which military unit she’s from.","I’ll thank her when I return to the country.”","“That’s not right.","Kid, didn’t you say that you were single during the investigation?","Why do you suddenly have a fiancÃ©e?” Squad Leader Feng was shocked by the sudden news.","This kid hid it well.","If he hadn’t teased him, he wouldn’t have known that He Wei had a fiancÃ©e.","He Wei chuckled and quickly slipped away.","“If you want to thank her, you can just thank her in the car.","You won’t be able to find her when you return to the country.” Squad Leader Feng smiled and reminded the soldier who had slipped away.","He looked up at the female soldier who was talking to the platoon leader.","There was respect in Squad Leader Feng’s eyes.","It was rare for a female soldier to be so powerful!","After he returned to the country, he could only keep this to himself even when chatting with his close friends because they definitely wouldn’t believe that a female soldier could escape from two platoons of enemy forces alone.","Ye Jian, who had just walked out of the battlefield, was talking to the platoon leader.","She lowered her eyes slightly.","Under the headlights, her side profile was beautiful, but her eyes were extremely sharp.","“They want to control the town of Covil and the city of Yeni.","We need to rush back as soon as possible.”","When they came out, there was nothing wrong with the town.","Now that Ye Jian mentioned it, the platoon leader’s expression turned dark.","After the battlefield was cleaned up, everyone boarded the truck and immediately returned to the camp.","After getting into the truck, He Wei and Squad Leader Feng didn’t have the chance to thank Ye Jian.","Ye Jian kept communicating with the platoon leader and learned that the members of the Storm Commando Brigade had already entered Yeni to rescue Commissioner Miao and the rest.","When she arrived at the campsite, Ye Jian got her communication equipment and replenished her ammunition.","She didn’t stay any longer and immediately headed to Yeni.","She had received the latest news.","When the NPFL militants transferred Commissioner Miao and his men, they were kidnapped by the illegal militants.","That meant that Commissioner Miao, the three students, and Yang Heng had fallen into the hands of the illegal militants."]},{"number":4255,"title":"Chapter 4255 The Cool Female Soldier","paragraphs":["Chapter 4255: The Cool Female Soldier","Chapter 4255: The Cool Female Soldier Editor: Henyee Translations","Covil was also at war.","There were even illegal militants operating less than three kilometers away from the camp.","The camp wanted to send five people to Ye Jian so that they could go to Yeni together.","Ye Jian smiled and rejected them.","Covil, which was also in war, was not as safe as Yeni.","Since the illegal militants had already shown their hands to the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers, they would definitely act a second time.","Moreover, they were already moving around the camp.","It was obvious that they were ambitious.","Ye Jian was worried that something would happen to the camp.","Fortunately, the Libyan government had mobilized their forces and sent two heavy machine guns over to support them.","That was why Ye Jian felt more at ease when she left.","Ye Jian, who was good at individual combat, left without any fear.","She wore a steel helmet and a desert combat uniform.","She also put on combat boots and knee guards.","Her tactical vest was equipped with individual communication equipment.","Then, she rushed into the night.","No matter how the other soldiers looked at her, she looked exceptionally carefree.","The two people in charge of the military camp who watched her leave were dumbfounded.","Those who didn’t know that she was risking her life to enter the war-torn city to reinforce the special forces unit would think that she was on vacation.","Her back view and footsteps were cool, neat, and unrestrained.","She was also fierce like a soldier.","“How bold.","Which military unit did she train in?","I want to ask them for guidance when I return to the country,” one of the people in charge said with a low smile.","He couldn’t hide his surprise.","The other person in charge thought for a moment and sighed with a smile.","“Such a soldier is rare.","The main reason is that she’s very young, but she’s already so steady.","She’s even a female soldier.","She’s one in a million.","Her courage on the battlefield is commendable.”","“Yes, her courage is commendable.","It comes from her own strength.","She fought alone against two platoons of soldiers and successfully escaped.","If Old Feng wasn’t the one who told me, I wouldn’t have believed it.” The person in charge had already concealed the surprise in his tone.","There was only admiration left.","“I think it’ll be difficult for us to meet such a unique female soldier in the future.”","“Hahaha, she’s indeed unique.","She has the aura of a thousand soldiers.","I was worried that she wouldn’t be able to enter Yeni safely.","Now, I’m not worried anymore.”","“We can rest assured.","Now, we should think about the follow-up.","The illegal militants have already targeted our camp.","We have to be prepared.”","“Yes, that’s the most important thing now!”","The sound of a Jeep starting came from the front.","This was the transportation method that the camp gave Ye Jian.","Although it was safe to walk, it would take too much time.","Although going by car was dangerous, it saved a lot of time.","Ye Jian chose to use the car as her mode of transportation and shortened the time to rush to Yeni.","The two people in charge of the camp retracted their gazes as they watched Ye Jian leave.","Their facial expressions were a little serious as they turned around and returned to the camp.","The most important thing now was to protect the camp.","Then, they had to plan their retreat.","They had to be prepared so that they wouldn’t panic when facing the enemy.","Ye Jian drove away alone and left the camp.","She drove all the way up to Yeni and sent the Storm Commando Brigade her location.","When Li Jinnian received Ye Jian’s location, a faint smile flashed past his cold eyes.","He had considered leaving her in the relatively safe camp, but in the end, he gave up on the idea.","He felt that his cousin preferred the battlefield.","In that case, he would let her join in.","He knew that it was dangerous, but he still let her come.","He knew that it was dangerous, but she still had to face this.","This was her duty as a soldier wearing the military uniform."]},{"number":4256,"title":"Chapter 4256 Bravery","paragraphs":["Chapter 4256: Bravery","Chapter 4256: Bravery Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian didn’t have a smooth journey entering Yeni.","The road from Covil to Yeni was also controlled by illegal militants.","The government forces were carrying out a comprehensive cleanup.","Ye Jian had no choice but to abandon her car halfway and pass through the crossfire to Yeni alone.","It was already 1:00 am when she arrived at Yeni.","The flames of war were still burning in Yeni.","The three parties didn’t stop fighting.","The entire Yeni was so chaotic that no one dared to sleep.","The traffic, lighting, and communication systems in Yeni were all paralyzed.","Ye Jian, who entered Yeni while listening to the sound of artillery fire, was shocked by the scenery in front of her for a long time.","Yeni was located on the longest coastline of Libya and was also the northern part of the most beautiful coastline.","It had beautiful scenery and abundant resources.","The buildings were beautiful too.","It was the most unique tourist city in Libya.","Before the civil strife, this place was paradise.","It attracted countless tourists to Yeni for a vacation.","But now, there was no sign of heaven.","The broken beams and pillars were so dilapidated that the entire ground was desolate.","The night didn’t cover the ruins of the city.","Instead, it added to the despair.","The beautiful scenery of the past was no longer aroundâ€”only the flames of war that no one knew when they would stop.","There was a slight movement.","Ye Jian, who was hiding in the dark, tilted her body slightly and locked her gaze on the place where the movement came from.","She saw two small figures struggling to climb over the ruins.","They pulled each other and took turns helping each other climb out of the ruins that had been destroyed by gunfire.","They were completely exposed in front of Ye Jian.","They tried their best to lighten their footsteps, but there were still subtle sounds coming from under their feet as they were dressed in rags.","They didn’t know that a pair of eyes was looking at them from the dark until they were far away.","They fled toward the outside of the city.","Their home was gone.","They could only leave their home.","Ye Jian pursed her lips tightly.","She lowered her eyes and held the rifle in her hand tightly.","When she looked up again, the coldness in her eyes was even more vicious.","Ye Jian didn’t stay any longer.","She rushed toward the train station.","At this moment, Yang Heng, who was as calm as water, was standing in front of the illegal militants and blocking their path.","Behind Yang Heng were Commissioner Miao and his three students.","Commissioner Miao’s foot was injured by a stray bullet, so it was difficult for him to walk.","Yang Heng stood at the front while the three students stood in front of Commissioner Miao.","They stared at these illegal militants coldly.","Three hours ago, they fell into the hands of the illegal militants from NPFL.","They were now locked up in the office of the train station staff under the control of four illegal militants.","Just now, three illegal militants with guns entered the office.","They didn’t come with good intentions.","When they came in, they pointed their guns at them.","Yang Heng reacted immediately and stood at the front.","He remained silent and waited for the other party to speak.","The glaring torchlight swept past.","The three armed illegal militants seemed to be confirming something.","They looked at them one by one until the torchlight landed on Commissioner Miao’s calf.","“You, step forward!”","A cold voice was heard.","He pointed at Commissioner Miao, who was sitting down.","Two illegal militants were already walking toward Commissioner Miao with guns in their hands.","They planned to forcefully drag Commissioner Miao away.","Yang Heng stepped forward and blocked their path.","He said coldly, “They’re just ordinary construction engineers.","I’m an interpreter sent by the Chinese military unit.","I’m a Chinese peacekeeping soldier.”","Ordinary construction engineers and a Chinese peacekeeping soldier! The illegal militants chose the peacekeeping soldier."]},{"number":4257,"title":"Chapter 4257 Skynet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4257: Skynet","Chapter 4257: Skynet Editor: Henyee Translations","They needed the government forces to retreat.","It would be more effective to use the lives of the Chinese soldiers to threaten them.","It had been eight hours since the war in Yeni started.","The government forces were already tired.","The NPFL militants were sneak attacked from the back by illegal armed forces.","It was a perfect example of ‘going out for wool only to come home shorn’.","Instead, they were the first to retreat at around 11:00 pm.","NPFL’s original plan was to hijack the Chinese engineers and force the Chinese peacekeeping forces, including the engineering soldiers, to withdraw from Yeni and the small town of Covil.","Unexpectedly, before the plan could be carried out, they were forced to retreat by the illegal militants with heavy weapons.","In the end, the leader of the illegal militants led the way and kidnapped the Chinese engineers.","At six o’clock in the afternoon, the illegal militants who attacked from the train station became the biggest winner of this battle.","Li Jinnian and his team entered Yeni just as the illegal militants were launching an attack on the NPFL.","This delayed their plan to enter the train station to save Commissioner Miao and the others.","Even the Chinese peacekeeping force in Yeni was attacked by the illegal militants.","At around 6:00 pm, Ye Jian was engaged in a fierce battle with the illegal armed forces in the tropical forest near the village about 25 kilometers away from the town of Covil.","The Chinese peacekeeping forces in Yeni were exchanging fire with the illegal militants.","The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade broke out of the encirclement several times, but they didn’t pass through the fire line set up by NPFL and the illegal militants with heavy weapons.","When Ye Jian and the Chinese soldiers who came to save her joined forces to defend themselves, a mortar from the illegal militants landed at the entrance of the Chinese camp.","It was only three meters away from the camp.","The shrapnel from the mortar caused two serious injuries and four minor injuries to the Chinese soldiers.","Almost eight hours later, a domestic military transport plane rose into the air from the depths of the mountain at 1:00 am and headed to the border at the fastest speed.","On this day, several civilian planes flying to the border were delayed.","At this moment, the train station in Yeni became the largest crossfire point.","The entrances to the train station were all blocked by the flames of war.","There was no way to enter.","The members of the Storm Commando Brigade searched for the entrance several times but were shot back by gunfire.","The government forces, the NPFL militants, and the illegal militants split up to fight.","At 10:00 pm, the NPFL was defeated.","Even Commissioner Miao and the other five who had moved away fell into the hands of the illegal militants.","At 10:00 pm in Libya and 6:00 am domestic time, the transport plane, which had already taken off from the border an hour ago, would soon leave the country.","There were 15 special passengers on the transport plane.","The leader was Xia Jinyuan, the captain of the Xueyu unit.","He led 14 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit to the coastline of Yeni in Libya to complete the landing.","A projector was turned on, and a combat map was projected on the white cabin door between the cabin and the passenger seat.","A red dot was reflected on the combat map.","As Xia Jinyuan spoke, the red dot moved slowly.","Xia Jinyuan, who was holding a laser pointer, pointed at the map.","His handsome face was cold as he said in a low voice, “We’ll complete the airborne landing here.","This time, the situation is special.","Considering that there are heavy weapons in Yeni, we’ll complete the airborne landing at a height of 5,600 meters.","To prevent exposure, we’ll use high altitude off-air, low altitude parachutes, and the landing point will be the sea."]},{"number":4258,"title":"Chapter 4258 Betrayal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4258: Betrayal","Chapter 4258: Betrayal Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone’s gaze was on the combat map that was projected onto the cabin door.","Their facial expressions were sharp.","Even their gaze was like a polished knife that was filled with coldness.","In the cabin, Xia Jinyuan’s cold voice entered the team members’ ears clearly.","“Everyone who enters Yeni will enter the illegal militants’ base and complete the tail-cutting mission.","“The mission is a secret.","Everyone must hide their identities.","Remember, don’t let anyone see you appear in Yeni.","Do you understand?”","“Understood!”","Uniform and murderous voices were heard.","The morale was high, and there was no fear.","This time, the Xueyu unit’s mission was classified.","Besides Commander Xia and Major General Yang, who knew where the Xueyu unit was going to carry out their mission, the rest of the people, including the Chinese peacekeeping forces, didn’t know that another special forces unit would arrive in Yeni in 18 hours.","There were all kinds of supplies transported to Yeni in the transport plane.","There was food, clothes, and medicine.","This was a transport plane that transported pharmaceuticals.","After entering Libya, the radar would be turned off for an hour.","They would fly above the coastline of Yeni.","After the 15 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit landed, they would restart the radar and land in Covil to offload the supplies.","At 1:00 am in Yeni, Ye Jian, who was covered in smoke, silently hid under the chassis of a pickup truck with a heavy machine gun.","At 1:00 am, Yang Heng was taken away by the illegal militants.","As he was pushed away, Yang Heng heard a name from their conversation.","The familiar name made Yang Heng’s pupils constrict.","Alva! was the general of the Libyan government forces stationed in Yeni City.","He was in charge of guarding Yeni.","And now! he had become Lieutenant General Alva!","The government forces’ colonel, Alva, had defected!","At that moment, Yang Heng’s calves trembled slightly.","He thought of the Chinese soldiers stationed in Yeni.","One had to know that Colonel Alva could enter and leave the camp freely!","Yang Heng’s lips trembled slightly.","What should he do?","What should he do?","How could he let the Chinese peacekeeping camp know that Colonel Alva had betrayed them?","At this moment, Yang Heng wasn’t thinking about whether something would happen to him.","He was thinking about whether the soldiers in the Chinese camp would be in danger.","At 2:00 am, although the sound of artillery fire could still be heard in Yeni, it was the quietest time in the exchange of fire.","The government forces and the NPFL were defeated and temporarily stopped the fiercest fire.","They entered Yeni at around 6:30 pm, but the Storm Commando Brigade didn’t approach the train station until 2:00.","At this moment, everyone’s faces and bodies were covered in black smoke.","The three parties in Yeni exchanged fire.","All the roads in the entire city were blocked.","The Storm Commando Brigade used six hours to pass through the three crossfire points and finally arrived at their destination.","They were all on foot.","Even if they walked normally, it would take them three hours to reach the train station.","Under the rain of gunshots, they took almost seven hours to reach the vicinity of the train station.","It was considered a fast march.","Rapid footsteps came from the front.","The water ghosts, who were only about three kilometers away from the train station, didn’t even rest for a moment.","They held their breaths and hunched their bodies.","Like pitch-black cats, they quickly entered a ruin to hide."]},{"number":4259,"title":"Chapter 4259 So Hard","paragraphs":["Chapter 4259: So Hard","Chapter 4259: So Hard Editor: Henyee Translations","They couldn’t even breathe as they stuck close to the ruins and listened to the footsteps approaching from afar.","In the end, the footsteps passed through less than three meters away from them.","Then, the sound disappeared.","The sound of footsteps was suddenly heard from the ruins.","Big Eel, who was closest to the source of the sound, raised his eyes and looked behind the broken wall behind him.","He only looked up once.","He was as agile as a tiger that had been released from its cage.","He instantly crossed the broken wall that was more than a meter tall and caught a black shadow that was alarmed by the falling bricks.","“Freeze!”","Suppressing the black shadow, Big Eel had already covered the other party’s mouth tightly to prevent him from making a sound.","The five members were on guard.","The other eight members immediately cleared the surroundings to see if there were any suspicious people.","Li Jinnian was already standing in front of the black shadow that was subdued by Big Eel.","This was the small-time leader of the NPFL militants who had escaped from the massacre of the illegal militants.","The cold barrel of the gun was pressed against his head.","Li Jinnian managed to pry out the latest news about Commissioner Miao and the other five from the other party.","Now that the five of them had fallen into the hands of the illegal militants, the danger level had increased exponentially.","It was like there was a sword hanging above their necks, and it could fall at any moment.","“Demon King, we have to act as soon as possible!” Big Shark’s eyes were cold.","He endured the trembling in his heart and said in a low voice, “They’ve been kidnapped by illegal militants for almost four hours.","I’m worried now!”","Worried about what?","Big Shark didn’t say anything, but there was no need to.","The NPFL militants were led by the former president.","At the very least, they were targeting the current Libyan government.","They were still polite to the peacekeepers from several countries who had entered Libya.","Hence, Commissioner Miao and the rest were kidnapped by them with a purpose, so they were relatively safer.","However, if they had fallen into the hands of the notorious illegal militants who wouldn’t abide by international law, would there be any casualties?","The casualties that Big Shark was worried about had already happened.","The latest news that was pried out hit everyone’s hearts like a huge rock.","Everyone’s hearts sank, and a murderous look appeared in their eyes.","“They’re still in the train station.","As long as they haven’t left, we still have a chance.” Li Jinnian’s gaze was cold as he spoke.","“This is Azure Bird.","I’ve already arrived near the bell tower of the train station.”","The clear voice belonged to none other than Ye Jian, who had just entered Yeni at almost 1:00 am.","Her voice was clear and low.","It was obvious that she was talking on the public channel.","The 15 water ghosts, including Li Jinnian, were stunned.","Ye Jian, who just entered Yeni an hour ago! actually appeared at the train station?","Did she fly over?!","Ye Jian didn’t fly over.","She just hitched a ride.","“Colonel Alva, who was stationed in Yeni, has betrayed us.","Most of the heavy weapons under him were transported to the train station.","I took a ride from them.”","Ye Jian explained how she suddenly appeared in the train station in less than an hour and a half.","At the same time, she also explained why the Libyan government forces in Yeni were defeated.","It was because Colonel Alva, who was stationed there, had defected.","He was a native of Libya.","As Ye Jian spoke, she sent her latest location.","When the Storm Commando Brigade scout, Sea Anemone, saw it, he said in a low voice, “That’s right.","She’s near the bell tower of the train station.”","“Why is she so lucky?” A team member said in a low voice, expressing everyone’s thoughts.","They spent seven hours and almost lost their lives.","Azure Bird entered the hinterland of the train station in less than an hour and a half.","Wasn’t she lucky?"]},{"number":4260,"title":"Chapter 4260 Urgent","paragraphs":["Chapter 4260: Urgent","Chapter 4260: Urgent Editor: Henyee Translations","Although the team members were muttering in low voices, they were all on the same channel.","No matter how low their voices were, Ye Jian could hear them clearly.","She was already smiling as she approached the train station alone.","She sighed and said, “My luck only improved a little when I reached Yeni.","Before I came, I fought all the way here.","After entering the small town of Covil, I exchanged fire with the illegal militants twice.","After entering Yeni, I met them again.","In the end, I had no choice but to abandon the car.","Fortunately, my luck improved here.","If not, I’m afraid that I’d still be slinking outside after you rescued the missing people.”","She smiled and sighed as she explained the dangers she faced when she came over.","The faces of the water ghosts from Storm Commando Brigade turned serious.","She was saying all this with a smile, explaining how she had breezed through the dangers along the way.","However, they knew how difficult it was for her to come to Yeni alone.","“Thank you for your hard work, Azure Bird.”","“She’s very powerful.","She’s the best female soldier we’ve ever seen.”","“Azure Bird, wait for us.","We’ll meet you soon.”","“Don’t run around.","The train station is a stronghold for illegal militants.","You must be careful!”","The voices of the water ghosts came from the earpieces.","Their voices were tense, afraid that something would happen to Ye Jian, who had already entered the hinterland.","Ye Jian’s breath was filled with the smell of gunpowder.","She looked around and smiled softly.","“I’ll be careful on my side.","Don’t worry about me.","Alva has sent at least ten heavy machine guns over.","Be careful when you come over.”","Li Jinnian pursed his lips tightly.","It was his mistake.","He didn’t predict that Yeni and the small town of Covil would become the gathering point of the illegal militants.","If he could have thought of it in advance, his cousin wouldn’t have needed to take such a huge risk to come to Libya because of his words.","She was still a military school student.","She should be in the country, sitting in a spacious and bright classroom and having lessons.","She shouldn’t have to walk through the gunpowder to come to Yeni.","Li Jinnian adjusted his emotions and said in a cold voice, “Azure Bird, we’re about three kilometers away from the train station.”","Now was not the time to feel guilty.","They needed to find Commissioner Miao and his group as soon as possible and bring them out of this place.","As he spoke, he raised his hand gently.","The NPFL militant, who had no ability to resist, was killed by Big Eel.","He looked in the direction of the train station and said coldly, “The latest news is that Commissioner Miao and the others have fallen into the hands of the illegal militants and are hiding in the train station.","“There’s a bomb shelter at the train station.","Commissioner Miao and the rest might still be in the bomb shelter.","The entrance of the bomb shelter is the waiting room on the west side.","Go to the waiting room on the west side now and find a high ground to receive us.”","Li Jinnian had the map of the train station provided by the Chinese engineering soldiers in Yeni.","It showed the layout on the ground and underground, including the underground drainage system.","“I’m approaching the west side now.” Ye Jian, who was observing her surroundings, started moving stealthily.","She said, “The dugout is on the west side.","After Alva got out of the vehicle, he also walked toward the west.","There’s a situation!”","Before she could finish speaking, Ye Jian quickly cut off the communication.","She pressed her body against a marble pillar and held her breath.","She slowly moved around the pillar as the illegal militants walked quickly along the corridor of the train station.","Only their backs could be seen.","Ye Jian rushed out and brushed past a few rocks.","Then, she hunched over and hid.","The train station was huge, and there were many illegal militants hiding under the bomb shelter.","It would take too long to find the missing people.","They might as well try to find the rebel army general, Alva, and see if they could find Commissioner Miao and the rest through him."]},{"number":4261,"title":"Chapter 4261 Fearless Soldiers","paragraphs":["Chapter 4261: Fearless Soldiers","Chapter 4261: Fearless Soldiers Editor: Henyee Translations","Yeni City Train Station was a huge circular building.","The circular area was surrounded by a dome-shaped corridor with Libyan characteristics.","Outside the corridor was a peaked building.","On the other hand, the square outside was huge..","After walking through the long corridor and passing through the marble pillars, one would reach the round square.","In the middle of the round square was a fountain.","Before the civil war broke out, Yeni City Train Station was also a tourist attraction.","Countless tourists would sit on the stone steps that surrounded the square.","They would look at the fountain in the middle of the square that was sometimes high and sometimes low.","They would listen to the buskers singing songs and playing all kinds of music.","They would watch the pigeons and the tourists who strolled around the square together.","They would place some snacks in their palms.","The pigeons, already used to blending into the crowd to find food, would flap their wings and fly over.","The youths of Libya would follow the music and dance to the beat.","Countless tourists would raise their cameras and take photos of the scenery at the train station.","Before the civil war broke out, even the train station was a paradise.","Now, almost all the buildings around the ring-shaped square had been destroyed.","Half of the circular corridor had collapsed.","Huge rocks scattered all around.","The place was filled with dejection.","As for the fountain in the middle of the square, it had never spewed out clear water since the civil strife broke out.","Even the pipes had rusted.","Hiding in a corner of the abandoned stone corridor, Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief and continued moving toward the west.","When she was hiding in the bell tower, she saw Alva leading his personal guards to the west of the train station.","The entrance to the bomb shelter was also on the west side.","She had to think of a way to enter the bomb shelter.","The train station was not peaceful.","The illegal militants who had occupied the train station started to plan their advancement.","They would use the train station as the center and chase out all the government forces and NPFL militants in the city.","This was the hideout of the rebel general, Alva.","The most dangerous place was the safest place.","This was why Alva didn’t leave the city.","Instead, he brought heavy firepower into the train station.","The government forces probably thought that Colonel Alva had already left Yeni.","As Ye Jian approached the entrance of the bomb shelter on the west side of the train station, the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade started moving quickly.","They needed to meet up with Ye Jian as soon as possible and let her enter the train station alone.","All the water ghosts were very worried.","“Three o’clock, sentry post, evade.”","“Move 300 meters forward and turn right!”","!","In the ruins, dozens of black shadows moved forward with the alternation of vigilance.","Without much communication, they entered the hinterland of the train station at the fastest speed.","A military vehicle equipped with a heavy machine gun drove out of the original bus station of the train station.","Then, an open-top Jeep and a truck with dozens of illegal militants drove out together.","The sound of the vehicles’ motors made the black figures moving forward quickly avoid it.","Ye Jian, who was about to reach the west side of the train station, rolled a few times and finally hid in a corner formed by a few huge rocks.","“There’s a situation.","At least three vehicles drove out from the west side of the train station.” Ye Jian, who was hiding, reminded her comrades outside in a low voice.","At this moment, the members of the Storm Commando Brigade were her comrades.","Ye Jian took out her night-vision foldable binoculars from her tactical vest.","Hiding in the corner, Ye Jian scanned the direction of the motor sound.","Her vision was blocked, so she couldn’t spot the vehicles immediately.","She asked, “My line of sight is blocked.","There’s a parking lot to the west, right?”"]},{"number":4262,"title":"Chapter 4262 Action","paragraphs":["Chapter 4262: Action","Chapter 4262: Action Editor: Henyee Translations","Sea Anemone’s voice came from the earpieces.","“That’s right.","The westernmost area is the tourist bus parking lot.”","“Okay, I’ll find a high ground and see if they’re taking any action.” Ye Jian put away her binoculars and looked around.","Her eyes were cold as she quickly crawled out from the corner.","Then, she climbed onto the huge rock that was originally a marble pillar with both hands.","She stepped on the huge rock agilely and jumped up.","She grabbed the broken marble pillar and climbed to the ceiling of the corridor with both hands.","She used her arm strength to pull herself up.","Then, she jumped onto the collapsed corner of the dome.","Ye Jian, who was already at the high ground of the round-shaped square of the train station, laid down tightly.","Her speed was a little too fast.","When she laid down, her chest was pressed down by a sharp and hard object.","Caught off guard, she frowned.","She touched it.","It was a piece of shrapnel that had flown to the top of the dome.","She adjusted her position and used her binoculars to observe the direction where the headlights came from.","As the focus was adjusted, a soldier’s vehicle with a heavy machine gun appeared through the binoculars first.","Then, an open Jeep appeared.","The moment the vehicles drove out of her vision, Ye Jian’s pupils constricted.","Yang Heng!","Yang Heng was sitting in the Jeep!","“I’ve spotted Interpreter Yang Heng.","He’s in the back seat of the second open-top Jeep.","There are four illegal militants in the Jeep.” Ye Jian’s tone was light and fast.","She reported the situation she observed.","“The first vehicle is a heavy machine military vehicle.","The second is a military truck.","There are a total of!”","Ye Jian glanced at the scene quickly.","The military vehicles that drove away formed an image in Ye Jian’s mind.","The people in the car became numbers.","Ye Jian accurately reported how many illegal militants were in the vehicles.","“There are 15 soldiers in the military vehicle.","Besides the main and deputy marksman, there are also two drivers in the heavy machine gun military vehicle.","There are a total of 23 illegal militants.","The vehicles are now driving into Saibin Avenue!”","Ye Jian had seen the city map of Yeni in the Chinese peacekeeping camp of the small town of Covil.","She focused on the port, the train station, the shipyard, and the map of the four transportation fortresses in the heliport that used to be for business trips.","Now, the information came in handy.","She had already memorized the traffic routes of these places.","Based on the changes in the headlights and the approximate number of turns the vehicles made, she could tell which street the vehicles had driven to.","This way, the Storm Commando Brigade outside could make their corresponding combat deployment as soon as possible.","Sea Anemone thought that Ye Jian was also carrying a map of Yeni.","After hiding, he spread out the map, and Li Jinnian started to deploy the combat according to the clues provided by Ye Jian.","After confirming that the accompanying interpreter, Yang Heng, was safe, what they needed to do next was to rescue Yang Heng!","Li Jinnian said in a low voice, “Group B, rescue Yang Heng.","Big Shark, bring Group A forward!”","“Group A, copy.","Group A, copy.”","“Group B, copy.","Group B, copy.”","Group A was led by Big Shark, and they went toward the train team.","Group B was led by Li Jinnian.","They started to deploy the combat plan.","Li Jinnian and Group A’s combat plan was relayed through the earpieces.","Yang Heng was in the military vehicle, and there was a heavy machine military vehicle in front to clear the way.","It was impossible to fight directly.","They could only use their wits.","It wasn’t easy to rescue Yang Heng without alerting the illegal militants.","It was difficult to outwit them too.","It was unrealistic to attack near the train station.","Once the illegal militants were alerted, it would be a large-scale firepower support.","The soldiers would not be able to escape successfully.","They could only follow the vehicles closely and wait for an opportunity to make a move."]},{"number":4263,"title":"Chapter 4263 Cannon Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4263: Cannon Attack","Chapter 4263: Cannon Attack Editor: Henyee Translations","The vehicles had already driven out of the train station for about five kilometers.","An explosion sounded at the corner of the crossroads without any warning.","Flames soared into the sky, and smoke enveloped Yeni again.","At 3:00 am, the government forces opened fire on the illegal militants who had occupied Yeni.","The moment the explosion occurred, Ye Jian, who was approaching the entrance of the bomb shelter, suddenly heard the explosion.","Her eyes narrowed.","She dodged to the side and asked in a low voice, “What’s the situation in front?”","“The vehicles were attacked.","The government forces must have fired at the illegal militants,” Li Jinnian replied to Ye Jian immediately.","Under the light of the fire, his eyes were as cold as ice.","“The chance to save Yang Heng is here.”","The members of the Storm Commando Brigade, who had been chasing after the other party, found cover with the sound of the explosion.","In less than 30 seconds, Demon King Li Jinnian was the first to get up.","He shouted, “Move forward quickly!”","The NPFL militants had no choice but to retreat from Yeni after being defeated.","Now, the Libyan government forces were the ones firing at the illegal militants.","In that case, the Storm Commando Brigade had the confidence to rescue Yang Heng as soon as possible.","Gunshots were heard.","Yang Heng, who was sitting in the open Jeep, had his hands and legs tied up.","The guy who was holding him down pushed him out of the Jeep roughly.","“Damn it!","Hurry up and get off!","Get off!”","Yang Heng, who couldn’t move properly, got off the Jeep in a daze.","The bullets hit the Jeep.","Bang, bang, bang.","Amidst the gunshots, the illegal militant who was holding Yang Heng was about to lift him up when he was hit in the head by a bullet.","Red blood and white brain matter splattered all over Yang Heng.","His entire body was thrown toward Yang Heng.","The illegal militant’s body didn’t hit Yang Heng.","Instead, it hit the car door that was half-opened.","Blood kept flowing out.","The car was smashed in a weird and distorted manner.","Below the body was Yang Heng, who had fallen from the vehicle.","Half of his face was burning with pain.","Yang Heng, who had fallen to the ground, didn’t know that this person had been shot in the head.","His face was splattered with blood as he listened to the concentrated gunshots.","His tied hands were trembling slightly.","Yang Heng, whose face was facing the ground, calmed himself down.","Then, he flipped over and arched his body.","Just as he was about to stand up, warm and sticky liquid flowed onto his face.","The thick smell of blood assaulted his face.","Yang Heng seemed to have thought of something.","His expression changed and he vomited.","No wonder these guys didn’t drag him away immediately when he fell.","No wonder he heard something hitting the car just now.","As it turned out!","Yang Heng couldn’t help but vomit.","He turned his head and leaned against the Jeep.","His face was covered in blood.","He couldn’t even breathe heavily because as long as he opened his mouth! the blood on his face would definitely flow into his mouth.","His nose was surrounded by the strong smell of blood.","Yang Heng raised his arm and quickly buried his head to wipe his face.","At least he could open his right eye normally.","Without looking, he fell to the ground.","He hoped that the guy was dead.","That way, it would be easier for him to untie the rope around his feet.","“It’s the government forces!","The government forces sneak attacked us.","Retreat!","Retreat!”","The gunshots were mixed with the shouts of the illegal militants.","They had already jumped down from the vehicles and started to fight back and retreat.","Their voices were trembling.","It was obvious that they were afraid.","A black shadow approached Yang Heng when he was lowering his head and trying hard to untie the rope.","Yang Heng suddenly noticed it and dodged instinctively.","He heard the black shadow say, “I’m a Chinese soldier!”"]},{"number":4264,"title":"Chapter 4264 Counter-attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4264: Counter-attack","Chapter 4264: Counter-attack Editor: Henyee Translations","The sentence was brief and concise, but it made Yang Heng feel like he had found his home.","At that moment, Yang Heng knew that he was saved.","Five minutes before they opened fire, the Chinese peacekeeping camp in Yeni received a warning from the illegal militants.","They asked the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers to evacuate Yeni within two hours.","If they didn’t evacuate Yeni within two hours, a peacekeeping soldier in charge of interpreting would die.","This interpreter was Yang Heng.","The members of the Storm Commando Brigade received a message from the peacekeeping camp and learned that Yang Heng was being controlled by illegal militants.","If the Chinese peacekeeping forces didn’t leave within two hours, Yang Heng would be killed by the illegal militants.","Li Jinnian, who received the news, hid in a corner and aimed his rifle at the target who was trying to climb into the military vehicle and set up a heavy machine gun.","He replied to the captain of the Chinese peacekeeping force who was talking to him, “Give us five minutes to rescue Yang Heng.”","Within five minutes, Li Jinnian killed four illegal militants who tried to get close to the heavy machine gun that hadn’t been blown up.","Then, covered by his comrades, Li Jinnian quickly approached the Jeep.","He successfully rescued Yang Heng.","“Interpreter Yang Heng has been successfully rescued.” His cold voice entered everyone’s ears through the fair channel.","Right on the heels of that, the scout, Sea Anemone, contacted the captain of the Chinese peacekeeping force and reported this news.","The captain let out a long breath.","He thought that Yang Heng would be killed by the illegal militants.","Now, he was saved!","The captain heaved a sigh of relief and said to a soldier beside him, “Tell the country that Yang Heng has been successfully rescued!”","“Yes!” The soldier who had a look of awe on his face immediately contacted the country.","Ye Jian, who had already met up with Big Shark and the rest, was elated when she found out.","The sudden opening fire of the government forces could be said to have helped the Storm Commando Brigade, allowing them to save Yang Heng in the shortest time possible.","Since Yang Heng had been rescued, it was imperative to rescue Commissioner Miao and the three students.","“Commissioner Miao and three students are still in the bomb shelter of the train station.","It’s located near the southwest corner.","The bomb shelter is where food is stored.","Commissioner Miao’s leg was injured by a stray bullet, so it’s inconvenient for him to move.”","Yang Heng, who was rescued, provided the latest news.","Li Jinnian simplified this piece of news to his comrades.","“The illegal militants guarding Commissioner Miao and three students are waiting for the news outside.","If the Chinese peacekeeping forces don’t retreat to Yeni within two hours, Commissioner Miao and the others will be killed.”","Hearing this, everyone was furious.","They wanted to blow up the entire train station.","Amidst the gunshots, Li Jinnian’s cold voice entered the ears of every comrade.","“We’ll meet up now.","Find the location of the remaining people immediately!”","This time, they had to bring Yang Heng along.","Li Jinnian passed a rifle that he had picked up on the ground to Yang Heng.","This was Yang Heng’s self-defense weapon.","He couldn’t be left alone, and the Storm Commando Brigade couldn’t leave anyone to accompany him.","They could only let Yang Heng return to the hinterland of the train station with them.","Most importantly, Yang Heng knew where Commissioner Miao and the other three were being held.","The firepower of the government forces woke up the illegal militants sleeping at the train station.","It also woke the rebel general, Alva, up from his dream.","When he knew that the government forces had suddenly opened fire on them, Alva smiled coldly."]},{"number":4265,"title":"Chapter 4265 Heartbeat","paragraphs":["Chapter 4265: Heartbeat Chapter 4265: Heartbeat","Editor: Henyee Translations At 3:00 am, Yeni fell into artillery fire again.","Yeni was a transportation fortress.","Its geographical location was special.","The government forces that were temporarily defeated by the NPFL militants and illegal militants mobilized their forces and started a sweeping attack.","The rebel general, Alva, made a quick judgment.","He mobilized his heavy weapons and fired at the government forces too.","The battle between the two armies was tragic.","Countless civilians who finally fell asleep were caught in the gunfire.","Cries and screams could be heard everywhere in the smoke-covered city of Yeni.","The government forces concentrated their fire on the train station.","They had orders to take down the train station within three hours and kill the traitor, Alva.","Alva, who was mobilizing his soldiers, didn’t know that he had been exposed.","He still thought that his secret was hidden from the government.","His eyes were filled with viciousness as he fired at his former comrades.","Yang Heng listened to the sound of gunfire that made his eardrums hurt.","He held his rifle tightly and followed the soldiers who were leading him without even blinking.","They passed through the smoke and avoided groups of illegal militants.","Yang Heng heard his heart beating like thunder and knew how frightened he was.","He was indeed afraid.","Before sending him to Libya, the leader had a conversation with him.","He clearly told Yang Heng that the situation in Libya was unstable and there were constant wars.","It was a rather dangerous country.","It was very likely that he wouldn’t be able to come back if he went.","The leader asked if Yang Heng dared to go over.","At that time, Yang Heng was in high spirits.","Like a newborn calf that was not afraid of tigers, he said brightly, “Yes, I dare to!","There’s nothing to be afraid of.","I’ll definitely obey your arrangements!” Yes, that was his firm reply.","He thought that he was well-prepared and wouldn’t cower.","But nowâ€¦ Yang Heng, who was staggering, smiled bitterly.","He was probably not far away from being a coward.","In just a short moment of distraction, a black shadow pressed Yang Heng and his gun to the ground.","Yang Heng, whose body was hurting from the gravel on the ground, heard the leader of the operation team question angrily, “Do you still want to live?” His voice was cold like an unsheathed sword.","It was so sharp that Yang Heng couldn’t help but swallow his saliva.","Yes, he wanted his life.","Before he was taken away by the illegal armed forces, he was really prepared to sacrifice himself.","But now that he was saved, he cherished his life again.","An illegal militant who went to exchange fire with the government forces ran past the dilapidated street less than three meters away from them.","Amidst the sound of gunfire, his footsteps could still be heard clearly.","Only then did Yang Heng realize that he was distracted for a few seconds and almost bumped into the illegal militant.","The weight on his body moved away.","He heard the captain say in a low voice, “We’ve arrived at the train station.","We’ll cross the square and reach the west in ten minutes.” The captain’s voice was very cold.","After a slight pause, he said another word, “Okay!” Ye Jian, Big Shark, and the rest had already successfully entered the bomb shelter.","They started searching according to the location provided by Yang Heng.","Yang Heng had already gotten up and continued following them.","This time, he didn’t dare to be distracted anymore.","He was afraid that if he was distracted again, he would lose his life.","Under the faint starlight, the soldiers who saved him were all agile.","They went up and down at high speeds.","They were much stronger than the peacekeeping soldiers he had seen.","Moreover, he felt that they should be able to move faster, but they were dragged down by him.","Could it be that the people who saved him weren’t the peacekeeping soldiers butâ€¦"]},{"number":4266,"title":"Chapter 4266 Difficulties And Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4266: Difficulties And Danger Chapter 4266: Difficulties And Danger","Editor: Henyee Translations As this thought flashed past his mind, Yang Heng’s heart trembled.","Special forces!","The people who saved him weren’t the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers but special forces soldiers!","Yang Heng, who had guessed the identity of the water ghosts, didn’t dare to be distracted anymore.","He was really afraid that he would lose them!","Because the government forces were concentrated on attacking the train station, almost all the illegal militants stationed at the train station came out.","The reason why Ye Jian and the rest were able to enter the bomb shelter smoothly was because the enemies who were resting in the bomb shelter had all come out to attack the government forces.","As a result, there were very few soldiers in the bomb shelter.","There was an independent power supply in the bomb shelter.","The power in various parts of Yeni was cut off, but there were still lights here.","Even if there were only a few 5-watt tungsten lamps lit up, they could still illuminate a corner.","The scout, Sea Anemone, made two hand gestures.","There was a sentinel at a corner three meters away, and he pointed to the lit light bulb.","The soldiers moved forward in two directions.","Ye Jian replied with an ‘OK’ gesture.","She was in charge of extinguishing the light bulb while the rest were in charge of killing the sentinel.","They avoided the sentinels when they entered the bomb shelter.","Now that they were inside, they could only kill the sentinels.","If not, they wouldn’t be able to reach the depths of this curved bomb shelter.","The extinguishing of the light bulb was a small matter.","She took out a bullet from the magazine and held it between her fingers.","She aimed at the light bulb and threw it.","Crash!","The light bulb was hit by the bullet, and the crisp sound of glass shattering could be heard.","The curved tunnel was instantly pitch-black.","“Who’s there?” The sentinel’s voice came from the darkness.","The scout, Sea Anemone, had already rushed over and instantly covered the sentinel’s mouth.","The water ghosts who had trained with the Xueyu unit were very familiar with neck twisting.","Their skin color was different.","It was impossible to disguise as the sentinel.","Before Sea Anemone could dodge, footsteps came from ahead.","Actually, there was no place to hide.","The bomb shelter tunnel was a snake-shaped tunnel with nothing on either side.","Sea Anemone, who had nowhere to hide, quickly took out his pistol with a silencer and planned to kill the person.","Ye Jian retaliated even faster.","She threw the combat dagger out of her hand and stabbed the neck of the person who came.","She didn’t give the other party a chance to discover Sea Anemone.","Beautiful!","Big Shark, who was leaning against the wall, gave Ye Jian a thumbs-up.","However, Ye Jian didn’t see it.","She heaved a sigh of relief and leaned against the cold wall, waving behind her.","Big Shark and the other five followed closely behind and advanced alternately.","The bomb shelter was very cold.","Even so, layers of sweat kept appearing on Ye Jian’s back.","This was the most dangerous mission she had ever carried out.","The main reason was that there was no place to hide.","If anyone came over, she would have to face them directly.","Fortunately, this was a snake-shaped tunnel.","It could more or less provide cover.","It took 12 minutes to pass through this seven-meter-deep tunnel and reach a fork in the tunnel.","To the right was a huge space that could accommodate nearly 500 people, which was under the circular square of the train station.","To the left were various independent rooms with complicated terrain.","Normally, they were basements where officials hid.","Yang Heng said that the missing people were locked in a cave with complicated terrain, so Ye Jian and the rest had to go to the left.","The communication signal was a little weak.","Li Jinnian, who was already lurking near the entrance of the bomb shelter, received the latest news intermittently.","Just as he was about to answer, he heard gunshots from his earpiece!"]},{"number":4267,"title":"Chapter 4267 Blood Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4267: Blood Battle Chapter 4267: Blood Battle","Editor: Henyee Translations The sound of gunshots suddenly came from the earpiece.","Li Jinnian’s eyes turned sharp.","The scout, Sea Anemone, said hurriedly, “Demon King Li, receive us outside!” They had already rescued Commissioner Miao and his men and were preparing to retreat!","There was no need for Yang Heng to lead the way.","Almost as soon as Sea Anemone finished speaking, Li Jinnian said to Yang Heng, “We’ve found them.","Take care of yourself outside!” Yang Heng listened to the deep voice.","He held his rifle tightly and opened his mouth to answer, but he realized that his throat was so dry that it was in pain.","It was difficult for him to even say the word ‘okay’.","He could only nod quickly to answer.","They were all wearing night-vision goggles.","Li Jinnian could see him nodding.","Sensing Yang Heng’s nervousness, Li Jinnian raised his hand and patted his shoulder lightly.","Before Yang Heng could say anything, Li Jinnian had already taken out his pistol and aimed at the sentinel who was exposed to them.","He could still hear gunshots from his earpiece.","The gunshots came too suddenly and didn’t suit the combat style of a sneak attack at all.","The other party almost directly exposed themselves, putting all the members who had infiltrated the bomb shelter in danger.","Why did they suddenly shoot?","The faces of the water ghosts, including Li Jinnian, darkened.","They were puzzled.","There was no time to ask why they suddenly fired.","Hearing the anxious voice of Sea Anemone, everyone moved quickly to complete the clearing of the sentinels outside.","The cave in the bomb shelter was extremely deep, but there was already a chaotic battle inside.","The sentinels outside were stunned for a few seconds when they suddenly heard the gunshots.","They didn’t understand why there were still gunshots in the bomb shelter.","Then, one of the sentinels picked up the whistle hanging in front of his chest.","Just as he was about to blow it, a bullet hit his forehead.","Bang, bang, bang!","The sound of several silencers sounded almost uniformly.","The explosions that blended into the sky above the city didn’t cause any ripples.","The soldiers entered the bomb shelter at the fastest speed.","Four people brought Yang Heng to stand guard outside.","Yang Heng just needed to take care of himself.","It wasn’t time for him to participate in the combat.","The bomb shelter was pitch-black.","The independent power supply had been completely destroyed by the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade.","Gunshots came from the end of the tunnel of the bomb shelter.","Ye Jian, who was hiding in a corner, killed several targets in an instant.","Two of them were illegal militants who were preparing to shoot Commissioner Miao and the other three.","Ye Jian and the members of the Storm Commando Brigade arrived at the right time.","As the government forces attacked, the illegal militants used the excuse that they had ‘Chinese engineers’ in their hands to threaten the government forces.","The illegal militants, who were keeping an eye on the Chinese peacekeeping forces’ camp, also reported that the Chinese peacekeeping forces had yet to evacuate.","The traitor, Alva, ordered them to kill the ‘Chinese engineers’.","Ye Jian and Sea Anemone, who were at the front, saved them.","The illegal militants were already aiming their guns at Commissioner Miao and his three students.","As the bullets were loaded, gunshots sounded without any warning.","When Ye Jian killed an illegal militant with a gun, the illegal militants who weren’t present, including the traitor, Alva, didn’t realize that the first shot was aimed at them.","Commissioner Miao and the three students watched as the illegal militants who were aiming their guns at them were shot and fell to the ground.","Right on the heels of that, two more people fell to the ground.","In the end, the entire bomb shelter fell into darkness.","Amidst the chaotic gunshots, Commissioner Miao heard a voice speaking in Mandarin.","“We’re late.","I’m sorry.”"]},{"number":4268,"title":"Chapter 4268 Trap","paragraphs":["Chapter 4268: Trap Chapter 4268: Trap","Editor: Henyee Translations The clear and cold voice of a woman pierced through the darkness.","Commissioner Miao and the three students instantly understood that this was a soldier sent by the military to save them.","The water ghosts, who were moving separately, quickly approached Ye Jian.","The power equipment had been destroyed.","They cleared a path for Ye Jian and Sea Anemone’s evacuation.","At the same time, Sea Anemone told their comrades guarding outside to receive them and retreat.","The gunshots in the pitch-black bomb shelter were as dense as rain.","The traitor, Alva, knew that his hiding spot had been infiltrated.","Even the Chinese engineers they kidnapped from the NPFL militants had been rescued.","Hence, he knew that the people who entered the bomb shelter were soldiers sent by the Chinese.","Before tonight, he was also a member of the government forces.","He knew very well that if such a thing happened, the government forces wouldn’t be able to send soldiers to help the Chinese peacekeeping forces.","Hence, these people weren’t government soldiers but Chinese soldiers!","“Kill them here.","I don’t want to see any Chinese soldiers leaving alive.” This was what Alva ordered his subordinates to do.","In the past, the subordinates in the bomb shelter were all government forces.","Now, they were all illegal militants.","Everyone would obey his orders and kill the Chinese soldiers who entered the bomb shelter.","Ye Jian and Sea Anemone covered Commissioner Miao and the other three people as they retreated.","In front of them, Big Shark and the rest fought their way out.","In the middle, under Ye Jian’s instructions, Commissioner Miao and the three students hunched their backs and pressed their heads against the wall.","They passed through the smoke and headed outside.","“Quick, follow them!” “Seaweed, left!” “Azure Bird, retreat with your men!” There was a rain of gunshots in the air defense cave.","Ye Jian and Sea Anemone couldn’t retreat immediately after two consecutive charges.","They were suppressed by the blind firepower.","The personal soldiers around Alva were all very powerful.","They suppressed the Storm Commando Brigade members so much that they could only fight and dodge at the same time.","Fortunately, they had night-vision goggles to help them.","They could immediately discover their target and shoot.","On the other hand, the illegal militants were fighting blindly.","Some of them even injured themselves.","Soon, they realized that the Chinese soldiers who were on a rescue mission were powerful.","They immediately reported to Alva.","Alva was hiding in the deepest part of a bomb shelter.","When he was passing through, he needed to bend over to enter.","When he knew that the Chinese soldiers who came to rescue their captives were powerful, he kicked the round wooden stool beside his feet.","His slightly bulging eyes were fierce and cold in the dark.","He said coldly, “Go outside and destroy this place!” Unexpectedly, it wasn’t the government forces that came here.","Instead, it was the Chinese peacekeepers!","He would teach these damned fellows a lesson tonight.","He would let the Chinese peacekeeping forces know the consequences of opposing him!","He only had 50 men left.","Now that he knew that the Chinese soldiers were powerful, Alva immediately retreated with the few people around him.","Li Jinnian and his three comrades passed through the tunnel and fired at the backs of the illegal militants.","Screams could be heard in the pitch-black bomb shelter.","The smell of blood in the air was like being in a pool of blood.","The entire bomb shelter was like hell.","Bang, bang, bang, bangâ€¦ Gunshots kept coming.","The illegal militants who were attacked on the front and back suffered even more casualties.","They couldn’t shoot accurately and relied on their own judgment to shoot until the firepower got weaker and weaker.","In the end, they couldn’t resist.","At this moment, Alva had already escaped from the bomb shelter with six soldiers.","He didn’t leave immediately.","Instead, he rushed to the waiting room of the train station with his soldiers.","That was their armory!"]},{"number":4269,"title":"Chapter 4269 Bloody","paragraphs":["Chapter 4269: Bloody Chapter 4269: Bloody","Editor: Henyee Translations “Retreat, retreat!” “Big Shark, cover us!” “Enter the basement entrance of the bomb shelter.","Cover in front!” “Cleared ahead!” “The tunnel has been cleared!” “Retreat.","Retreat.” The voices of the comrades could be heard clearly through the earpieces.","The enemy’s firepower had completely weakened.","They needed to evacuate before reinforcements arrived.","Stepping over the bodies of the illegal militants who had been killed, their military boots were stained with sticky blood.","Their knees were slightly bent, and their backs were slightly hunched.","Their shoulders were pressed against the butt of their rifles, and their fingers were lightly placed on the trigger.","They retreated from the bomb shelter in a combat posture.","Ye Jian and Sea Anemone had been protecting Commissioner Miao and the other three who had been rescued.","Behind them were Big Shark and the other two comrades who were covering the retreat.","In this dark world, many corpses could be seen lying on the ground of the bomb shelter.","Commissioner Miao, whose leg was injured, tripped.","Fortunately, the students who were supporting him pulled him tightly so that he wouldn’t fall.","“Mentor, walk close to the wall.” The student who was supporting him reminded him in a low voice.","It was a familiar voice.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but falter slightly.","It turned out she had saved her senior from the blue team during the first-year exercise.","In that case, wouldn’t this senior have recognized her since she had spoken just now?","He had indeed recognized Ye Jian a long time ago.","When Ye Jian killed the illegal militant who was preparing to shoot Commissioner Miao, this senior who was already a doctor didn’t immediately recognize that the female soldier who saved him was his junior who had fought with him before.","It was not until she opened her mouth and he heard her familiar voice that he recognized the female soldier who saved him.","Junior Ye Jian.","During her first year, she built a pseudo-base station to delay the blue team.","At that time, he was still a graduate student who specialized in electromagnetism.","He was defeated by his first-year junior.","Even though it had been almost two years, the memory was still fresh.","When he was still in school, he would hear legends about this junior from time to time.","From her first to her third years, she defeated all the other students.","She became a famous figure in the military school and made countless male students bow down to her.","Even those in the electromagnetic laboratory, who usually only had their eyes on their experiments, knew about Ye Jian.","They even wondered if they should send a love letter to Ye Jian’s inbox anonymously.","But they just said that casually.","They wouldn’t really take action.","As one of the seniors who had been defeated by her, he had even sat with her and chatted with her for a few hours.","They ended up discussing the ‘pseudo-base station’ suggestion a few times, so they were even more familiar with each other.","After he entered the electromagnetic laboratory, he didn’t meet Ye Jian again.","After two years, she was the one who came to save him.","He had always known that his junior wasn’t simple.","This time, he was fully aware that his juniorâ€¦ was really extraordinary!","After reaching the ten-meter tunnel and meeting up with Li Jinnian and the other comrades who came to help clear the area, Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief.","Her cousin was walking over quickly.","At least the front had been cleared and they could leave smoothly.","The sound of footsteps was hurried.","They finally passed through the tunnel.","The entrance was in front.","Commissioner Miao and three students came out first, followed by Ye Jian and Sea Anemone.","“Hurry, hurry, hurry!” “Watch out!” A light mortar was already set up.","Following Alva’s order, it was fired into the escape route he escaped from.","The cannonball shot into the cave of the bomb shelter with huge lethalityâ€¦"]},{"number":4270,"title":"Chapter 4270 Exposed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4270: Exposed Chapter 4270: Exposed","Editor: Henyee Translations Boomâ€¦ Boomâ€¦ An explosion that shook the ground came from the bomb shelter.","The entire underground structure was destroyed.","Sand and rocks flew from the empty bomb shelter.","The flames were like earth fire that spewed out from the ground.","They were red and fierce.","They instantly devoured the illegal militants who had turned to corpses.","Li Jinnian, who was the last, could clearly feel a heat wave pushing out from behind him like a train.","At that moment, Li Jinnian pounced and left the exit.","The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade were already crawling on the ground.","The moment Ye Jian and Sea Anemone heard the explosion, they pounced over to cover Commissioner Miao and the rest.","Mortars were extremely lethal.","If they were still in the bomb shelter, they would’ve definitely been injured even if they were in the ten-meter tunnel.","After the explosion, there was a loud sound of the bomb shelter collapsing.","Ye Jian helped Commissioner Miao up and said in a low voice, “Teacher, let’s go!” Commissioner Miao finally opened his mouth.","“Okay!","Thank you for your hard work.” “Don’t say that.","It’s what we should do.” Ye Jian supported Commissioner Miao tightly and retreated quickly.","A student beside her whispered to Ye Jian, “Junior, the teacher’s leg was injured by a stray bullet.","It hasn’t been treated.” Juniorâ€¦ A familiar voice was heard.","Ye Jian knew that her senior had recognized her.","“Teacher, I’m sorry.","We can’t treat your wound now.","WE need to leave the train station,” said Ye Jian guiltily.","She asked the injured teacher to shift his point of gravity toward her.","“I need you to bear with it.” “Teacher, I’m sorry.","I can’t treat your wound now.","I need to leave the train station,” said Ye Jian guiltily.","She asked the injured teacher to shift the gravity to her.","“I need you to bear with it.” “It’s alright.","I’ll listen to your arrangements.” Commissioner Miao endured the pain and didn’t say anything.","He was still able to smile.","He was calm and indifferent.","Ever since he was kidnapped, he had maintained a good mentality.","He wasn’t afraid at all.","Sea Anemone squatted in front of Commissioner Miao and whispered, “Let me carry you.” Without giving Commissioner Miao a chance to reject, Ye Jian quickly replied, “Okay!” Commissioner Miao didn’t have a chance to reject, so he let Sea Anemone carry him and retreated quickly.","His pants were already stained with blood.","The originally soft fabric had become very hard.","The fabric around the wound stuck close to it, acting like a hemostatic gauze.","Commissioner Miao wasn’t the only one who was injured.","Ye Jian’s arm was also injured by a stray bullet.","Two of her comrades were also slightly injured.","To them, these were minor injuries.","There was no need to stop and treat their wounds.","The most important thing now was to hurry up and evacuate.","The government forces and illegal militants were still exchanging fire, which undoubtedly gave them the advantage to retreat.","Now, they would go directly to the Chinese peacekeeping camp in Yeni.","The evacuation wasn’t smooth either.","Just coming out of the train station was difficult Alva didn’t know if he had killed the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers or not.","After firing a mortar, he mobilized his forces to search.","However, his forces were limited, so they couldn’t concentrate on searching.","After passing through one ruin after another and avoiding one crossfire point after another, the special forces soldiers finally withdrew from the train station after two hours.","While treating his wound, Demon King Li Jinnian received a satellite call from the peacekeeping camp.","The security in the camp had been upgraded, and they were preparing for battle."]},{"number":4271,"title":"Chapter 4271 Special","paragraphs":["Chapter 4271: Special","Chapter 4271: Special","Editor: Henyee Translations","The squadron leader of the Chinese peacekeeping camp was silent for a long time.","Perhaps he realized that the captain of the special forces, who was quieter than him, wouldn’t take the initiative to speak.","He struggled in his heart for a long time and broke the silence between them.","He said in a low voice, “There’s a batch of special materials in the camp and a specialist in electromagnetic weapons research.","We need your help to bring the special materials and the specialist out of Yeni.","“Also, we suspect that there are abnormal changes among the high-ranking officials of the Libyan government.","The traitor, Alva, is an example.","We have to be wary.”","There had to be a reason why the two electromagnetic weapons researchers came all the way to a war-torn country.","Li Jinnian didn’t know this reason.","But now, Li Jinnian roughly knew the reason.","It might have something to do with the special materials stored in the peacekeeping camp.","Li Jinnian didn’t hesitate and replied to the squadron leader calmly, “Okay, we’re still 24 kilometers away from the camp.","Based on the current advancement time, it’ll take two hours to cover 24 kilometers.”","“Okay!","We’ll wait for you to come over!” The squadron leader heaved a sigh of relief.","It was already beyond his expectations to ask for reinforcements from the brother company.","There was only one mission for the brother company! to rescue Commissioner Miao and the others who were kidnapped.","Now, the brother company had successfully rescued Commissioner Miao and the rest.","It was equivalent to completing half of their mission.","When they were transferred to a safe area, the brother company’s mission would be completed.","Now that he mentioned that he needed the brother company to help transport a batch of special materials, it was actually an additional heavy responsibility for the company.","However, he had no other choice.","The engineering team was attacked by the NPFL militants.","The workers risked their lives to escort this batch of special materials over.","The electromagnetic commissioner who accompanied them had clearly told the squadron leader the importance of this batch of special materials.","Even though he knew very well that he was giving the brother company a heavy responsibility, he had to do it for the sake of the future research of electromagnetic weapons.","There was no need for him to say it too clearly.","As soldiers who fought bravely for the strength of their country, the other party would definitely understand what he was doing.","Li Jinnian naturally understood, so he agreed without any hesitation.","After cutting off the call with the squadron leader, Li Jinnian walked to Big Shark, who was treating his wound.","He spoke in a low voice.","The water ghosts beside him couldn’t hear him clearly.","“Let’s see how many there are.","If there are more, we have to think of a way to get heavy weapons to protect the driver.","There aren’t many heavy weapons in the camp.","If not, they wouldn’t have asked us for reinforcements.” After Big Shark heard this, he said with a serious expression, “These special materials must be escorted back to the country!”","“I’ll ask Commissioner Miao.","He should know.”","Big Shark was about to get up when Li Jinnian placed his hand on his shoulder.","“I’ll go ask.","Treat your wound first.”","They were now hiding in a flour warehouse.","Their location was quite hidden.","There was only one entrance.","Once the iron door was closed, it completely isolated the faint morning light.","It was so tight that! it was a little suffocating.","The warehouse was huge.","As long as they didn’t stay in the warehouse for a long time, they wouldn’t lack oxygen.","After entering the warehouse, four of them stood guard outside.","The rest of them immediately treated the wounds on their bodies.","Ye Jian was treating Commissioner Miao’s wound.","The people who were helping to shine a light on her were all people who knew her.","One was her senior while the other was! Yang Heng, who was still in shock.","His gaze was still on Ye Jian."]},{"number":4272,"title":"Chapter 4272 Frightened","paragraphs":["Chapter 4272: Frightened","Chapter 4272: Frightened","Editor: Henyee Translations","Yang Heng didn’t recognize Ye Jian until they entered the temporary hiding spot.","After coming out of the bomb shelter, Yang Heng retreated with Big Prawn.","He didn’t retreat with Ye Jian.","During the retreat, they didn’t meet each other either.","When they entered the warehouse, Li Jinnian instructed Ye Jian to treat Commissioner Miao’s wound.","Ye Jian then replied, “Yes.” Yang Heng was immediately dumbfounded.","He heard a voice that was most unlikely to appear here, but it did.","When the place was lit up, Yang Heng immediately looked for the owner of the voice.","Then, he saw Ye Jian looking at him with a smile on her face.","He didn’t hear wrongly and wasn’t mistaken.","It was Ye Jian.","She was the most unlikely person to appear here.","He never thought that he would meet her in Libya.","She was standing in front of him with a smile.","She even! winked at him playfully.","At that moment, Yang Heng was so shocked that he stood still like a wooden doll.","Until now! he was still in shock.","Why was Ye Jian here?","Why did she come with this group of special forces soldiers to save him?","Why was she so familiar with this group of powerful special forces soldiers?","They could understand each other with just a look and a gesture.","How did she know them?","Was she a special forces soldier too?","But she was still a student in the military school.","How did she become a special forces soldier?","Why was she sent to Libya to carry out such a dangerous rescue mission instead of completing her homework?","Why?","Why?","Why?","Holding the flashlight in his hand, Yang Heng had hundreds of thousands of questions about Ye Jian.","Why, why! Why couldn’t he figure out the crux of the matter?","“There’s shrapnel embedded.","We need to take the shrapnel out and suture the wound.”","Before the fabric that was stuck to the wound was completely peeled off, Ye Jian could already see a piece of shrapnel with a sharp edge.","This was the shrapnel of a grenade.","The incision was like a knife, deeply stabbing into Commissioner Miao’s calf.","Fortunately, it was stabbed into the flesh and not into the calf bone.","They just needed to take out the shrapnel, disinfect the wound, and suture it.","Her cold and calm voice pulled Yang Heng’s chaotic thoughts back.","When he realized what Ye Jian said just now, Yang Heng immediately asked, “Is it serious?”","His voice was still extremely hoarse, and his throat was hurting.","“Fortunately, it’s not a serious injury.”","Ye Jian replied in a low voice.","The dagger in her hand slowly and lightly slashed past Commissioner Miao’s trousers that had hardened from the layers of dried blood.","The wound was a little big.","When the cloth was peeled off, blood flowed out again.","Because the cloth was stuck to the wound, Commissioner Miao couldn’t help but gasp in pain.","The wound was torn open again.","It was like a piece of flesh was being torn apart.","Ye Jian raised her head and looked at Commissioner Miao gently.","She said softly, “Teacher, you can bite your sleeve to help you bear with the pain.”","Commissioner Miao, who was in his early 40s, had a rare local anesthesia allergy.","Hence, he couldn’t get an anesthetic shot at all.","He could only endure it and let cold sweat bead his forehead.","Despite how painful it was, the elegant teacher smiled and looked at the female student encouragingly.","“Continue.","Don’t worry about me.”","When the senior doctor called Ye Jian ‘Junior’ in the bomb shelter tunnel, Commissioner Miao knew that Ye Jian was a student of the National Science University."]},{"number":4273,"title":"Chapter 4273: Careful","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t want to hide her identity anymore. Hence, when she entered the warehouse, she smiled at Yang Heng. There were two familiar people beside her. Now, with the addition of the senior doctor, Ye Jian accepted it calmly.","Commissioner Miao wasn’t as shocked as Yang Heng and the rest. The National Science University was a military school where talents gathered. There were many top talents among them. For instance, the female student who was treating his wound now was one of the top talents.","He wasn’t surprised that a female student from his school would appear here. What was surprising was that... this female student turned out to be a special forces female soldier.","Ye Jian had already removed all the fabric covering the wound. As the wound wasn’t treated in time, the area around the wound was red and swollen. Black shrapnel stabbed into the flesh, and the surrounding skin tissue was red. It looked quite scary.","The senior doctor’s surname was ’Zhao’. When he saw that his mentor’s injuries were so serious, even his lips turned pale.","No wonder the teacher didn’t want the three of them to check on his wound. He only used the towel he brought with him to wipe his sweat to stop the bleeding. As it turned out... his injury was so serious.","Yang Heng asked Ye Jian in a low voice, \"Are you going to take out the shrapnel now?\"","Actually, he wanted to ask Ye Jian if she had the confidence to take out the shrapnel. When he was about to say it, he remembered that Ye Jian’s abilities had always been unexpected. Yang Heng didn’t dare to ask Ye Jian if she was confident anymore.","Once Ye Jian set her mind to do something, it meant she was absolutely sure of herself.","She might really be able to deal with this injury that required a doctor’s treatment.","\"Disinfect the wound first and clean the area around it. It’ll hurt. Seniors, help me hold down the teacher’s calf,\" Ye Jian said the last sentence to her two seniors who were waiting nervously. She didn’t help them at all. She stood beside Commissioner Miao and stared at him intently, afraid that something would happen to the teacher.","Hearing this, the two of them immediately nodded. One of the PhD seniors asked, \"What should we do? You can give us your orders.\"","At this moment, they could only listen to their junior’s arrangements. They would do whatever she said.","\"Press on the teacher’s knee and let the teacher bite this piece of gauze.\" Ye Jian opened the two sanitary bags that she brought with her to the battlefield. There were needles, tweezers, and disinfectant inside. She passed the gauze to a senior and put on her mask. She said to Commissioner Miao, \"Teacher, I’ll start now. The shrapnel is a little big. There’s some fine sand around it as well. I’ll use cotton to clean the sand first before taking out the shrapnel. It’ll take at least 15 minutes to disinfect and suture the wound.\"","Commissioner Miao smiled and nodded. \"I won’t bite the gauze. Don’t worry about me. It’s not safe here. I can’t implicate all of you because of me. 15 minutes is too long. Just give me a simple treatment. I’ll get myself properly treated once we reach the camp.\"","The senior doctor, who was holding the gauze in his hand, frowned and disagreed. \"It’s fine if you don’t bite the gauze, but you want to drag out your treatment till you’re back at the camp? No, your wound is already inflamed.\"","\"Teacher, don’t force yourself. Your pants are already drenched with blood.\"","\"15 minutes. If you can endure it for 15 minutes, Ye Jian will definitely be sure to treat you.\"","The three seniors took turns persuading Ye Jian. Ye Jian had already made all the preparations.","Ye Jian said, \"No, your wound is already inflamed. You’ve been injured for about eight hours. You have to treat it immediately.\""]},{"number":4274,"title":"Chapter 4274: Process","paragraphs":["Ye Jian put on white surgical gloves for herself. She was wearing a mask, which only revealed her dark, cold, and calm eyes. \"Our men are on guard outside. Don’t worry. This place is hidden and not a crossfire zone. We’re very safe now.\"","Li Jinnian, who was standing not far behind Ye Jian, strode over and said politely to Commissioner Miao, \"We’re very safe now. It won’t be too late to leave after your wound is treated. There won’t be a problem.\"","Commissioner Miao only felt more at ease after hearing what the captain said.","As she spoke, Ye Jian had already started to clean Commissioner Miao’s wound. There was no anesthesia, so he could only bear with it. The wound tissue was still trembling from the stimulation. Ye Jian, who had a focused facial expression, said, \"You’ve been in Libya for a while, right? Will you go back to the country to recuperate after getting injured this time? The medical conditions in Libya are average. It’s best to go back to the country to recuperate.\"","Commissioner Miao, who wasn’t biting gauze, smiled. \"I’m not that delicate. It’s just a small injury. I don’t need to return to the country to recuperate. You’re making a mountain out of a molehill. It wasn’t easy for me to come here. I need to stay longer.\"","It was too painful to get his wound cleaned. Commissioner Miao’s voice was trembling.","Ye Jian, who was looking down, smiled too. Her smile was blocked by the mask. One could only see her bright facial expression. Under the pure white light, the smile on her face was like a blooming pear blossom. It contained a serene sense of beauty.","\"If you still want to stay, I’ll have to be more meticulous. I’ll clean your wound in one go. After you return to the camp, you’ll just need to bandage it again.\"","Yang Heng, who was quietly holding a flashlight, looked at Ye Jian, who kept talking. A hint of contemplation flashed past his eyes.","Ye Jian reached out her hand. Li Jinnian, who was watching over her, passed a pair of tweezers to Ye Jian. He was also wearing white surgical gloves. The difference was that his gloves were very clean. Ye Jian’s gloves were already stained with blood.","\"You’re so confident. Did you study medicine part-time? It looks like...\" It seemed that before he could finish his sentence, Commissioner Miao’s entire body stiffened. Then, the green blood vessels on his forehead and neck popped out due to the pain.","Ye Jian had already taken out the shrapnel...","Be it stopping the bleeding or disinfecting the wound, Ye Jian’s actions were fast and orderly. Li Jinnian cooperated the entire time. As long as Ye Jian said the name of the supplies, he would hand them over immediately. The tacit cooperation between the two of them shortened the time.","After the last suture, Ye Jian started to bandage the wound with gauze. At this moment, Commissioner Miao’s face was pale. Ye Jian looked up and said in a calm and gentle voice, \"Teacher, it’s done. Do you want to check it out?\"","There was a hint of playful teasing.","Commissioner Miao, whose lips were still trembling from the pain, couldn’t help but laugh. \"No wonder you kept talking to me. I was wondering why you were talking so much just now. It turns out that you were trying to distract me. Not bad, it was a success. It reduced the pain.\"","\"You’re right. It’ll be over in another two minutes.\" Ye Jian took off her mask. Her forehead was covered in sweat. Under the strong light, her eyes appeared bright and her teeth white. Her face was beautiful. When she smiled, she had an unparalleled beauty. The seniors couldn’t help but take a few more glances at her.","Li Jinnian saw that there was sweat on her forehead, so he took a piece of gauze to wipe Ye Jian’s sweat. His actions were gentle, and his facial expression was focused. Yang Heng couldn’t help but narrow his eyes.","Their relationship seemed... unusual."]},{"number":4275,"title":"Chapter 4275: Disobedient","paragraphs":["Yang Heng recovered from his shock. When he met Ye Jian, he was still in senior high. Now that he had graduated from university and became an interpreter in the military unit, he thought that he understood Ye Jian. After all, they had worked together in senior high so that Yao Jing wouldn’t cause trouble. They also fought in the same trench. Who knew that... his understanding of her was only the tip of the iceberg?","He would never know what kind of person Ye Jian was. He would never know how many secrets the Ye Jian he knew had.","There were definitely many secrets about her that no one knew about. Just like in senior high, when she stood in front of the school’s grocery store. She could have walked into the light with just one more step, but she insisted on standing in the dark where the light couldn’t reach. Her eyes were indifferent as she looked ahead. She seemed to have many secrets, and she seemed out of place.","There were definitely many secrets about her that no one knew about. Just like in senior high, when she stood in front of the school’s grocery store. She could have walked into the light with just one more step, but she insisted on standing in the dark where the light couldn’t reach. Her black and white eyes were indifferent as she looked ahead. There seemed to be many secrets, and she seemed out of place.","The male soldier who was wiping her sweat right now, their relationship was definitely not simple. One look and one could tell that their relationship was extraordinary.","Boyfriend?","The man was very handsome, but his temperament was a little cold.","Ye Jian had a cold temperament too. She was distant from the outside world. This handsome soldier was even more so. His coldness made people not dare to look at him.","Even his voice was cold. Yang Heng didn’t know how the two of them interacted.","While Yang Heng was thinking, Ye Jian had already bandaged the teacher’s wound.","Commissioner Miao, who was in so much pain that his back was drenched in sweat, heaved a long sigh of relief. His three students supported him as he leaned against the wall. He lowered his head and looked at his calf that had been treated. He saw that the white bandage had a beautiful bow tie tied around it. The pain hadn’t subsided. He laughed and said, \"Student, you’re being sneaky. You even tied such a beautiful bowtie. Do you want more people to see me this way?\"","Ye Jian was quite satisfied. \"Beautiful things make people happy. You’re smiling now because you’re happy, right?\"","\"You’re a little philosophical. Not bad.\" Commissioner Miao nodded in agreement. He sized up the female student from the National Science University carefully. Only now did he see clearly what this female student looked like. She was quite heroic in combat and could completely follow the rhythm of the male special forces soldiers.","Although her face was covered with paint, Commissioner Miao found her facial features a little familiar. Such an outstanding female student from the special forces... He must have seen her at the National Science University.","Commissioner Miao had seen Ye Jian before. However, he hadn’t seen her in person. He had just seen a photo of her. That was why he found her familiar.","After resting for a while, the pain in his calf finally dissipated. Commissioner Miao, who had a good mentality, smiled and sighed. \"I’m getting old. My body isn’t as tolerant of pain as when I was young. When I was young, even when a knife slashed my body, I could still joke with the doctor. But now, I tremble in pain just because of shrapnel.\"","The 43-year-old Commissioner Miao wasn’t a rigid teacher. He was scholarly, interesting, and well-liked by his students. He only sat up for a few seconds before teasing himself. He even reminded the three students beside him, \"Remember this. When you go back, don’t spread the news that I was in a sorry state today. It’ll damage my image as a teacher.","\"If I hear any rumors when I go back, I’ll attack the three of you directly.\""]},{"number":4276,"title":"Chapter 4276: So Precious","paragraphs":["Commissioner Miao then looked at Ye Jian. The smile in his eyes got deeper. \"You too. Although you’re not my student, I know who you are.\"","Actually, he was indirectly reminding the students not to tell anyone about his injury as he didn’t want to let his colleagues and students worry.","As for who Ye Jian was, he still wasn’t able to place her in his memory.","The three seniors knew who Ye Jian was. Hearing that, they couldn’t help but lower their heads and smile. Yang Heng lowered his head and smiled too.","The teachers of the National Science University were not rigid. The other teachers were the same. They were all very interesting.","Ye Jian, who was packing the sanitary bag, smiled. Her eyes lit up, and her expression seemed to be as bright as crystals. \"I’ll definitely keep my mouth shut and not reveal that you said something very rude when you were in the most pain today.\"","\"Student, why does it sound like you’re threatening me? This is the first time I’ve been threatened by a student. It’s quite rare.\" Although Commissioner Miao’s face was still pale from the pain, he was in good spirits. His laughter was sonorous, making the three students beside him heave a sigh of relief.","As he laughed, Commissioner Miao looked at the young soldier who was the backbone of the entire team. \"Captain, thank you for your hard work. I’m fine now. Can we set off?\"","Li Jinnian packed Ye Jian’s sanitary bag. Hearing that, he looked up and said politely, \"You’re welcome. I have something to confirm with you.\"","\"Please speak!\"","At the mention of serious matters, the smile on Commissioner Miao’s face disappeared, and his facial expression turned serious.","Li Jinnian brought up the special materials that had to be transported out. Commissioner Miao pondered for a while before replying, \"The amount isn’t much. Our technology isn’t mature yet, and the refining speed is a little slow. It’s probably less than 50 kilograms.","\"That 50 kilograms took us more than two months. It’ll determine the success or failure of the project. We have to bring these 50 kilograms of materials back to the country!\"","How special were the materials?","Commissioner Miao knew, and so did the three seniors.","So far, only three countries needed these materials. These materials were mainly used for ground-based charged particle beam weapons and space-based neutral particle beam weapons. The former was used to protect strategic missile bases and other important targets. The latter was set up on spacecraft to intercept aerial missiles.","These were all secret research that couldn’t be told to outsiders. The materials used were all summarized as ’special materials’. Only the researchers who joined the laboratory knew about them.","Ye Jian could tell the importance of these materials. They were so important... They couldn’t just put them in the car, right? What if they had to abandon the car again?","Wouldn’t such precious special materials be discarded along with the car?","She pursed her lips and looked at Li Jinnian. She asked softly, \"Can we carry the materials with us? Will there be radiation?\" She had been in the laboratory before and knew that many special materials had radiation, especially those extremely rare ones that only a few countries had.","\"Yes, but we’ve used special treatment on them. So... we can carry the materials with us. At that time, we were guarding against the security here and made preparations in advance.\"","Commissioner Miao said in a low voice, \"We must bring them back to the country. According to our plan, this batch of special materials will be sent back to the country immediately by a private plane. It’s very unsafe to leave them in the camp now.\"","\"We’ll bring them with us. The materials are still here,\" Li Jinnian replied calmly. Although his cold voice was soft, his words were heavy."]},{"number":4277,"title":"Chapter 4277: Command","paragraphs":["The sun was shining brightly outside, and the warehouse was pitch-black.","The city map was laid out on the ground. Li Jinnian held the flashlight in his hand and slid his slender fingers across the map. His cold voice entered the ears of the team members.","\"Our position is here, and the peacekeeping camp is this way. The straight line distance is 16 kilometers, and the detour is 24 kilometers. Now that the peacekeeping camp has entered red alert, there’s a possibility of a battle at any time. I plan to walk in a straight line and pass through this crossfire point at a close distance!\"","The importance of the special materials made Li Jinnian realize that he had to race against time. The materials that were less than 50 kilograms were the key to the progress of the entire project. Once the materials were gone, the entire project would stagnate. The consequences of stagnating would be the lagging of the country’s weapons. The consequences would directly affect the strength of the country. Hence, he had to race against time.","The distance of 24 kilometers soon became 16 kilometers. Then, it became eight kilometers. The time they took to traverse also shortened.","Ye Jian’s gaze stopped at the crossfire point. After taking a look, she said to the communication soldier, Big Prawn, \"Show me the satellite map. I think I passed by this place last night.\"","Last night, she took a ride over. Hiding in the chassis, she saw a road sign lying on the ground. When the headlights of the car behind swept past, she could vaguely see the street name on the road sign. She needed to confirm it again.","The military laptop showed the satellite map of Yeni. This was the satellite map before the war. After the war, the area was filled with devastation. It was hard to tell where it was.","Big Prawn quickly found the location they would pass through later. Ye Jian leaned closer to take a look. There was a smile in her black eyes that reflected the flames of war.","\"We can go over here. It’s very safe.\" She placed the laptop in the middle and zoomed in on the exact location of the map. \"Although this street was bombed and it’s very close to the crossfire point, this place...\"","Her slender fingers pointed at a pre-war building. \"This place has been directly blown up by artillery shells. We can pass through the entire building. The exchange of fire will be on our left. Using the wall of the building as a cover, we can directly pass through to Saya Street. If the route through the building is destroyed, we can retreat immediately and then...\"","Her slender and fair finger pointed at the street not far from the building. \"We can still retreat from here and here. We can also avoid the crossfire and choose many routes.\"","\"If we pass through Saya Street, we’ll reach the park. Behind the park is the suburbs of Yeni. It’s not far from our camp. More importantly, the illegal militants have surrounded our camp. If necessary, we can kill our way through them and clear a bloody path. We can also get the soldiers in the camp to send the materials out. We can then leave immediately.","\"The timing has to be seamless. That way, we can leave after the battle. Of course, if the situation at camp is urgent, we can continue to stay until they retreat.\"","Ye Jian was a commander. Her arrangements were based on the big picture. She would take different things into consideration to achieve an all-round combat plan. With a precedent, there would be a process. She would consider the mobilization during the entire process, then consider the results and follow-up.","As she spoke, Li Jinnian looked at the satellite map and combined it with the military map. He went through it in his mind and nodded. \"Okay, we’ll evacuate according to your route.\""]},{"number":4278,"title":"Chapter 4278: Enlightenment","paragraphs":["The members of the Storm Commando Brigade nodded. They didn’t raise any objections to Azure Bird’s plan and didn’t express any doubts the entire time. This stunned Yang Heng again.","That was because he realized that... Ye Jian’s words had a lot of weight in this group of special forces soldiers. From their eyes, he could see their respect for Ye Jian.","That meant that Ye Jian had cooperated with them many times. Her ability was so outstanding that the special forces soldiers admired her.","Instantly, Yang Heng had the illusion that the Ye Jian he knew and the Ye Jian in front of him were two different people.","He thought that the Ye Jian he knew was powerful enough. Now, he realized that as it turned out, the Ye Jian he knew was not as powerful as the Ye Jian who was in front of him now!","He needed to get to know Ye Jian again. His understanding of her was not even the tip of the iceberg!","Yang Heng couldn’t help but think of his cousin, Song Zhiqiu. When he went back to the National Science University, he had chatted with his cousin as they walked around the campus. He mentioned Ye Jian and said something that touched him deeply.","When Yang Heng asked his cousin how he was getting along with Ye Jian, he replied, \"She’s a good role model who works hard. Knowing that we have such a powerful peer who works so hard, we’ll feel that it’s shameful to waste our time. We’ll feel guilty even if we waste a second.\"","Under Ye Jian’s influence, none of the 45 students in their class relaxed for a moment. When it was time to play, they would play appropriately. However, their studies and training would not be delayed.","The power of a role model could subdue a boy as proud as Yang Heng’s cousin. Yang Heng’s understanding of Ye Jian... was indeed not even the tip of the iceberg.","Although his understanding of her hadn’t even reached that extent, he was already shocked enough.","Unknowingly, Ye Jian was walking further and higher. The people she interacted with were far beyond her peers.","Yang Heng even dared to say that none of her classmates in junior high or senior high had her current achievements.","In less than three to four years, Ye Jian had already far surpassed her classmates who had the same starting point as her. In that case, how high would she stand in the future?","As he thought about this, Yang Heng’s expression turned serious.","He had neglected himself when he was comparing other people to Ye Jian!","To put it nicely, he was a returnee who had returned from studying abroad. In fact, it was because his family felt that he was still young and could train in the military unit. It was also to help him learn self-discipline. That way, he could become a suitable candidate to start a business.","Now, he needed to plan his path well. Otherwise, the gap between him and Ye Jian would get wider and wider. Even the gap between him and his cousin would get wider.","No wonder his family said that his cousin seemed to have been reborn ever since he entered the military school. Now, he finally knew why.","He had been influenced by Ye Jian.","In just a few minutes, Yang Heng seemed to have been enlightened. In an instant, the haze in his mind was cleared. Even his gaze changed.","Yang Heng was shocked. The PhD senior who knew Ye Jian was also shocked. She was able to lead a group of male special forces soldiers to fight. ’Junior Ye Jian, you must not know that your classmates are so powerful!","’Your instructor definitely doesn’t know about it either!","’And neither does your captain!","’The higher-ups definitely don’t know either!’","The senior pushed his glasses and felt secretly happy.","He wasn’t enlightened like Yang Heng. They were in different fields, and their direction of development was different too. He had a clear plan for his future. He wasn’t like Yang Heng who was a little vague about his future plan. Hence, he wasn’t as affected. He just felt honored."]},{"number":4279,"title":"Chapter 4279: Lasting","paragraphs":["Commissioner Miao was gratified to see the outstanding performance of the female student.","Not bad, not bad. She was a good seedling in military combat. Although he didn’t understand these combat commands, to be able to gain the recognition of the captain of the special forces unit meant that she was really impressive!","Technical powerhouses and strong soldiers equated to strong countries. He saw the future in this group of young people. He saw the strong soldiers of their country that would only get stronger in the future. Young people of this era should not think that they were already living a good life. They should not think that they were already living a good life and not strive to achieve anything.","Since they were here, they had to leave something for this world. They shouldn’t live recklessly.","Ye Jian didn’t know what was going on in the minds of Commissioner Miao, Yang Heng, and the other seniors. Once the retreat route was set, they immediately left the warehouse.","The people who were rescued were protected by five team members. Ye Jian would cover Yang Heng, Commissioner Miao would be covered by Big Shark, and the other three seniors would be protected by Big Eel, Big Whale, and Big Squid.","This time, even Commissioner Miao had a gun in his hand. It wasn’t a rifle but a pistol. He could use it to protect himself in times of danger.","Of course, the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade didn’t want that to happen.","\"Retreat!\"","With Demon King Li’s order, three soldiers took over the positions of the four sentinels outside and started to cover the retreat. In the middle was Ye Jian and the other five. The water ghost who retreated last cleaned up the traces left behind during the retreat. When he left, it was as if no one had ever come to the warehouse.","When they came out of the warehouse and looked at the horizon, they could see the grayish-green smoke rising in the sky above the city. The artillery fire and gunshots were still there. They started at four in the morning, and they still hadn’t stopped at 7:30 am.","The water ghosts didn’t have the time to care about the situation on both sides. Although they were half an hour ahead of the original plan, no one dared to let down their guard. They observed and listened to their surroundings. All their muscles were in a combat state. They bathed in the sunlight and started to pass through the smoke.","In the day, Yeni was much more dangerous than at night. After passing through the ruins of the city that had been ravaged by the prolonged war, they felt that there was a gun aimed at them at a place where the sunlight couldn’t reach.","Danger, darkness, and sorrow... This was Yeni during the day.","On the heavily damaged street, illegal militants drove past in tanks. Hiding in a corner of the abandoned wall where the smell of gunpowder could still be detected, the soldiers stared vigilantly at the several tanks that drove past them. It was not until they could no longer feel the vibrations of the tank chains on the ground that the hiding water ghosts slowly walked out.","\"Let’s go!\"","With that shout, countless figures rushed out of the ruins on the street and continued to evacuate. They couldn’t pass through the streets directly because this was still the territory occupied by illegal militants. There were even illegal militants stationed outside to resist the government forces. They couldn’t show their faces, so they could only pass through the ruins carefully.","Yang Heng followed Ye Jian closely. He would do whatever she did. He would never mess around. At this moment, he would listen to Ye Jian’s arrangements.","As they got closer and closer to the crossfire point, the intense gunshots became clearer and clearer. Yang Heng couldn’t help but tighten his grip on the rifle in his hand. He was the only one among the five who was holding a rifle.","\"Don’t be afraid. Follow me.\"","A cold and calm voice was heard. These few words had already exposed the uneasiness in his heart. He looked up and saw Ye Jian, who had been protecting him. She was arching her back slightly and protecting him behind her like a shield. Her back was slender, but it made him feel at ease."]},{"number":4280,"title":"Chapter 4280: The Hardest","paragraphs":["Feeling a little embarrassed, Yang Heng couldn’t help but reply, \"I’m not afraid. I’m just a little nervous.\"","He replied in a low voice, trying to sound relaxed.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. She didn’t expose him.","The scout, Sea Anemone, relayed a message. His voice was a little excited. \"Demon King Li, we can pass!\"","When the news came, everyone’s spirits were lifted.","\"Follow them!\"","\"Follow them!\"","\"Alert the rear!\"","\"Okay. Assault team, get ready. Retreat!\"","Through the earpieces, the members communicated in low voices. The Storm Commando Brigade’s water ghosts, who had gone overseas for their first overseas combat, passed through the battlefield and headed toward the peacekeeping camp.","The artillery fire on the left was extremely intense. No one knew which side shot out a cannonball, but the explosion shook Ye Jian and the rest. They had already entered the place where the illegal militants were most concentrated.","The first to enter were the two scouts, Sea Anemone and Seaweed. Now, they were hiding in the building that they were about to pass through. They were waiting for everyone to go over.","The illegal militants on the dilapidated street stared straight ahead. As long as there were government forces in front of them, they would shoot immediately until no one dared to approach.","The water ghosts moved through the buildings bit by bit. They passed under the eyes of the other party. The entire process was very slow. One moment, they were hiding, and the next moment, they were moving stealthily. When they arrived at the designated building, everyone, including Ye Jian and Li Jinnian, was sweating profusely.","This was the rear camp of the illegal militants. The militants were guarding the front, so they paid little attention to the rear. That was why the soldiers were given a chance to slowly sneak through. The rear was guarded by the rebel general, Alva. No wonder these people were at ease.","At this moment, they held their breaths and exhaled softly. Then, they slowly took a deep breath. The smoke in the air entered their lungs. They had to endure it no matter how choked they were.","\"Step on my shoulder and climb over!\" Ye Jian placed one hand on the wall and bent her back. She said to Yang Heng beside her, \"Hurry up and go over!\"","They avoided the illegal militants who could start a war with the government forces at any time and chose to move forward in the ruins. Now, they were in a building and needed to climb over broken walls. The water ghosts and Ye Jian could climb over it easily, but Yang Heng, Commissioner Miao, and the other two seniors couldn’t.","Yang Heng didn’t have a choice. He gritted his teeth and finally took a step forward. He didn’t have a choice. Time didn’t allow him to choose either. He could only step on Ye Jian’s shoulders and climb up.","Just as Yang Heng climbed up the wall and was about to jump down, someone grabbed his leg. He fell down from the broken wall that was around six to seven meters tall.","He bit his tongue to prevent himself from making a sound.","At this moment, Ye Jian had already hidden.","Big Eel, who was guarding the surroundings, reminded Ye Jian that there was someone. The water ghosts who hadn’t gone over quickly hid. Ye Jian crawled and listened to the footsteps. Even the sound of her heartbeat seemed to soften.","This time, the commotion was a little loud. Big Eel, who was in charge of guarding, cursed in a low voice. He probably had something else to say, but he suddenly stopped and cleared his throat before saying, \"A few guys have come in. We need them to kill them. Azure Bird, the people around you have passed by. We have to go over and deal with them. They’re coming your way.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Big Eel’s voice suddenly became tense. \"Damn it, they’re preparing to lay mines. The government forces are probably going to attack here.\"","After he finished speaking, Sea Anemone, who was on guard in front, said sternly, \"Damn it, speed up and retreat! The government forces are moving about a kilometer away from us! I’m afraid this is their next crossfire point!\""]},{"number":4281,"title":"Chapter 4281: No Regrets","paragraphs":["This wasn’t a joke!","Ye Jian couldn’t wait anymore. She pressed her earpiece and said softly with a vicious look in her eyes, \"Big Eel, be my eyes! I’ll get rid of the guys laying mines.\"","\"There are five of them in total! Damn it! You can’t handle them alone! Demon King Li! Support Azure Bird! I’ll be your eyes!\"","Commissioner Miao was the first to climb over the wall. Yang Heng was second. There were still three PhD seniors who hadn’t gone over. The water ghosts protecting the three of them couldn’t leave, so Demon King Li, who was in charge of bringing up the rear, would have to take over.","After Big Eel finished speaking, Li Jinnian moved and quickly approached Ye Jian.","\"Azure Bird, left, four o’clock... Get ready.\"","\"Demon King Li, right side, nine o’clock... Prepare.\"","\"Damn it, they probably want to blow this place up! They want to cut off the entrance of the government forces!\"","Once the entrance that was currently occupied by the government forces was blown up, not only would they have to take a detour, but they would also be in a crossfire and lose their lives at any time.","Before the mission, they were already prepared to be sacrificed. As soldiers, they were always entering the mouth of a tiger, so they would have no regrets if they died.","But Commissioner Miao and the rest couldn’t die!","They had to protect Commissioner Miao and the rest!","Yang Heng had already realized that something was wrong. He wanted to ask the special forces soldier beside him if something had happened, but the other party said, \"Interpreter, no matter what happens later, you must be with Commissioner Miao. We’re going out now. Take care of Commissioner Miao.","\"Although you’re an admin officer, I believe that you can definitely do it. It’s like when you first came out to face the illegal militants.\"","Big Shark said in a low voice. His arm muscles were tense because of the sudden incident. Even the lines on his face were as sharp as knives.","Yang Heng pursed his lips. Then, he nodded heavily. \"Definitely!\"","He was a civilian but also a soldier. Before he came to Libya, he told the political commissar that he wouldn’t regret coming here!","He didn’t regret coming. If he really died, he would be a martyr!","A wisp of his heroic soul would also exist on the monument!","Ye Jian had already moved. She crouched down and went out. Before the other party could get close, she rushed out like a cannonball. The sound of gunfire not far away covered the sound she made. The illegal militant had yet to start laying the mines. Ye Jian raised her combat dagger and slashed down.","\"Pfft...\"","Blood spurted out like rain and splattered on the grayish-white gravel. Blood splattered everywhere, and it was dark red.","After taking him down and dragging him away, Li Jinnian cleared a target at the same speed.","There were three more!","The government forces were getting closer and closer. Beads of sweat dripped down Sea Anemone’s face. \"Brothers, count the number of people who can pass now!\"","\"Seaweed, come and fetch Commissioner Miao and the interpreter. I’ll send them over now,\" Big Shark replied. He brought Commissioner Miao and Yang Heng over. If something really happened, he would definitely stay and fight alongside the captain, Demon King Li.","The two scouts immediately understood what Big Shark wanted to do. It was prohibited to lay mines internationally to prevent civilians from getting hurt. However, so far, more than ten countries hadn’t signed this agreement. Libya had actually signed the agreement. The illegal militants weren’t abiding by the rules.","The Chinese peacekeeping forces were also responsible for demining, especially in the places where the illegal militants were laying mines. They had to demine the area countless times to confirm that there were no problems.","The internationally banned high-risk mines were used by illegal militants. This was why Big Eel was instantly angry when he saw them."]},{"number":4282,"title":"Chapter 4282: Hurry Up And Leave","paragraphs":["The Chinese would never allow mines to be laid. Even if they were on Libyan soil and the Chinese soldiers were found guilty, they had to stop the illegal militants out of humanitarian duty!","Out of the five people, two had already been taken care of. There were still three people left to take care of.","\"There are three more people. Azure Bird, find a place to hide. The target is coming!\" Big Eel’s voice was tense. He was very worried about his comrade. It was easy to expose her identity if something unexpected happened!","Ye Jian exhaled softly. She placed the combat dagger in her hand horizontally and pressed it against her wrist. As she listened to the footsteps on the gravel, she slowly squatted beside a piece of exposed steel wall. The wall had been stripped off by gunfire. It was about 20 centimeters thick and could barely hide Ye Jian.","\"Huh? Where are they? Enoch, Nigel!\"","The owner of the footsteps realized that his companions, who had entered the minefield earlier than him, had disappeared. He raised his voice and shouted. This was the place they had occupied. In this regard, he was quite vigilant, but he did not notice any danger beside him.","His shout was heard by the other two illegal militants. They were originally on Li Jinnian’s side, but when they heard the voice, they looked toward Ye Jian’s direction.","Sweat seeped into Big Eel’s eyes. The sun was getting hotter and hotter. His combat uniform, which was soaked in sweat, stuck tightly to his skin. He felt like he was being roasted by fire. His Adam’s apple moved, and his voice was already tense like a string that would break at any moment. \"Azure Bird, there are two people approaching from behind...\"","That side was the target that they were supposed to kill. Now... people were coming from the back!","Ye Jian was about to be exposed!","Big Eel’s voice made the entire channel gasp. Big Shark tightened his grip on Commissioner Miao’s wrist. His cheeks were already as hard as rocks.","The water ghosts all knew that... Azure Bird was about to be exposed!","Big Shark didn’t stop moving. What he needed to do now was to escort Commissioner Miao and the interpreter, Yang Heng, away. He needed Seaweed to cover him so that they could leave this place!","Soon, they would be able to leave. He could already see the entrance to the building that had been blown up by the shells. There was ample sunlight at the entrance. That was the hope of leaving alive.","Behind him, his comrades were in danger. The abyss was already staring at her, or... waiting for her to jump into it.","Ye Jian, who was already prepared to be exposed, adjusted her breathing again. Her cousin’s deep and cold voice came from her earpiece. \"I’m behind you. I’m here.\"","Li Jinnian, who was a little far away, had already rushed over. One of the water ghosts protecting the three seniors moved. Big Eel, who was watching closely, told him to support Azure Bird!","The three illegal militants formed a triangle. Inside the triangle was Ye Jian, who was hiding. Ye Jian, who was in danger, pursed her lips. She knew that she could be exposed at any time, but there was no fear on her face.","Listening to her comrades’ voices in her earpieces, she remained still and stared at her initial target.","In her heart, she calculated the distance and when she should attack.","As for the rear, she believed in her cousin and her comrades.","There was no need to be afraid and no need to panic. She just needed to face the situation calmly.","Big Eel, who was acting as their eyes, saw Demon King Li approaching quickly. When he saw his comrade rushing over to support Azure Bird, his eyes, which were red from sweat, stared at him without blinking. He didn’t even dare to blink, afraid that he would miss the most important scene.","He had to keep an eye on them and become the eyes of his comrades!","\"Big Prawn, two meters to the left! Four meters away from the third target. Demon King, continue moving forward. Five meters away from the second target. Azure Bird... they’re less than three meters away.\""]},{"number":4283,"title":"Chapter 4283: Weak Legs","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who didn’t say anything, flicked her microphone, indicating that she knew.","The air seemed to have turned heavy. As the footsteps got closer and closer, Ye Jian’s gaze turned colder and colder. She had to wait a little longer. She would be able to make a move soon...","One, two, three...","The shadow of the person had already enveloped Ye Jian. He seemed to have realized that someone was lying under the broken wall. His footsteps paused for a few seconds...","The sunlight was too glaring. When the blade of the combat dagger flashed past, a blinding light suddenly shot out. The light flashed past, and the hot air was instantly filled with the smell of blood. Ye Jian panted and stabbed the dagger into the target’s neck.","\"Mmm... Mmm...\"","The guy kept kicking his feet. When the gravel rubbed against the ground, there was a crashing sound.","The dagger that was stabbed into his neck spun half a round forcefully. The sharp blade sliced the vocal cords, trachea, and esophagus. Footsteps rushed over from behind. Ye Jian didn’t even pull out her dagger. She pounced forward and hid in a corner where the sunlight couldn’t reach.","She didn’t have time to deal with her target who had already been taken down. She only had time to kill him.","The blood flowed and wetted the gravel that had turned white from the sun, adding color to it.","The two illegal militants who ran over noticed their fallen companion and saw what was stabbed into their companion’s neck. The two of them were shocked and reacted quickly. They raised the rifles in their hands and prepared to fire to inform their nearby companions.","Two shadows rushed out. They were like bullets fired from the barrel of a gun. They hit their targets accurately. Li Jinnian and Big Prawn subdued one each...","\"Retreat!\"","Big Eel, who was acting as their eyes, finally had the time to raise his hand to wipe his sweat. The three seniors, who were listening to the commotion, didn’t wait for their junior to get up. With the help of two male special forces soldiers, they climbed over the 2.67 meters high wall. There were water ghosts behind the wall to receive them.","When they jumped down, one of the seniors’ glasses fell with a bang. The lens on the left side shattered on the spot.","Ye Jian, who had retrieved her combat dagger, ran over. When she drew her dagger, she was quick and fierce. The enemy’s blood even splattered on her body and face. She ran over with a murderous aura and quickly stepped on the back of her comrade who was bending over. She jumped up and leaped over. She grabbed the broken wall tightly with her hands and climbed up in less than five seconds.","\"Come up!\"","Ye Jian leaned against the wall and reached out her hand to her comrades below. A pair of tanned and strong hands grabbed Ye Jian’s hand tightly. Ye Jian exerted some strength to help him climb over the wall.","\"We’ll do it. You go down and protect them!\"","The water ghosts protecting the three seniors had already come up. Only Demon King Li and Big Prawn had yet to arrive.","Ye Jian didn’t refuse. She said ’okay’ and quickly climbed over the wall. Then, she jumped down from the broken wall that was six to seven meters tall like a swallow. There was only a thin layer of dust on her feet. Then, she flipped over twice consecutively. When she landed, she was already gone.","The two seniors stared nervously:","She jumped down easily from a height of six to seven meters as if she were jumping for fun!","After Ye Jian jumped down, she even helped to pick up her senior’s glasses.","Li Jinnian was the last to jump over.","\"Big Eel, retreat!\"","With Li Jinnian’s order, Big Eel, who was observing from the high ground, retreated."]},{"number":4284,"title":"Chapter 4284: Team Treasure","paragraphs":["As Big Eel retreated, everyone’s tense hearts finally relaxed. Although Commissioner Miao and the rest didn’t know what had happened, they more or less understood why they were in such a hurry to retreat just now. When they saw Ye Jian coming over, Commissioner Miao closed his eyes lightly. He felt as though a weight had been lifted off his heart.","Yang Heng’s straightened back relaxed too. He held onto the dusty wall with one hand and remained silent for a while before he was able to take a step forward.","Azure Bird even high-fived her comrades.","Just now, she really escaped death!","Once the illegal militants fired their guns to warn their people, everyone would’ve been in danger. They wouldn’t have been able to escape even if they had wings!","Their sweat-soaked combat uniforms seemed to drip as they walked. Then, they looked at their comrades who were still alive even though they were slightly injured. They smiled at each other. Their painted faces made their teeth look snow-white, and their smiles were as bright as the sun.","\"Not bad, Azure Bird. Very impressive.\" Big Shark approached Ye Jian and asked in a low voice, \"Are you really not considering coming to our team? If you do, you’ll be our team’s treasure!\"","Their team’s treasure... A national treasure!","Ye Jian didn’t answer. She just smiled at Big Shark.","He hadn’t given up on poaching her even after so long.","The government forces had already gathered and launched a new round of attacks on the illegal militants. There was artillery fire and smoke. Ye Jian and the other 20 people advanced with difficulty. If they were not careful, they would fall into the abyss and lose their lives.","They had entered the most critical moment. No one said anything else. Cover, retreat, concealment... These were the words they communicated the most along the way.","Commissioner Miao and the three students didn’t ask the special forces soldiers to take care of them anymore. At this moment, it was best they took care of themselves without causing trouble for the soldiers.","As for Yang Heng, he had to bear a certain amount of responsibility from the moment he started holding the rifle. He felt that he had to carry it. After all, he was a soldier. Even if his position was administrative, he was still a soldier.","He didn’t follow the other water ghosts. He just followed Ye Jian closely. He would do whatever Ye Jian asked him to do. At this moment, his friend, who used to sit at the same table with him to share meals and chat, had become a figure who was protecting him. She would protect him all the way back to the camp.","They passed through the potholed Saiya Street and the park where the scenery had been ruined by the artillery fire. There was dark brown soil everywhere. Behind them, the artillery fire was endless. The government forces had mobilized tanks.","The early deployment of anti-tank mines by the illegal militants showed that there were still people like the rebel general, Alva, in the government forces.","The firepower of the tanks shot straight at them. The strong fire attack instantly destroyed the illegal armed forces. In order to destroy the illegal armed forces in Yeni, they even increased the support firepower and installed a 76mm howitzer. When a howitzer was fired, the buildings that were hit collapsed. Countless illegal militants were blown into pieces by the explosion.","There were severed limbs scattered around, and the blood was instantly turned dark brown by the heat of the artillery fire. The illegal militants who were lucky enough to survive dragged their mangled bodies and screamed in pain. One of the illegal militants’ bodies had exploded into two. He didn’t die immediately. Instead, he looked at his lower body that was blown up and widened his eyes in pain.","This place had become hell on earth.","\"I need support. I need support now! They’ve already concentrated their firepower to attack. The heavy weapons we brought can’t meet our current needs at all!\""]},{"number":4285,"title":"Chapter 4285: A Deserving Death","paragraphs":["In the train station, the rebel general, Alva, screamed. The situation in front was tragic. The government forces had mobilized their forces to attack directly. He already had a feeling that he wouldn’t be able to hold on for long.","Soon, even more tragic news was heard. Saiya Street was lost. Tanks passed through the buildings and came over. The howitzer blasted a bloody hole.","\"Where are the mines? Damn it! Where did they place the mines?\" Alva was no longer shouting normally. His eyes were ferocious, and his neck was thick and swollen.","No one knew why the mines didn’t explode. No one knew that the five people who laid the mines had been secretly killed.","The sunlight got brighter and brighter. When they walked under the sunlight, it was as if they had walked into a furnace. Their clothes that were wet became dry, leaving behind white salt stains. At this moment, Ye Jian and the rest had already passed through the park.","They were already very close to the Chinese peacekeeping camp. They had already reached the suburbs of Yeni.","At this moment, one hour and 15 minutes had passed since they came out of the warehouse.","They had taken 15 minutes longer than expected.","According to the original plan, they would walk out of the park within an hour. Then, they would have ten minutes of rest. But now... they couldn’t even have a minute of rest. No one stopped as they rushed toward the Chinese peacekeeping camp.","About three kilometers away from the camp, they heard gunshots from the direction of the Chinese peacekeeping camp.","Big Prawn contacted the camp through the satellite phone. The person on the phone wasn’t the squadron leader but a soldier.","The soldier had been holding his gun and waiting for the call. As soon as Li Jinnian reported his identity, the soldier immediately reported the current situation of the camp.","\"The camp has been attacked by illegal militants and artillery. Four peacekeeping soldiers have been seriously injured. The camp is in a dire situation!\" This was the latest news Li Jinnian received from the peacekeeping camp. Things were very urgent, and they needed rescue.","When Commissioner Miao knew that the camp was being attacked, he was worried about the soldiers. At the same time, he was anxious about the special materials that he had painstakingly refined. Ever since he was kidnapped, he hadn’t had a good sleep. Furthermore, he had been running around. At this moment, Commissioner Miao’s stamina was obviously weak. He even felt that his body temperature was abnormally high.","However, he didn’t say anything. He didn’t even say anything to the three students who were taking care of him. He said softly to Li Jinnian, \"Your marching speed is slowed down by us. It’s only three kilometers now. Hurry up and leave! Don’t waste any more time on us.","\"We won’t follow you. If we go, we’ll only cause trouble. We’ll distract you because you’ll have to take care of us! We’ll find a place to hide first. We’ll go over after it ends!\"","Commissioner Miao was worried about that batch of special materials. Even if he lost his life, he had to protect that batch of materials!","\"Mentor!\"","His decision caused the expressions of the three PhD students to change. The teacher meant that he would rather sacrifice himself to protect the materials!","Ye Jian’s eyes darkened. She said in a low voice, \"Teacher, we didn’t save you so that you would be in danger again. Your safety is very important. This is our mission in Libya. Hence, you have to follow us.\"","They had to speed up their march, but they also had to protect Commissioner Miao and the rest.","Hence, the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade were split into two batches. Four water ghosts were left behind to protect Commissioner Miao, the three students, and Yang Heng, the interpreter. The rest of them immediately went to reinforce the camp.","This was the decision made by the captain, Demon King Li. No one raised any objections.","Ye Jian didn’t stay. Earlier, Li Jinnian glanced at her and saw her nod. He knew what she meant."]},{"number":4286,"title":"Chapter 4286: Leave It To Me","paragraphs":["She was a sniper. On the battlefield, a sniper could hold the fort. She had to follow them.","Yang Heng looked at Ye Jian’s back view as she left. His gaze was as dark as a bottle of ink. There was deep worry in his black eyes.","\"You know Ye Jian, right? Don’t worry too much. She’s very powerful.\" Sea Anemone smiled and patted the interpreter who was clenching his fists. He was a handsome young man. Although he was an admin, he was quite bold. \"Let’s go. Let’s find a safe place and wait for them to come back.\"","Yang Heng clenched his fists so tightly that he was worried that his bones would shatter.","Sea Anemone didn’t sound worried at all. Yang Heng closed his eyes lightly and chased after him. \"Will they be alright?\"","...","The air was silent for a few seconds. Surprise flashed past Sea Anemone’s expression as he stared at Yang Heng for a few more seconds. He felt that as a soldier, Yang Heng had asked a hilarious question.","Sea Anemone, whose skin was tanned but whose gaze was extremely sharp, smiled and said, \"Interpreter, who can guarantee that we’ll be fine on the battlefield?","\"We all want to go back alive and live well before devoting ourselves to the next mission. I don’t know if they’ll be fine, but I know that they won’t let anything happen to us.\"","Strictly speaking, Yang Heng was still a new recruit. He joined the army last December, and it had only been half a year since then. Although he had just been enlightened, he was still a new recruit, after all. He had never come into contact with such missions before. He was also very worried about Ye Jian, so he asked this question.","After Sea Anemone finished speaking, Yang Heng clenched his fists so tightly that blood spurted out from his palms. That was right. Why did he ask such a stupid question?","Would something happen?","Guns showed no mercy. If they risked their lives to go over, who knew if something would happen?","Actually, everyone knew that something would happen, but they still went.","That was because someone had to face these dangers. Someone had to combat evil. Someone had to... pay with their life for the country’s strength.","How important was that batch of materials?","It was so important that the moment he was kidnapped, Commissioner Miao told him, \"Yang, we’d rather die than tell you what we’re doing. Even if we die, we have to carry our secrets with us. Our secrets belong to the country.\"","The country was strong, and the people were rich. But there were many bones behind the country’s strength...","Sea Anemone and the other four water ghosts brought Commissioner Miao to the safety zone. Li Jinnian, Ye Jian, and the other 12 people rushed back to the Chinese peacekeeping camp at their fastest speed until they could finally see the red flag fluttering in the wind.","The dense gunshots entered everyone’s ears one after another. The captain of the Storm Commando Brigade, Demon King Li, quickly adjusted his position and started supporting the combat.","\"A is the main entrance. The firepower is the strongest there. There’s a heavy machine gun! The crossfire between the two wings is weak. Azure Bird, you’re in charge of killing the heavy machine gunner and the comrades in the camp kill the others. There’s no heavy sniper rifle. There’s only a rifle. How confident are you?\"","The effective range of the 95 automatic rifle was 400 meters. Ye Jian nodded and said in a low voice, \"Sure, leave it to me!\"","She was a sniper. Heavy machine gunners and gunners were usually handled by the sniper.","The captain of the camp already knew that the special forces soldiers sent by the country had come to support them. In the face of the attack of the illegal militants, the 40-year-old captain calmly commanded the combat. At the same time, he had already transferred the special materials to the bathroom in the camp.","The kitchen and the medical center were not good enough. Once the camp was taken down, these two places would be ransacked immediately. The bathroom would be much safer."]},{"number":4287,"title":"Chapter 4287: Rush Up","paragraphs":["The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade had the city map of Yeni and the combat map of a few important fortresses, but they didn’t have the combat map of the peacekeeping camp. When setting up the combat division, the scouts, Sea Anemone and Seaweed, needed to secretly scout the event location.","Sea Anemone and Seaweed only came back ten minutes later. They immediately drew a map.","Using this map as the guide, Li Jinnian quickly arranged combat arrangements and plans based on the news coming out of the camp.","\"We can approach the battlefield from the side of the route. We can hide through the battlefield and avoid the high-firing of the heavy machine guns. We can also attack from the side. If Azure Bird kills the heavy machine gunner, we can suppress them with firepower and attack directly.","\"We’ll attack from the side and split them into three. We’ll cut off their path of retreat and surround the targets. Don’t let anyone escape alive.\"","When he said the last sentence, Li Jinnian’s cold eyes were filled with killing intent.","The entire combat deployment took five minutes. The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade approached the enemy bit by bit. They didn’t move immediately. They needed to wait for Ye Jian to move first before moving. The clicking sounds that reached their ears made the water ghosts’ hearts sink.","This was the sound of heavy machine guns firing.","The effective shooting range was 500 meters. The combat shooting speed was 200 to 300 bullets in a minute. When the bullets were fired, they would form a powerful wind of power.","Under the overwhelming firepower, the camp without heavy weapons was still not taken down. This showed the combat skills of the soldiers.","The illegal militants, who wanted to attack the Chinese camp and teach the other countries who also had peacekeeping camps here a lesson, were a little anxious. They didn’t expect that after attacking for almost 40 minutes, they still couldn’t take down the Chinese peacekeeping camp. Their patience was running out.","They thought that they had chosen the country with the weakest military strength. Who knew that... the Chinese camp was so tenacious that it exceeded their imagination!","However, they had to take down the Chinese peacekeeping camp. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be able to intimidate other countries, let alone the government forces.","The leader of the illegal militants, who was in charge of storming the Chinese peacekeeping camp, shouted. Ye Jian couldn’t hear what he was yelling, and she couldn’t guess what he was shouting from the shape of his mouth. However, she was sure that he wasn’t shouting anything good.","At this moment, Ye Jian had already climbed onto an unknown tree that could be seen anytime in Libya. She used the leaves to hide.","Although she was at a high point, her position was not the best shooting position. The location of the heavy machine gunner was higher than her current position.","Her position was the highest point in this area. Due to the geography of the battlefield, she couldn’t find the best shooting position. She could only find the best high point within the effective range of 400 meters of the 95 rifle.","Ye Jian had always completed her sniping alone. She didn’t need any observers or the help of the laser range finder. She had been calculating in her heart the entire time to find the best position before setting up her scope.","Ye Jian only took three minutes to calculate the angle between her position and the target and adjust the aiming range.","In order to prevent the scope from reflecting the sunlight, the lens was covered with a gauze net. Through the scope, she found the person in charge of this group of illegal militants. However, she didn’t aim at the person in charge. Her attention was focused on the head of the heavy machine gunner."]},{"number":4288,"title":"Chapter 4288: Cripple Them","paragraphs":["\"One, two, three... Shoot.\"","Ye Jian’s cold voice came from the earpieces. The bullet of the 95 rifle was ignited by the impact of the needle. Unlike the clicking sound of the heavy machine gun, Ye Jian used a single shot to hit the left side of the machine gunner’s head.","His body stood up straight for a few seconds before collapsing.","Ye Jian didn’t leave immediately. She aimed at the guy who had shouted at the heavy machine gunner before. Although she didn’t know what he said, she could tell that he was important. Whoever he was, he was trying to pull up the dead machine gunner. He would be the second person she would kill.","They didn’t notice the presence of the sniper. They thought that the Chinese soldiers in the camp had shot the heavy machine gunner. When Ye Jian fired again and Li Jinnian and the rest attacked from the back, the illegal militants closest to the heavy machine gun finally realized that a sniper had appeared.","A sniper was the Grim Reaper of the battlefield. The existence of a sniper was a huge and terrifying existence to them.","The current Ye Jian was a terrifying existence to the illegal militants.","\"They have snipers! The Chinese have snipers!\"","The illegal militants who discovered the existence of the sniper shouted. In an instant, the others heard the yells. Some people had already fallen under the bullets of the water ghosts.","\"It’s their support! Fight from the back! Hurry!\"","\"Find the sniper, quickly find the sniper!\"","\"Desmond is dead! Desmond is dead! He was killed by a sniper!\"","Desmond was the person-in-charge of this attack on the camp. He was also one of the masterminds. Someone suggested attacking the weakest country in Libya, and Desmond strongly agreed.","At that time, he didn’t expect to die under the bullets of a Chinese sniper. At that time, he even arrogantly said that if he had a hundred people and raised a heavy machine gun, he would be able to take down the Chinese camp in less than half an hour.","That was what he said, and that was what he thought. He was very confident.","Reality slapped him so hard that he didn’t even have the chance to repent. He was taken away by the Grim Reaper.","Desmond’s death caused chaos in the combat of the illegal militants. The snipers, reinforcements, and the Chinese soldiers resisted tenaciously. A large number of them, who thought that they would definitely be able to gain benefits, instantly collapsed.","Ye Jian continued to hide in the tree.","Now, the advantage of low altitude was that most people would think that a sniper would shoot from a high altitude. This was a fixed thinking pattern, especially those who didn’t understand sniping.","The illegal militants knew that the Chinese had snipers, but they were all searching at the higher ground. Someone was trying to snatch the heavy machine gun. Ye Jian, who hadn’t left, didn’t aim at the ’people’ this time.","Her goal was to turn the heavy machine gun into a useless gun that could no longer pose a threat.","Ye Jian, who was taking aim while listening to the gunshots, pursed her lips slightly. She lowered her eyes slightly and allowed her eyes to relax for a few seconds. Then, she took a deep breath before approaching the scope again.","She fired from the side. From her position, the machine gun took an ’L’-shape. She could shoot the heavy machine gun from the side, but she couldn’t destroy the receiver seat quickly. This was the problem Ye Jian was facing."]},{"number":4289,"title":"Chapter 4289: Shot","paragraphs":["The receiver seat was the entrance to the heavy machine gun’s ammunition belt. If this spot was destroyed, the entire heavy machine gun would become a piece of decoration. There was no way to complete high-speed firing with the ammunition belt.","The angle made it very difficult to shoot. Ye Jian adjusted her aim again. Distance, wind speed, gear number... Ye Jian had already started calculating quickly. When her gaze suddenly became firm, she pulled the trigger without hesitation.","Bang!","The third bullet rang out. She completed her shooting at an altitude higher than sea level.","Bang! Bang! The heavy machine gun was destroyed by a bullet. The spring and axle of the machine gun were destroyed. It could no longer be fixed.","Ye Jian had already come down from the tree. She didn’t continue hiding in the tree. Her comrades had already rushed over. It was her turn.","Ye Jian, who rushed out like a monkey, said, \"After everything is over, carry the goods into the camp. I saw a few ammunition boxes. There are probably many bullet belts inside. Keep the guns and bullets. If there’s trouble in the future, we’ll have heavy weapons to hold the line.\"","It was too simple to only have a 95 rifle!","It was fine if they didn’t have heavy weapons, but why didn’t they even have grenades?","She didn’t believe that there weren’t any lethal weapons in the peacekeeping camps of the other countries.","She was in charge of the right flank assault. She held her gun and spoke as she walked. The water ghosts, who had already killed their way in, somehow relaxed. They only relaxed a little, and they didn’t dare to underestimate this group of people.","Which countries were supporting the illegal militants in Libya? Where did their firearms come from? Actually, every country more or less knew about it. But so what if they knew?","Without evidence, the arms trade was free. So what if it was illegal?","Since there was support behind the illegal militants, the water ghosts couldn’t be careless. They couldn’t let anyone know why they were here or what they were going to do next. Everything was confidential. Secret operations were one level lower than top secrets.","The bullets whizzed past. Some hit the enemy’s vital points accurately, some avoided their vital points and hit other parts, and some flew away and landed somewhere. The water ghosts, who were in their first combat, were excited. Bullets were flying everywhere, but their eyes were frighteningly bright.","The water ghosts who attacked from the back had the advantage. The first round of attacks instantly knocked the other party down. They aimed for the first round of clearing because the first round of clearing usually had the most casualties.","When the enemy reacted, it was already the second round of clearing.","The enemy’s casualties would be lowered in the second round of clearing, and their own casualties would be increased. The risk of death would be greater than the first round.","Big Eel, who was in charge of the assault on the right flank, suddenly felt as if his chest had been hit by a high-voltage heavy weapon. He fell back uncontrollably. At that moment, his chest hurt so much that it felt as if it had been crushed by the wheels of a car. He lost his heart rhythm, and his blood pressure soared. Even his vision turned black.","He had been hit by a bullet.","Big Eel, whose vision was turning black, was dragged to safety by his comrades who rushed up behind him. Amidst the buzzing in his ears, he heard his comrades’ voices. \"Damn it! You didn’t make a sound!\"","Then, Big Eel’s comrades touched his chest and he felt as if he had been run over by a car. Just as Big Eel was about to say something, he heard his comrades say fiercely, \"F*ck, he’s not dead! He’s not injured!\""]},{"number":4290,"title":"Chapter 4290: Fight With Me","paragraphs":["Big Eel felt as if there was a kaleidoscope spinning on the top of his head. Big Eel, who couldn’t even focus his gaze, took deep breaths. His brain, which had been instantly cut off by the heavy blow, finally regained a hint of clarity.","\"I’m not dead. The bulletproof vest protected me.\" Big Eel smiled. Sea Anemone couldn’t help but scold in a low voice, \"Damn it, I was almost scared to death by you. Take a breather!\"","Big Eel was fine. The water ghosts heaved a sigh of relief, and their jawlines tightened.","\"You’re still alive from a rifle shot. You’re really lucky!\" Sea Anemone wiped his sweat. His eyes were red. He saw that Ye Jian had already come over. The two comrades in front were tanking the assault. He took a deep breath and rushed up again without talking to Big Eel.","Big Eel placed his hand on the bulletproof vest that had already been torn open. There was still the smell of gunpowder left. He started to check if he had hurt his bones.","The bullet didn’t pierce through his body, but the power of the bullet caused him to feel a dull pain in his chest. Even if he just took a deep breath, it was still painful. He pressed his fingers lightly again, until his face distorted and his breathing suddenly rose.","Damn it, his bones weren’t broken, but they were fractured!","Fortunately, it was a rifle bullet. Fortunately, the shooting distance was very far. Otherwise, if a rifle bullet had hit him, he would’ve been severely injured!","This was the first time Big Eel had gotten shot. He was experiencing a lingering fear.","Ye Jian took over Big Eel’s assault position. Her shooting speed was fast, and her accuracy was high. With her participation and the awesomeness of the soldiers in the camp, she found it exhilarating. Ten minutes later, all the illegal militants on the right wing were cleared. The blood of more than 20 people dyed the yellow soil red.","\"Clean up the right flank. The camp is in charge of the last clearance.\" Ye Jian reported the latest news of their right flank and quickly leaned toward the main camp gate.","Big Eel didn’t say anything about his injury. He only said that he was fine. He endured the pain of his fracture and returned to the combat.","\"To the right, second point, support!\"","\"Roger that.\"","Someone shouted, and Ye Jian responded calmly.","The soldiers in the camp could finally heave a sigh of relief. The injured soldiers also retreated and quickly bandaged their wounds. The accompanying military surgeons rushed to treat them. Every time they saw an injured soldier being carried down, their expressions would turn darker. One soldier had already been sacrificed. They couldn’t let any more sacrifices happen.","In the past few days, peacekeeping soldiers had died in the campsite of the small town of Covil and in the campsite of Yeni. These were the first casualties since they started peacekeeping in Libya!","Li Jinnian’s cold voice entered Ye Jian’s ears. \"Azure Bird, approach me. 50 meters to the left. Sea Anemone, Seaweed, continue clearing the second point at Azure Bird’s position!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","Three firm and powerful voices sounded. Ye Jian moved toward Li Jinnian. Sea Anemone and Seaweed covered Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who was closing in, didn’t shoot anymore. She advanced 30 meters at her fastest speed and crawled another 20 meters to reach her target.","Li Jinnian looked at his cousin who was like the Goddess of Death on the battlefield. He retracted his gaze and said in a low voice, \"I’ll attack with you and clear all the targets as soon as possible to send them away. If we drag on, I’m afraid they’ll still have reinforcements.\"","\"Okay! I have no problems with that.\" Ye Jian nodded. She was an assaulter and sniper in the Xueyu unit. She was familiar with assaults and wasn’t afraid.","The reason why Li Jinnian asked Ye Jian to break out of the encirclement with him was because... she had carried out live ammunition combat before. Her combat ability was stronger than the water ghosts who were in their first combat.","This was an indisputable fact."]},{"number":4291,"title":"Chapter 4291: Last","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian knew that Ye Jian had actual combat experience, but the water ghosts didn’t. They immediately objected.","Big Shark was the first to object. He should be the one attacking.","\"She’s suitable. Her shooting speed is fast. You guys cover her.\" Li Jinnian didn’t accept it. Ye Jian was the most suitable at a time like this. The firefight had lasted long enough. They needed to end it as soon as possible.","Ye Jian smiled at the water ghosts’ objection. She changed her magazine and smiled. \"Comrades, it’s up to you guys now. The sooner you finish, the sooner we can end our work. Aren’t you hungry? I’m already starving.\"","...","She really felt hungry!","After she interrupted them, the water ghosts remembered that since yesterday afternoon, they hadn’t... had a bite of rice and only drank a few mouthfuls of water!","Sea Anemone smiled too. \"Commissioner Miao and the rest should be hungrier. The interpreter who came back said that he was so hungry that he wanted to eat grass.\"","At this moment, Commissioner Miao, Yang Heng, and the three PhD seniors had already moved to a safe area. Commissioner Miao, who was originally protected by the four water ghosts, requested them to rush back to the camp as soon as possible to provide support. They could take care of themselves.","It was impossible for all four water ghosts to return to the camp to provide support. In the end, two water ghosts, Sea Anemone and Big Squid, returned to provide support.","At this moment, Sea Anemone had already attacked twice. When he rushed back, he even dragged Big Eel, whose chest was fractured by the bullet, to safety. Now that the right wing was cleared, Sea Anemone was also approaching the main camp gate.","At the mention of being hungry, he mentioned Yang Heng saying that he was so hungry that he wanted to eat grass. For a moment, the tension dissipated.","Ye Jian, who had changed her magazine, smiled until her eyes turned to slits. Yang Heng was a very cheerful and interesting guy. When he was in senior high, countless girls had a crush on him. Those words were indeed something he’d say.","\"There’s no need to eat grass. Let’s have a bowl of noodles when the time comes. I should be able to eat two bowls of noodles.\" Ye Jian, who was leaning over, had already changed to crawling. She glanced at Li Jinnian, who had also changed his magazine.","The cousins nodded slightly and started their assault.","\"Cover, cover!\"","\"Roger, copy!\"","\"Cut off the ones at the side. Be careful of their guns.\"","\"Roger, copy!\"","...","As Ye Jian and Li Jinnian attacked, the water ghosts felt as though the rifles on their shoulders were burning their hands.","Bang, bang, bang...","The gunshots were too intense. Bullets streaked past like rain, tearing through the air before shooting into the targets’ bodies. Blood flowed out, and the targets fell.","Boom!","There was the sound of a grenade exploding. Flames appeared on the left wing, and thick smoke spread. This was the grenade that the illegal militants threw previously. It didn’t explode. The water ghosts in charge of the left wing approached and saw the grenade that had been pulled. Their first reaction was to scatter around. Then, a few stray bullets hit the dud.","An explosion sounded. Shrapnel and soil flew everywhere. A pit had already been created by the explosion.","The water ghosts who were in charge of the last clearance didn’t panic because of the explosion. They just tensed up and asked the comrades in charge of clearing the left wing how they were doing.","\"Damn it, a dud explosion.\"","Big Shark, who was covered with soil, returned to his comrades. At this moment, his eardrums were hurting terribly. It was as if he was placed in vacuum pressure. As the pressure dropped, the ringing in his ears made his voice tremble.","\"I’m fine. I dodged quickly.\"","Big Shark looked at his arm that was hurt by the shrapnel. He gritted his teeth and quickly took out the bandages to wrap his arm. He didn’t have time to deal with anything else. He had to stop the bleeding first."]},{"number":4292,"title":"Chapter 4292: Calm Down","paragraphs":["Big Eel was the closest to the dud. He was the first to notice it. Among the three of them, he was the only one who was stabbed by shrapnel.","The other two water ghosts had already gathered and covered Big Shark, who was treating his wound. Since the left wing was fine, it should be okay. Now, the main thing was that there were still at least 20 targets that needed to be cleared.","In the camp, the pressure on the soldiers decreased. Reinforcements were here, but they couldn’t leave the pressure to their comrades.","The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade entered the final cleanup. These illegal militants wouldn’t be able to be arrogant anymore.","The one-and-a-half-hour fierce battle ended with China winning.","The illegal militants didn’t come from the military unit. They were all residents of Libya. Before the civil war, they were just ordinary residents. The civil war broke out in three waves in Libya. The first wave was the NPFL militants, the second was the government forces, and the last was the illegal militants. Everyone wanted to rule Libya. They followed the principle of an eye for an eye. It could be said that there were casualties every day.","The smoke hadn’t dissipated, and bullets were scattered everywhere on the ground. The peacekeepers and soldiers started to clean up the event location. Just like what Ye Jian said, the heavy machine gun was transported back to the camp. A few water ghosts who were injured by the stray bullets went to treat their wounds. Ye Jian, who specially watched the heavy machine gun being transported back to the camp, decided to repair the gun.","The cooking team already knew that the comrades who came to support them hadn’t eaten a single bite since yesterday afternoon. They immediately set up the pot and started cutting the vegetables. They made some stir-fried noodles for the comrades.","Ye Jian only had small injuries. She just needed to disinfect them. She didn’t go over to get herself treated and had already dismantled the heavy machine gun.","A few heavily injured peacekeeping soldiers were still in the midst of emergency treatment. The military surgeons were all in the midst of carrying out emergency treatment. Those with minor injuries were handed over to the nurses. The water ghosts didn’t ask the nurses for help. They simply got their comrades to handle their wounds.","Seeing this, the nurses turned around and treated the injured peacekeepers’ wounds.","Li Jinnian wasn’t around. He brought a few uninjured water ghosts to replenish their ammunition and drove to fetch Commissioner Miao and the rest.","When the cooking team served the piping hot food, Ye Jian was still repairing the gun. The person looking for her was Sea Anemone, who had carried the gun in with her.","Looking at the parts on the ground, Sea Anemone swallowed his saliva and asked carefully, \"Azure Bird, after you dismantle the parts... can you put them back?\"","After looking for her for a long time, it turned out she was actually dismantling the gun alone.","Ye Jian didn’t look up. She knelt on one knee and put back the disassembled parts. She smiled and said, \"Of course. I’ll assemble the parts just as I dismantled them.\"","A soldier in charge of the maintenance of firearms in the camp smiled and said, \"She’s very professional. The moment she appeared, she knew where to start dismantling. She even told me what to do.\"","...","Sea Anemone widened his eyes. \"You even know how to fix a gun?\"","\"Yes, a little. Why are you looking for me? Are Commissioner Miao and the rest back?\" Ye Jian didn’t see the shock in Sea Anemone’s eyes. It wasn’t a secret that she knew how to repair guns. Most of the comrades in the Xueyu unit knew about it. It wasn’t something worth keeping a secret.","She was calm, but Sea Anemone wasn’t. What else did Azure Bird not know?","\"Aren’t you hungry? Come, let’s eat first. We’ll come back after we’re done.\" Looking at the parts of the heavy machine gun, Sea Anemone rubbed his hands secretly. It would be good if Azure Bird joined their team!"]},{"number":4293,"title":"Chapter 4293: They Are Here","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t know that Sea Anemone wanted her to join the Storm Commando Brigade. Ye Jian wasn’t willing to put down her work and eat before she finished assembling the heavy machine gun. Hence, she asked Sea Anemone to go back and save some food for her. She would go after she was done.","She was the one who dismantled the heavy machine gun. Since she dismantled it, she had to be responsible.","She was indeed hungry. Just like what Yang Heng said, she was so hungry that she could eat grass.","At this moment, it was already noon in Libya. Li Jinnian brought Commissioner Miao back to the camp. He was driving a truck. For safety reasons, Commissioner Miao didn’t sit in the front passenger seat. Instead, the two water ghosts were in charge of driving. The rest of the people were sitting in the back of the truck.","Yang Heng took the water bottle and finished half of it in one go. There was still one mouthful left. One of the male soldiers who came to bring them back smiled and said, \"You must be very hungry. You don’t have to eat grass when we go back. We have vegetables for you.\"","\"Cough, cough, cough...\"","Yang Heng choked on the water that he didn’t manage to swallow. His face turned red. After coughing for a while, he wiped the water off the corner of his mouth and said awkwardly, \"I was just joking. I was just joking.\"","It was just a casual remark. Did everyone know about it now?","Big Prawn, who had spoken, could guess what Yang Heng was thinking when he saw his expression. He smiled brightly and said, \"Previously, there were times when we were hungry enough that we wanted to eat grass too. The grass we picked was quite delicious.\"","During training, they ate a lot of grass.","What could Yang Heng say? He could only smile.","Seeing his awkwardness, Big Prawn didn’t continue. The interpreter was shy, and they didn’t have a deep relationship. He had to stop joking.","Yang Heng heaved a sigh of relief when Big Prawn didn’t say anything else. He was a little restrained when he was with the special forces. He wasn’t like Ye Jian, who could get along with them. It was obvious that they were comrades.","Ye Jian... He didn’t know how she was doing.","Yang Heng glanced at the special forces captain who was sitting with Commissioner Miao. He hesitated for a moment before bending over. He placed his hands on the shoulders of the three PhD students and walked over.","The moment he moved, Li Jinnian’s gaze landed on him. Seeing this, he reached out and pulled him.","Yang Heng, who was swaying in the car, immediately clenched his fists tightly and sat down stably.","He asked about Ye Jian.","When Li Jinnian heard him mention Ye Jian’s real name, his gaze was sharp for a few seconds. Yang Heng felt that Li Jinnian’s gaze was like a scalpel that wanted to cut him apart.","Under such a stressful gaze, Yang Heng said in a low voice, \"We used to study in the same senior high. My parents almost acknowledged her as their goddaughter. My parents only gave up because Ye Jian didn’t agree.\"","So that was the case.","Although his gaze was still cold, Li Jinnian retracted his sharp gaze and said to Yang Heng, \"She’s fine. She’s in the camp now.\"","He paused for a moment and said, \"You can’t mention her name when you go back.\"","\"It’s good that she’s fine.\" Yang Heng heaved a sigh of relief. He finally felt relieved. He nodded slightly. \"I understand. I won’t tell anyone.\"","Yang Heng fell asleep listening to the rumbling of the truck.","Outside was Yeni’s most beautiful coastline, the washed sky, and the blue sea. The waves rolled over with white waves. A few birds brushed past the waves and quickly spread their wings and flew high. In the distance, a transport plane gradually flew away.","In the waves, several figures were chasing after three square objects that were floating on the surface of the sea in two directions. They each had something trailing behind them, which was a combat bag."]},{"number":4294,"title":"Chapter 4294: Respectable","paragraphs":["More than ten special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit had successfully landed from the transport plane. The weather was good, and the sea was calm. There were only normal deviations from the landing point.","To avoid being exposed, the special forces of the Xueyu unit landed five nautical miles away from the shore. The five nautical miles were about 9,400 meters. In addition, the normal deviation was about 9,500 meters. If they swam, they would need five to six hours to reach the shore.","It was definitely not possible to swim over like this. They needed to have equipment. The objects floating on the sea were inflatable dinghies. They were similar to an aircraft escape ladder. They just needed to pull out the tab.","The soldiers quickly deployed the inflatable dinghies. The square objects opened and instantly turned into dinghies. They first helped a comrade to the top before the comrade pulled the rest on board.","There were five people in each of the three dinghies. After fishing up the equipment, they set off for the coastline in less than ten minutes.","Some equipment couldn’t be opened. For instance, land-based communication equipment, GPS, and other electronic equipment couldn’t be used. They took out their rifles from their waterproof bags and put in the magazines. They now had their basic equipment.","They took out the paint and painted their faces until even their parents wouldn’t be able to recognize them. They didn’t even miss out their lips. They painted everything. After they were done painting their faces, their eyes were as sharp as arrows and shone with a cold light.","With the dinghies, their speed would be faster.","Ye Jian installed the heavy machine gun and handed it over to the soldier who was maintaining the firearms. In the end, she ate two bowls of noodles.","Xia Jinyuan led his troops ashore. Ye Jian and the rest had already tied the special materials to their bodies and were preparing to set off.","\"We must bring them all back to the country. The country is waiting for them! We’re just one step away from completing our great undertaking!\" Before they left, Commissioner Miao, who couldn’t accompany them, was still reminding them carefully. These special materials were more precious than his life. They had to be guarded well.","The 50 kilograms of special materials were tied to the 16 special forces soldiers. They even gave up their backpacks and only wore tactical vests. Even with the magazines and guns, the load was almost light.","Li Jinnian placed the specially processed materials on his waist and said to Commissioner Miao, \"Don’t worry. We’ll bring all 50 kilograms back to the country. Even if there’s only one person left, we’ll bring the materials back.\"","\"Good, good, good!\" Commissioner Miao, whose eyes were filled with tears, raised his hand and patted the young soldier’s shoulder very gently. \"This is our hope. We’ll leave our hope to you.\"","This sentence was filled with the noble spirit of a scientist who would sacrifice himself fearlessly and put his life on the line for the sake of the country.","This was also the hope for the strong and powerful soldiers as well as the scientists who often slept in the laboratory.","Captain Li led his team members to salute Commissioner Miao, Commissioner Tao, the three PhD students, and Yang Heng, the interpreter. They were carrying ’hope’. They would definitely return to the country with hope!","At 3:37 pm, the water ghosts, who had helped the camp to clean up the battlefield, departed. When they left, Ye Jian turned around and looked at Yang Heng deeply. Yang Heng didn’t agree to leave with her. No matter how she persuaded him, he insisted on staying.","He also told her why Libya was full of enemies and why some ambitious Western countries had joined them. It was because the country was weak. If the country was weak, they would be passive and beaten!","China, which had been beaten before, could not make the same mistake again. The law of the jungle had never changed!"]},{"number":4295,"title":"Chapter 4295: Urgent","paragraphs":["Ye Jian turned around and looked at her old friend. He smiled and waved at her. Ye Jian raised her hand and waved at him gently. ’See you when you return to the country, Yang Heng.’","She said softly in her heart.","Xia Jinyuan brought the soldiers to the coast.","The squadron leader of the Chinese peacekeeping camp in Yeni didn’t see the soldiers off. He was so busy that he wished that he could split into three people. He needed to settle the matters in the camp, clean up after the battle, and handle some matters in the mine deep in the tropical rainforest more than 100 kilometers away from the camp.","After Li Jinnian and the rest left, the frowning squadron leader was talking to the person-in-charge of the mine on the satellite phone.","\"Things are troublesome. We were attacked by illegal militants for half an hour and a half today. The camp was attacked, and a peacekeeper soldier... was sacrificed.\" At the mention of sacrifice, the squadron leader’s expression was sad. There was sorrow in his eyes. \"I’ll try my best to send a class over. We have to prevent them from attacking the camp again.\"","It was unknown what was said on the other end of the phone, but the squadron leader smiled bitterly. \"Two classes, no more. The special materials sent to the camp will be brought out this afternoon. Don’t worry, nothing will happen!","\"Alright, I’ll send two classes over. You can persuade them again. Since they’ve already targeted us once, there will be a second time. Since the equipment has almost been transferred, let’s hurry up and retreat. The situation is tense. I don’t know how long the government forces can last. We can’t let anyone stay in the mine. We can’t even let the guards stay!\"","When the squadron leader ended the call and came out, he knew that the special forces soldiers who supported them had already left. Commissioner Miao and Commissioner Tao insisted on staying in the camp.","They could have left, but they knew that they couldn’t keep up with the speed of the special forces soldiers. If anything happened, the soldiers would even be implicated. No matter how the soldiers persuaded them, the two commissioners refused to go with them. Even the three accompanying students insisted on staying.","The reason was that they needed to take care of the two teachers.","The squadron leader sighed softly. The camp was temporarily safe. They would protect the two commissioners with their lives.","He had already applied to evacuate Yeni. It was up to the president of Libya to allow it.","It was all thanks to that group of comrades today. If not, the entire camp would have become a ’killing ground’. If it wasn’t for the fact that the materials were too important, he... really didn’t want the comrades who supported them to leave.","At 4:00 pm, the illegal militants who occupied Yeni received support. Yeni was in a state of emergency!","At 5:00 pm, the government forces, who had the upper hand, suffered another crushing defeat. Moreover, Yeni was completely occupied by illegal militants.","The camp immediately informed the Chinese mine that was more than 100 kilometers away from the camp and asked the Chinese workers who were still guarding the mine and transferring the equipment to leave.","Since the battle in Yeni started at 4:00 pm yesterday, the country had issued an order for the Chinese workers in the mine to evacuate immediately. No one should be left alive.","There were more than a hundred Chinese workers in the mine. When the main person in charge received the notice, he immediately arranged for vehicles to evacuate the workers. However, the Libyan workers were unwilling to leave.","The Chinese had invested heavily in the mine. The Libyan workers were unwilling to leave, so even the person in charge couldn’t leave. As he transferred the workers who were willing to leave, he persuaded the Libyan employees who didn’t want to leave. He swore to the heavens that once the mine started work, he would immediately ask the Libyan employees to come back and work. He even printed out the agreement... However, it was useless!","Until today, there were still 64 Libyan workers who were unwilling to leave. The Chinese person-in-charge had tried multiple times, but these people refused to evacuate until the illegal militants rushed in and aimed their cold and pitch-black barrels at the workers."]},{"number":4296,"title":"Chapter 4296: Very Urgent","paragraphs":["At 4:30 pm, the mine jointly developed by the Chinese and Libyan companies was occupied by illegal militants. All the Chinese and Libyan workers who didn’t have time to retreat were subdued by illegal militants.","There were 12 Chinese workers. One was the main person in charge, two were technicians, nine who had been moving away the important equipment. There were also 64 Libyan workers. A total of 76 mine workers had fallen into the hands of illegal militants.","Yeni had fallen. The Chinese peacekeeping camp in Yeni had been completely evacuated.","The squadron leader had lost contact with the mine. He couldn’t contact the person in charge of the mine who was still talking to him two hours ago. After failing to contact him several times, the squadron leader had a strong sense of foreboding. Thinking of the two classes that were sent to provide support, the squadron leader felt a little at ease.","After ending the call with the person in charge of the mine earlier, he immediately sent two classes to receive them. They drove over directly, and two hours had passed since then. They should have already arrived at the mine.","Although he thought so, the squadron leader was still worried. As he evacuated, he contacted the mine from time to time. There was no news until 5:00 pm.","The evacuation of the Chinese camp was not very smooth either. The government forces could not even take care of themselves now that Yeni had fallen. When they were evacuating, there were still injured people being sent to the camp. This made it more difficult for the people in the camp to evacuate.","After receiving the president’s evacuation notice, there was no way to evacuate.","\"Report...\"","The squadron leader, who was extremely busy, heard the exclamation outside the door. He put down the receiver and said in a low voice, \"Come in!\"","He still hadn’t contacted the mine. Things were getting more and more troublesome!","A soldier wearing a steel helmet and holding a gun walked in to report the latest news. \"Captain, another 12 injured civilians have been sent to the camp for treatment!\"","\"Okay, I understand. We’ll take them in for the time being.\"","The eyes of the squadron leader, who had a solemn facial expression, darkened. More and more injured people were being sent over. The United Nations Medical Center was already full. The injured civilians were sent to the medical centers of the three countries’ peacekeeping camps in Libya to be rescued.","Now, it was up to the United Nations.","The squadron leader, who didn’t have time to leave, received a call from the Russian peacekeeping forces in Libya.","Due to the tense situation and the fact that the Chinese peacekeeping camp was attacked by illegal militants, the Russian peacekeeping force sent a ten-person team to support China and transport some injured people to the Russian peacekeeping camp.","However, the squadron leader smelled something abnormal during the call with the Russian side!","There were a total of three peacekeeping forces in Yeni—Russia, the United Kingdom, and China. China and Russia often contacted each other and communicated with each other. The United Kingdom didn’t have much contact with them. Other than for official peacekeeping business, they wouldn’t reach out easily.","Even though Russia was on good terms with the Chinese peacekeeping forces, they had never sent soldiers over to support them.","Now, they suddenly sent soldiers out. Their intentions ran deep!","He didn’t know how the brother company was doing. Yeni was in chaos. He was afraid that they wouldn’t be able to move an inch. In addition, they had important materials with them...","Wait! Wait!","Important materials!","Only the Chinese camp was attacked by illegal militants!","Damn it!","The squadron leader’s facial expression suddenly changed. Even his aura turned cold. He didn’t want to disturb his brother company who had left with important materials, but now, he had to!","He had to know how they were doing and if they had encountered any difficulties!"]},{"number":4297,"title":"Chapter 4297: Urgent","paragraphs":["As he had guessed, the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade couldn’t move an inch. Although the peacekeeping camp was in the suburbs of Yeni, the territory still belonged to Yeni. After more than an hour, they had just left Yeni and entered the jurisdiction of the small town of Covil.","\"It’s good that everything is fine. Try to arrive at Covil as soon as possible. I just spoke to Lieutenant Colonel Fang of Covil. The situation in the town is still calm. A large number of government forces are stationed there. It’s relatively safe for you to enter Covil.\"","After half a day, the water ghosts’ safety became the best news the squadron leader had received. It was good that they were fine. It was good that they were fine.","After ending the call, the squadron leader’s expression relaxed. They were fine, so the special materials they carried were fine too.","Li Jinnian and the rest weren’t sure about the situation in Yeni yet. However, after ending the call with the squadron leader, Li Jinnian keenly sensed that something was amiss with the squadron leader. After some thought, he immediately contacted the Chinese camp in Covil.","\"There are too many illegal militants. The government forces have already lost the initiative. The entire city has fallen. Fortunately, you left early. Otherwise, you would’ve been trapped.\"","\"The president has informed Old Zhu and the rest to retreat as soon as possible. It’s been more than an hour, but Old Zhu and the rest haven’t retreated. They’re being held back by the injured civilians who were sent over.","Lieutenant Colonel Fang, who was in the camp of the small town of Covil, said in a deep voice, \"I’ve already sent a battalion to provide support. I hope they can evacuate safely.","\"Also, we’ve lost contact with the mine. More than ten Chinese workers stayed because of the Libyan workers’’ lack of cooperation. We can’t contact them now. We don’t know how the situation is. Old Zhu has sent two groups of soldiers to check out the situation. We’re waiting for their response.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Fang didn’t know that Lieutenant Colonel Zhu hadn’t told Li Jinnian about all the difficulties at hand. He thought that the company that came to support Lieutenant Colonel Zhu knew about it. When Li Jinnian asked about the situation in Yeni, he told Li Jinnian about all the serious matters. Before he finished, he said, \"The United Nations held an emergency meeting and sent members of the United Nations to negotiate with the leader of the illegal militants in Libya to mediate the war.","This was a domestic matter of Libya. All peacekeeping forces had to strictly observe neutrality and not interfere with the internal affairs of the country they were in. They also could not favor any party in the conflict. Hence, even if illegal militants were rampaging in the city of Yeni, the peacekeeping forces had no right to interfere. They could only send people to mediate.","The illegal militants made use of this point too. Hence, they rarely opened fire on the peacekeeping forces. Today, they opened fire on the Chinese peacekeeping camp. In the end, they were taught a heavy lesson. Their troops were cleared and defeated by the Chinese.","When the representatives of the United Nations were negotiating with the illegal militants, the other party deliberately hid this matter and never mentioned that they had opened fire on the Chinese peacekeeping camp. Now, a new force was mobilized and heading to the Chinese camp.","They received news that there were things more valuable than gold in the two camps of China in Libya. If they found them, someone would be willing to buy the things at a high price and provide them with a batch of excellent equipment, including heavy weapons!","This was the condition set by the other party. It was quite tempting. The leader of the illegal militants accepted the negotiations of the representatives of the United Nations while secretly sending soldiers to the Chinese camp.","The peacekeeping soldiers sent by Russia to support the Chinese camp had already arrived. Without resting, they immediately moved some of the injured out of the Chinese camp, including the four heavily injured Chinese peacekeeping soldiers."]},{"number":4298,"title":"Chapter 4298: No Way Out","paragraphs":["The soldiers sent by Russia communicated in English. Lieutenant Colonel Zhu’s English was good, so he could communicate with them. As for the peacekeeping soldiers, they couldn’t communicate well. They could only say some basic words.","Fortunately, they didn’t need to interact too deeply. Besides language, they could also use hand signals. This way, they could understand what each other wanted to express.","Four peacekeeping soldiers who were pulled back from the brink of death were carried into the car first. The Russian side considered everything and even sent an accompanying military surgeon. The Chinese side also sent an accompanying military surgeon and a nurse.","As for the civilians sent to the Chinese camp, some of them had been transferred to Russia’s camp, but not all of them. There was no choice. The Russian medical center was also overcrowded.","Very soon, the vehicles sent by the Russian side left with the injured. The ten Russian soldiers planned things under Lieutenant Colonel Zhu’s arrangements. With the support of the Russian soldiers, even though there were only ten of them, the burden on Lieutenant Colonel Zhu’s shoulders felt much lighter.","The transfer of the four heavily injured soldiers made Lieutenant Colonel Zhu feel more at ease.","The illegal militants were only targeting the Chinese peacekeeping forces. The reason was enough to worry Lieutenant Colonel Zhu. Fortunately, the most important materials had been transferred out. If they were really attacked again, they would fight to the death!","When the Russian reinforcements arrived at the Chinese camp, the water ghosts led by Li Jinnian knew how dangerous the camp in Yeni was. In addition, they had lost contact with the mine... Li Jinnian, who ended the call, was filled with killing intent. He didn’t say a word for a long time.","The other water ghosts were silent. They definitely couldn’t leave just like that. However, they had the special materials that represented the country’s hope. Should they advance or retreat? They were in a dilemma.","\"If we leave like this... more people will be sacrificed,\" Ye Jian said softly. Her slender hands, which were gripping the rifle, were exerting so much strength that the green veins on the back of her hands could be seen clearly.","On the surface, Ye Jian looked calm. Deep inside, a storm was brewing. She looked at the captain of the entire team. Now, she was waiting for the captain to make a decision.","After Ye Jian spoke, the team members, who had been looking down, looked at their captain.","The atmosphere was so quiet that it was oppressive. It was as if someone was covering their mouths and noses, making it especially difficult for them to breathe. They felt suffocated.","Azure Bird was right. If they left just like that... more people would die.","Demon King Li’s facial expression didn’t change when he was subjected to his team members’ gazes. They were still as cold as before. He said calmly to Big Prawn, \"Contact the country.\"","He was very calm, as if he could solve any difficult problem smoothly.","\"Yes!\"","Big Prawn nodded and immediately contacted the country.","The situation in Yeni, Libya was tense. The military had been paying close attention to it. Now, China had already secretly sent two special forces units to Yeni. One of them was the ace elite of the special forces. The 15 soldiers were equivalent to a camp. They would carry out an assassination operation and kill the leader.","The military was also very clear about the situation of the Chinese peacekeeping forces in Yeni. Also, Lieutenant Colonel Zhu had relayed his speculation back to the country, causing the normally calm Commander Xia to take action.","As it turned out, someone had their eyes on a batch of materials that needed to be transported back to the country!","\"Contact the Storm Commando Brigade and see where they are currently. Contact the civil transport plane that arrived in Yeni this morning to immediately return to receive the members of the Storm Commando Brigade!\"","Since someone had their eyes on the materials, the materials protected by the Storm Commando Brigade needed to be transported back to the country immediately!"]},{"number":4299,"title":"Chapter 4299: Storm","paragraphs":["Commander Xia gave the order and immediately contacted the Libyan Aviation Administration Center. At the same time, he contacted the Storm Commando Brigade.","Big Prawn of the Storm Commando Brigade looked at the code. After inputting the receiving code, he said to Li Jinnian, \"We have a message. They probably have arrangements.\"","One: Go to the town of Covil immediately and find a civilian transport plane landing point.","Two: The materials will be sent back to the country by the transport plane. The two electromagnetic specialists, three PhD students, and the interpreter will follow along.","Three: Send the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers back to the country. The members of the Storm Commando Brigade will go to the mine to rescue the workers of the two countries!","Four: The civilian transport plane will enter the sky above Covil one and a half hours later. The members of the Storm Commando Brigade must find the landing point within this one and a half hours.","The commander-in-chief of the navy had given his orders to the members of the Storm Commando Brigade. Commander Xia was the commander-in-chief of the army. He couldn’t directly issue orders across the services.","The new order and arrangements energized the members of the Storm Commando Brigade. This way, their problem was perfectly solved!","They received the satellite map of Yeni and the town of Covil. According to the satellite map and the information provided by the Libyan government forces, Li Jinnian found the most suitable landing point as quickly as possible.","It wasn’t the best, but it was the most suitable.","That was because they needed to go to the mine to rescue the workers of the two countries. In order to shorten the marching time, they chose a suitable landing point that was relatively close to the mine. At the same time, they considered that Commissioner Miao and the other five could reach their destination within one and a half hours and successfully board the plane back to their country.","Ten minutes later, the radar of the civilian transport plane that was returning to China as per the original plan was reconfigured. It completed its turn in the air and flew to its destination.","Lieutenant Colonel Fang, who was in the Chinese peacekeeping camp of Covil, received the latest order and immediately sent a troop of soldiers to a certain place in Covil. The peacekeeping soldiers of that troop would escort the two commissioners and a batch of important materials back to the country.","Lieutenant Colonel Zhu also received the latest order. He immediately arranged for a car and a troop of soldiers to escort Commissioner Miao and the other five to their destination.","\"We don’t need to go to the mine for the time being. The higher-ups have made arrangements.\" In a corner of Yeni, K7, who was wearing a mixed military uniform, said to Xia Jinyuan, who was also wearing a mixed military uniform. \"Let’s get rid of the malignant tumor here. If the matter there hasn’t been settled, it won’t be too late to go over and reinforce them.\"","Xia Jinyuan stood in a dark corner where the sunlight couldn’t reach. His slender and tall body leaned against the wall casually. Hearing that, he asked calmly, \"Did they say which company it is?\"","\"No, they just said that they’re strong.\" K7 shook his head. He, who was also standing in the dark, narrowed his eyes and asked with interest, \"Could they be our comrades?\"","\"Did you get kicked in the head by a donkey?\" Xia Jinyuan looked up and glanced at K7. The words that came out of his thin lips made K7’s heart hurt. \"Do you think the military has so many resources to spare? Why would they send two batches?\"","...","’Alright, you must be smart seeing as you’re the captain. F*ck!’","K7 shut up.","Several team members who heard the conversation smiled silently. Yes, their captain was right. K7’s brain must’ve been kicked by a donkey.","A black shadow flashed past. Right on the heels of that, another black shadow flashed past. One second ago, Xia Jinyuan still appeared lazy and casual in the dark. The next second, his eyes were cold like an awakened beast.","\"We found the nest!\" The eyes of the team members who were waiting for the news lit up when they heard the words of the black shadow. All the people stood up and stared at the black shadow who spoke."]},{"number":4300,"title":"Chapter 4300: Ace Elite","paragraphs":["Everything would be easier once they found the other party’s nest!","The scouts, Long Eagle and Sparrowhawk, had brought back news. The moment the blood-red setting sun fell from the clouds to the end of the horizon and night fell, darkness began to cover the entire city. Dozens of black shadows quietly flashed past the dark corners and headed for the port of Yeni.","The target was at the port. They were six kilometers away from the port. They would arrive in half an hour!","The special forces soldiers quickly started their combat deployment. The equipment brought by the Xueyu unit was several levels better than what the members of the Storm Commando Brigade had.","The heavy sniper rifle in E6’s hand had a shooting range of 1,500 meters. It was a 12.7mm M99. K7 had wireless equipment and infrared equipment. Demolitionists V8 and C4 and smoke bombs. Demolitionist G3 had a fire control system. T6 had a personal laptop...","Everyone was equipped with life support systems and weapons subsystems. It could be said that they were currently carrying the most advanced individual combat equipment.","They had everything they needed!","The ballistic calculator was turned on. Then, the electronic map of the entire port that Long Eagle and Sparrowhawk had reconnoitered entered the computer. Xia Jinyuan started today’s combat deployment.","The first thing he arranged was the sniper’s position. Sniper E6 and Observer Y6 quickly calculated the best position for a sniper based on the digital map and ballistic calculator.","\"The sniping position is also our path of retreat. After cutting in from this line...\" Xia Jinyuan scanned the electronic map with the laser pointer in his hand. His gaze turned colder as his face was illuminated by the weak screen of the computer. He said in a low voice, \"The coordinates of the attack point are 20 meters to the left of the port entrance. The retreat point is the port unloading area, Position A. E6, cover us and clear the heavy firepower.\"","\"I understand!\"","Sniper E6 and Observer Y6 nodded at the same time.","\"Blasters V8 and G3, cut in from here. Use ’King’s Water’ to melt the iron door. Clean up the miscellaneous things inside first.\"","\"Understood!\"","V8 and G3 exchanged glances and nodded slightly.","King’s Water was also known as King’s Acid and nitrohydrate. It was a very corrosive liquid. When poured on steel, it could melt it directly. It was a very common invasion tactic for individual combat.","King’s Water was very easy to decompose. It had the smell of chlorine and couldn’t be prepared in advance. It had to be prepared on the spot.","\"Long Eagle, Sparrowhawk, provide the distance of the route. I want the distance to be precisely zero! Do you understand?\" The distance of the route directly affected the success or failure of the entire combat. After Xia Jinyuan finished speaking, he stared at the two of them coldly and said, \"I’ll leave my fate in your hands!\"","\"Understood!\"","The two scouts nodded. They carried laser range finders and combined them with the wall-piercing infrared. They could do it.","With Captain Xia Jinyuan’s arrangements, the special forces soldiers hiding in the dark knew their position and how to cooperate with each other.","The laptop was closed. The screen light flashed past, and every special forces soldier’s eyes flashed with a cold and extremely vicious light.","\"Let’s go!\"","In the end, the order was given. All the special forces soldiers walked out.","The Xueyu unit and the Storm Commando Brigade had different combat styles. All the special forces soldiers in the Xueyu unit were elites who were good at assassination, sneak attacks, and decapitation.","As the most elite and unknown ace special forces soldier in China, even a platoon of soldiers couldn’t do anything to them."]}]);
